# game/chapter2.rpyc:33
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_79a9020c_1:

    # W "...up! Nienke, wake up! Rise and shine!"
    W "……起床！妮恩克，醒醒！太阳晒屁股啦！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:34
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_75d14fd1_1:

    # Nienke "Nn, mm... Wha...?"
    Nienke "嗯，唔……什……？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:38
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_98c0a12c_1:

    # "I feel groggy when I awake the following morning, not entirely of my own volition."
    "第二天早上，我昏昏沉沉地醒了。严格说来，并不是自愿醒的。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:39
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_bbd2660c_1:

    # "I was curled up beneath my sheets like a cat in a basket, lost in the world of dreams."
    "刚才我还蜷在被窝里，像窝在篮子里的猫，沉浸在梦乡。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:40
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_60fe28b4_1:

    # "I can’t remember what, exactly, I was dreaming about, but I imagine my dreams were far less offensive than what’s currently occurring."
    "具体梦见了什么已经不记得了，但想来也比眼下发生的事讨人喜欢得多。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:53
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2bd8fe77_1:

    # "I can feel fingers sinking into my skin and a bright, chipper voice only a few centimetres away from my sensitive ears. There’s another rough shake of my shoulders, and then..."
    "有手指掐进皮肉，一个欢快得过头的声音就在我敏感的耳朵旁边，近得只隔几厘米。肩膀又被狠狠晃了一下，紧接着……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:56
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_371188fc_1:

    # W "Come ooooon, Nienke! It’s Monday, which means you’ve gotta get up. You need to look lively!"
    W "快——起——来嘛，妮恩克！今天星期一，该起床啦。打起精神来！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:59
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1afa3dbc_1:

    # W "Aren’t you supposed to be at work? You’re supposed to be showing me the ropes!"
    W "你不是还要工作吗？说好了要教我的呀！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:60
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6cfd9382_1:

    # "I feel the fingers digging into my shoulders more firmly than before. I’m shaken with more force, like a rag doll, and I wince."
    "掐着肩膀的手指比刚才更用力了。我像个布娃娃似的被来回摇晃，难受得皱起脸。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:61
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3c182962_1:

    # "I’m so tired I don’t entirely remember yesterday’s events. It all blurs together, just like chalk pastels in the rain."
    "我困得连昨天的事都记不清。所有记忆混成一团，像被雨水淋花的粉彩画。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:77
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_516a5bc0_1:

    # "I blink, feeling more than a little groggy. Slowly, I lift my head, and then..."
    "我眨眨眼，脑袋昏沉得厉害，慢慢抬起头，然后……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:87
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7969841f_1:

    # Merel "Alright! Your eyes are finally open. I knew I’d be able to get your attention eventually, Nienke."
    Merel "好耶！终于睁眼了。妮恩克，我就知道总能把你叫醒。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:89
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f0af3588_1:

    # Merel "You can try as much as you’d like, but nobody can ignore me for long! I can be pretty darn pushy when I wanna be..."
    Merel "你尽管试，反正谁也没法一直不理我！真要缠起人来，我可是很厉害的……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:91
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b527e7cd_1:

    # Merel "Or maybe you could just call me annoying? Wahahaha!"
    Merel "或者，你也可以直接说我烦人？哇哈哈哈！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:93
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5021b20b_1:

    # "I find myself face-to-face with Merel."
    "我发现自己正跟梅蕾尔面对面。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:94
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_fe6bd74b_1:

    # "I’m used to Engelmund waking me up by sitting on me, then pawing at my face. He’s not exactly gentle, and he never acts particularly ashamed by his behaviour, but that’s to be expected."
    "恩格尔蒙德经常坐在我身上，拿爪子扒我的脸，把我弄醒。他动作可不轻，也从来不觉得自己有什么不对。不过，这也正常。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:96
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_54b679f4_1:

    # "Engelmund is a cat."
    "恩格尔蒙德毕竟是只猫。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:104
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_11f6fd9c_1:

    # "He doesn’t have all that many thoughts floating around inside his head beyond how to acquire more food."
    "除了怎样弄到更多吃的，他的小脑袋里也装不下多少别的念头。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:106
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_05fb8c14_1:

    # "Engelmund’s whole life is dictated by the rattle of his food dish; the divvying out of leftovers; the scraps that the van der Lindens continue to feed him though my parents have told them politely to stop."
    "饭盆的响动，分给他的剩饭，还有范德林登一家偷偷喂给他的零食——尽管爸妈已经客气地请他们别再喂了——这些就是恩格尔蒙德生活的全部。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:107
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ff7b157e_1:

    # "I can’t be too mad at Engelmund for pawing at me in the mornings because he’s a feline. He doesn’t share the same level of emotional intelligence as us elves."
    "早上被他扒醒，我也没法太生气。他是猫嘛，哪有我们精灵这么懂人情世故。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:108
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2e60fcb4_1:

    # "I can forgive Engelmund for interrupting my sleep with his selfish requests because, despite all of his flaws, he is at least cute."
    "他为了满足自己那点要求就打断我的睡眠，我也能原谅。毕竟毛病再多，他至少很可爱。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:110
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b5a3bc8e_1:

    # "I love him."
    "我爱他。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:112
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_86be19c6_1:

    # "My feelings for Merel, however, are decidedly lukewarm."
    "可对梅蕾尔，我的感情就只能说不冷不热了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:113
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8a3eede1_1:

    # "I don’t have any love to spare for her, so I can only groan when I see her."
    "我实在分不出什么爱给她，所以一看见她，就只能哼哼着表示不满。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:115
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d8e093c1_1:

    # "She might not have scratched my face like Engelmund, but I think I’d prefer that over her invading my personal space."
    "她是没像恩格尔蒙德那样抓我的脸，可真要选，我宁愿被猫抓，也不想让她这样凑过来。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:116
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_99bf0af5_1:

    # "Merel isn’t cute at all..."
    "梅蕾尔一点都不可爱……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:118
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f4db4ddb_1:

    # "Though I guess she {i}is{/i} good-looking, in a roguish sort of a way."
    "虽然她{i}确实{/i}挺好看的，带着点坏坏的帅气。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:128
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9511dbbd_1:

    # Merel "Now, are you gonna get outta bed, Nienke? There’s a whole load you need to show me!"
    Merel "所以，妮恩克，你到底起不起床呀？还有好多事要教我呢！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:130
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b8abddbb_1:

    # Merel "I’m lookin’ forward to helping out around the café, hehe. I’ve never worked in a café before, but I think it’ll be fun!"
    Merel "我可期待去咖啡馆帮忙了，嘿嘿。从来没在咖啡馆干过活，肯定很好玩！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:132
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_dbf70e6c_1:

    # Merel "I’m always down for trying out new things — and your mother said there was a uniform, too!"
    Merel "新鲜事我都想试试，而且你妈妈还说有制服！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:134
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7bb81edf_1:

    # Merel "I wanna try out a brand new look, y’know: maybe reinvent myself a bit while I’m here in Alpenrose. I might as well, since this is a brand new place!"
    Merel "我想换个全新的样子。趁着来阿尔彭罗瑟，稍微改变一下自己嘛。反正到了新地方，不如也试试新造型！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:136
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_620838e6_1:

    # Merel "It’s so different from Mors Paravail, I’m still tryin’ to wrap my head around it, hehe. It’s a lot to take in..."
    Merel "这里跟莫尔斯·帕拉维尔太不一样了，我还没完全适应呢，嘿嘿。要了解的东西真多……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:138
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_705c3fa6_1:

    # Merel "Oh, but you probably don’t want me talking your head off first thing in the morning, huh? I don’t wanna bother you!"
    Merel "啊，不过你应该不想一大早就听我说个没完吧？我可不想烦你！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:143
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e3c8e863_1:

    # "Hmm. Now, that sounds familiar. She keeps saying she doesn’t want to bother me, but it keeps on happening anyway."
    "嗯，这话好耳熟。她总说不想烦我，结果该烦还是照样烦。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:144
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3b09b899_1:

    # "I don’t think Merel is being insincere, but I’m not sure if she realises how much of a pain her presence already is."
    "我倒不觉得梅蕾尔是假客气，可她好像根本没意识到，自己已经给我添了多少麻烦。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:146
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_89095395_1:

    # "I guess she’s not that self-aware after all."
    "看来她也没那么有自知之明。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:148
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d608ef78_1:

    # "She might have even less awareness than the sunflowers we raised back in primary school. At least they knew to grow towards the sun for their own sake."
    "可能还不如我们小学时种的向日葵。那些花好歹知道朝太阳长，对自己有好处。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:149
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f2e725df_1:

    # "Merel doesn’t seem to know what’s good for her, however — or for anybody else, for that matter. She can’t seem to stop herself from making unwanted, unnecessary remarks, because she says..."
    "梅蕾尔却好像不知道什么对自己好，更不知道怎样才不会给别人添堵。多余又讨人嫌的话，她就是憋不住。因为她接着说……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:151
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d9932b82_1:

    # Merel "Really, though, Nienke, you don’t look too hot this morning. Your hair’s a mess, and you have these huge bags under your eyes!"
    Merel "不过说真的，妮恩克，你今天早上脸色不太好耶。头发乱糟糟的，眼袋也好大！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:153
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_cda5f2c8_1:

    # Merel "You took a while to get up yesterday too, but you look even more out of it today. Are you, like, really bad at waking up or something? Have I discovered your weak point?"
    Merel "昨天你也赖了好久的床，可今天看着更没精神。你是不是特别不会早起啊？难道我发现你的弱点了？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:155
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3498355f_1:

    # Nienke "Khh..."
    Nienke "咯……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:156
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_18be1286_1:

    # "I grit my teeth together, perturbed by Merel’s prodding of the verbal and the physical kind."
    "她嘴上不停刺我，手上也不停戳我，弄得我咬紧了牙。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:159
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_56869234_1:

    # "She’s leaning in, her eyes wide with an almost childlike curiosity. She dips her head, poking me in the cheek — {i}prod, prod{/i} — while I scowl."
    "她凑近过来，睁大的眼睛里满是小孩子似的好奇。又低下头，往我脸颊上{i}戳啊戳{/i}，我只能怒目而视。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:160
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e20e616e_1:

    # "I don’t want to be in a foul mood, but I can’t help myself. She’s being such a huge pain in the behind!"
    "我也不想一早就心情糟糕，可实在忍不住。她怎么这么烦啊！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:162
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_11aded75_1:

    # "I brush Merel’s invasive hand away from my cheek (who does she think she is?), then snap..."
    "我拍开她在我脸上乱动的手——她以为自己是谁？——没好气地说……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:163
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ac7f1c63_1:

    # Nienke "Yes, that’s right. That’s very perceptive of you, Merel. I am feeling rather tired this morning, and I know I don’t look my best, but do you want to know why that is?"
    Nienke "对，你说得一点都没错，观察得真仔细啊，梅蕾尔。我今天早上确实很困，也知道自己看着不怎么样。可你知道为什么吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:166
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b5c72d7c_1:

    # Merel "Why? I’m curious!"
    Merel "为什么？我想知道！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:168
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_36d268ab_1:

    # Nienke "Well, you don’t need to be curious anymore! It should be obvious! The reason I couldn’t get any sleep last night is because of you!"
    Nienke "不用好奇了！这不是明摆着的吗？我昨晚睡不着，全是因为你！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:170
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_01943804_1:

    # Merel "Me?"
    Merel "我？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:172
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c408faba_1:

    # Nienke "Yes, you! You’re the one who kept me up last night, Merel, because you wouldn’t! Stop! {i}Snoring!{/i}"
    Nienke "对，就是你！梅蕾尔，昨晚害我睡不着的就是你，因为你一直！一直！{i}打呼噜！{/i}"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:182
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_23ae816f_1:

    # Merel "Eeeeh?! Do I snore?!"
    Merel "诶——？！我会打呼噜？！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:183
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3bef9c69_1:

    # Nienke "Yes, you snore! You snore a lot, and you were taking up so much room in my bed, too! Do you even know how selfish you were being?"
    Nienke "会！而且打得特别响！还占了我的床那么大一块地方！你知不知道自己有多不顾别人？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:190
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f6a13937_1:

    # Merel "Well, um..."
    Merel "这个，嗯……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:192
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_312a3f54_1:

    # Merel "I guess not, since I was asleep and all. I had no idea what I was doing..."
    Merel "应该不知道吧，毕竟我睡着了。我哪知道自己在干什么……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:194
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ff3bc18b_1:

    # Merel "But it’s not like I was trying to bother you on purpose, Nienke! It just happened!"
    Merel "但我又不是故意烦你，妮恩克！不知不觉就那样了嘛！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:196
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b04d00cb_1:

    # Nienke "Believe me, I’m aware. I don’t want to blame you for it—"
    Nienke "放心，我知道。我也不想怪你——"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:197
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_803769d2_1:

    # "Not {i}too much,{/i} at least."
    "至少不想{i}太过{/i}责怪。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:199
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1a056515_1:

    # Nienke "—but try to think about my feelings for a change, why don’t you? Nobody wants to be woken up hearing that they look bad!"
    Nienke "——可你偶尔也考虑一下我的心情好吗？谁会想一醒来就被人说气色难看啊！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:201
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f282e1a5_1:

    # Merel "Well, I get that..."
    Merel "嗯，这我懂……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:203
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_03a0998a_1:

    # Nienke "Good. That’s all I wanted to hear."
    Nienke "好。有你这句话就够了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:205
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_819fea01_1:

    # Merel "But it’s true! I’m just telling the truth here! You do look pretty run-down. I don’t see why it’s a bad thing to be upfront about that."
    Merel "可这就是事实嘛！我只是实话实说呀！你看着确实没精打采的。我不懂，直说有什么不好。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:206
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ce394bff_1:

    # Merel "We’re friends, so it’s only right I should be honest with you. I don’t want to tell white lies, even if it’s to spare your ego, even if it is 06:00 in the morning!"
    Merel "我们是朋友，我就应该对你坦诚。哪怕是为了照顾你的面子，哪怕现在才早上六点，我也不想说善意的谎话！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:208
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8e912eb4_1:

    # Merel "As your bestie, I’ve gotta be sincere! I’m not good at a lot of things, but my honesty’s my best trait!"
    Merel "身为你最好的朋友，我得真诚嘛！我擅长的事不多，可诚实就是我最大的优点！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:210
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8cc54664_1:

    # "Urgh. What is she waffling about this early?"
    "唉。一大早的，她到底在胡扯什么？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:214
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_71db489a_1:

    # "I get she’s just trying to be friendly, but all of her yammering is going to give me a headache."
    "我知道她只是想跟我亲近，可再这么喋喋不休下去，我都要头疼了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:219
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_21b2a2ba_1:

    # "I wince, massaging my temples with my fingers. I can feel them throbbing alarmingly beneath my fingers, as though my skull is in imminent danger of exploding."
    "我皱起脸，用手指揉着太阳穴。指腹下面突突直跳，简直像脑袋随时会炸开一样。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:220
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e25960f7_1:

    # "I doubt anything that dramatic is going to happen, but that’s how infuriating it is to deal with her."
    "倒不至于真闹得这么夸张，但跟她相处就是这么气人。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:222
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5cfd91c3_1:

    # "I’m tempted to yell at her, but I suppress the urge. That wouldn’t be very ladylike."
    "我很想冲她吼几声，还是忍住了。那样太不淑女。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:224
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_18e48814_1:

    # "I inhale instead, trying to calm myself down. Then, I say..."
    "于是我吸了口气，努力让自己冷静下来，接着说……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:229
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5c4aaa02_1:

    # Nienke "I understand what you mean, and I {i}do{/i} think it’s important for friends to be honest with one another."
    Nienke "我明白你的意思，也{i}确实{/i}觉得朋友之间应该坦诚。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:230
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5b725286_1:

    # Nienke "I don’t necessarily think you’ve done anything wrong, but there’s a time and a place for brutal honesty."
    Nienke "我不是说你一定做错了什么，但这种毫不留情的大实话，也得分时间、分场合。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:231
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e27e96ed_1:

    # Nienke "It isn’t necessarily something I want to hear at 06:00, off the back of a poor night’s sleep and a full—"
    Nienke "昨晚没睡好，今天还得干一整天——我不想早上六点就听见这些……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:235
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_260c8537_1:

    # "{i}Shift of work waiting for me.{/i}"
    "{i}的活。{/i}"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:236
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c32068e2_1:

    # "That’s what I mean to say, but I can’t get the words out."
    "我原本想把话说完，却忽然说不下去了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:238
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0cabfb82_1:

    # "My voice dies on my tongue."
    "声音卡在喉咙里。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:239
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d9660b49_1:

    # "There’s a long pause."
    "沉默了好一会儿。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:240
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_10426580_1:

    # "Then, blinking, I say..."
    "接着，我眨了眨眼，问……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:242
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3bbd08a1_1:

    # Nienke "What do you {i}mean,{/i} it’s 06:00?"
    Nienke "什么{i}叫{/i}现在才六点？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:247
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2fdb4a71_1:

    # Merel "I mean what I said! I always wake up early myself. It’s in my nature, I s’pose, but I tried to wait a lil’ bit before waking you up. I figured you might wanna snatch some more Zs."
    Merel "就是六点呀！我每天都起得很早，大概是天性吧。不过，我特意等了一会儿才叫你，想着让你多睡点。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:249
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_004afdba_1:

    # Merel "Did I do a good job, Nienke? I didn’t get you up too soon, did I?"
    Merel "怎么样，妮恩克，我做得不错吧？没叫得太早吧？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:251
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9e5c1d85_1:

    # "I look at Merel in mute disbelief, my eyes wide."
    "我瞪大眼睛望着梅蕾尔，难以置信，一句话也说不出来。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:252
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_936b7050_1:

    # "Then, I turn my head to the clock on my wall."
    "然后，我转头看向墙上的钟。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:254
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ef72df4d_1:

    # "Sure enough, the clock corroborates Merel’s story. It’s 06:00 — or 06:03, rather."
    "钟表果然证实了她的话。六点——准确地说，六点零三分。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:255
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5f298069_1:

    # "It’s no wonder Merel came to wake me up rather than Engelmund. Not even he is sadistic enough to get me up at 06:00 on the dot. He at least gives me the grace of an extra half an hour."
    "难怪今天来叫醒我的是梅蕾尔，不是恩格尔蒙德。就连他也没残忍到六点整就叫我起床，好歹会开恩让我多睡半个小时。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:256
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_066e3087_1:

    # "She really is a piece of work."
    "她可真行。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:258
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c723db38_1:

    # Merel "Um, Nienke? Are you alright? I’ve not done something to upset you, have I?"
    Merel "那个，妮恩克？你没事吧？我是不是做了什么，惹你不高兴了？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:259
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_23b0e536_1:

    # "I glower at Merel in response, my eyes narrowed."
    "我眯起眼睛，狠狠瞪她，算是回答。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:269
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ecb246ba_1:

    # "Then, I pull my sheets around me like a shroud."
    "然后把被子往身上一裹，裹得严严实实。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:270
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_68088eec_1:

    # "Scowling, I lie back down on the bed — “H-Hey, what are you doing?!” — and reply with a clipped..."
    "我板着脸躺回床上——“诶、诶，你干吗呀？！”——只冷冷丢下一句……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:272
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ff3048f4_1:

    # Nienke "It is much too early to have this conversation. I’m going back to sleep."
    Nienke "现在谈这个太早了。我要接着睡。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:287
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1dad9351_1:

    # Merel "Ooh, wow! Wouldja just look at this place! It’s so cute!"
    Merel "哇，快看看这里！好可爱！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:288
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5a2a72a4_1:

    # "Merel beams as she looks about the café. She whips her head from her left to her right, her choppy hair fluttering around her cheeks, as she drinks her surroundings in with wide eyes."
    "梅蕾尔笑容满面地打量着咖啡馆，脑袋转左又转右，参差的发梢在脸颊边轻晃。她睁大眼睛，什么都想看个够。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:296
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8139e26d_1:

    # "We ate breakfast together about half an hour ago in the kitchen upstairs: me and Merel and my mother and my father, with Engelmund skulking at our feet for scraps."
    "半小时前，我们刚在楼上厨房吃完早饭：我、梅蕾尔、妈妈和爸爸。恩格尔蒙德则在脚边转悠，等着捡点吃的。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:297
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4277208c_1:

    # "Merel was very complimentary about my mother’s apple pancakes (she said they tasted ‘heavenly’), while my mother giggled like a coy schoolgirl and waved a hand in Merel’s direction in an attempt to ward off her compliments."
    "梅蕾尔把妈妈的苹果煎饼夸得天花乱坠，说那是“天堂的滋味”。妈妈笑得像个害羞的女学生，连连朝她摆手，招架不住这番赞美。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:298
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1a81bdc3_1:

    # "My father excused himself from the table earlier than the rest of us, so he could go downstairs to make a start on the pastries for today’s lunch rush."
    "爸爸比我们先离席，下楼开始准备酥点，好应付今天午间的高峰。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:299
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_93b7fce2_1:

    # "He almost tripped over Engelmund as he vacated the table, in a grim repetition of what happened two years prior."
    "离开餐桌时，他差点又被恩格尔蒙德绊倒，两年前那场惨剧险些重演。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:300
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a9da7072_1:

    # "His eyes widened in shock, and I watched him flap his arms like a giant bird of prey."
    "他惊得瞪大眼睛，两条胳膊扑腾起来，像一只硕大的猛禽。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:301
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2eae5aca_1:

    # "For a few moments, I feared he’d take yet another nasty spill, and he’d break his leg in another exciting new place..."
    "有那么几秒，我真怕他又狠狠摔一跤，在腿上找个新地方摔断……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:302
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c06014ea_1:

    # "But my father was able to right himself just in time."
    "好在爸爸及时站稳了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:303
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_eb10a879_1:

    # "Then, in my father’s absence, Merel began to chatter to my mother about the café."
    "爸爸走后，梅蕾尔就开始跟妈妈聊咖啡馆的事。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:304
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7512b3b0_1:

    # "She expressed an interest in helping out, just like she did last night, which leads us to the present."
    "和昨晚一样，她说想来帮忙。于是，就有了眼下这一幕。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:313
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e88adebb_1:

    # Merel "I love all of the floral patterns everywhere — and all of the vases on the tables, too! All of these little white flowers are so pretty! These are... lilies, right?"
    Merel "到处都是花纹，我好喜欢！还有桌上的花瓶！这些小白花真好看，是……百合，对吧？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:314
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e69f2f5f_1:

    # Elowen "Yes, that’s right! The name of our café, Fleur de Lys, means ‘lily flower’ in French."
    Elowen "没错！我们店名里的 Fleur de Lys，在法语里就是“百合花”的意思。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:315
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5d4538a2_1:

    # Elowen "My husband and I thought it would be fitting to model the interior of the café around these flowers, which is why the décor is mostly comprised of whites and yellows."
    Elowen "我和丈夫觉得，店里的布置也以这种花为主题才合适，所以装饰大多用了白色和黄色。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:316
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_cde77ee7_1:

    # Elowen "I think the colour scheme here is very light and refreshing: don’t you think so, Merel?"
    Elowen "我觉得这样的配色很明快，也很清爽。你说呢，梅蕾尔？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:318
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_05eb4be5_1:

    # Merel "That’s a no brainer, wahaha! This place is so nice and airy: especially compared to Mors Paravail!"
    Merel "那还用说，哇哈哈！这里又漂亮又敞亮，跟莫尔斯·帕拉维尔一比就更明显了！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:319
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3c8990fe_1:

    # Merel "Now, that place really is miserable!"
    Merel "那地方可真够阴沉的！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:321
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_af4befd1_1:

    # Elowen "Yes, I am afraid I will have to agree with your assessment there."
    Elowen "是啊，这一点我恐怕也得赞同你。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:322
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_12ffb25f_1:

    # Elowen "I did consider Mors Paravail my home for many years, and I was initially somewhat sorry to leave it behind me..."
    Elowen "毕竟在那里住了那么多年，我一直把莫尔斯·帕拉维尔当作家。刚离开时，还有些舍不得……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:323
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_454aaf37_1:

    # Elowen "But I do enjoy how spacious everything is in Alpenrose. I no longer feel quite so hemmed in as once I did..."
    Elowen "不过，我很喜欢阿尔彭罗瑟这种宽敞的感觉。不再像以前那样，总觉得四处都挤得慌……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:324
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e3970202_1:

    # Elowen "Though our house is rather small, I suppose. Fleur de Lys takes up a good deal of space, though I hope it is all worthwhile."
    Elowen "当然，我们家还是小了些。百合花占去了不少地方，希望这也算值得吧。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:325
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9c6d5df0_1:

    # Elowen "You seem quite fond of it, dear!"
    Elowen "亲爱的，看起来你很喜欢这里呢！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:327
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_97da17a1_1:

    # Merel "Am I ever! I’d gotten sick and tired of being surrounded by the darkness all of the time, livin’ in Mors Paravail."
    Merel "喜欢极了！住在莫尔斯·帕拉维尔，天天被黑漆漆的墙围着，我早就受够啦。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:328
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e97fb49b_1:

    # Merel "It was nice and homey there, I guess, but this feels like a real adventure!"
    Merel "那里是挺亲切、挺像家的，可来这里才像一场真正的冒险！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:330
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_cb8b01f0_1:

    # Merel "I’ve never been to a café before! It’s a breath of fresh air! Simply lookin’ around this place would be fun enough..."
    Merel "我以前还没进过咖啡馆呢！真新鲜，光是在这里看看都够开心了……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:332
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_74ef5c7e_1:

    # Merel "Buuuuut I don’t wanna hang back while you work your fingers to the bone. If I’m gonna be stayin’ here, I feel like I should pull my weight at least a little."
    Merel "不——过，我可不想看着你们忙个不停，自己却闲着。既然要住在这里，总该出点力嘛。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:333
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_42dbe751_1:

    # Merel "D’you mind if I help out, Elowen?"
    Merel "艾洛温，我可以帮忙吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:335
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3ac5bdbc_1:

    # Elowen "Of course not! I think it’s a wonderful idea."
    Elowen "当然可以！这个主意再好不过了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:336
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b08bf527_1:

    # Elowen "We could always use a pair of extra hands: especially since Cornelia went to university, and Willemijn is visiting her grandmother."
    Elowen "我们一直缺人手，尤其科妮莉娅去上大学了，威廉敏也去看她奶奶了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:337
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_727b904b_1:

    # Elowen "We were rather short-staffed until you came here. I was hoping you might volunteer..."
    Elowen "你来之前，店里实在忙不过来。我其实也盼着你愿意帮忙……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:338
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6b6af037_1:

    # Elowen "But I didn’t want to push you into anything: not when you’re a guest."
    Elowen "但你毕竟是客人，我不好勉强你。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:340
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9d95688b_1:

    # Merel "You can call me that, but I feel more like an intruder. I know I arrived pretty quick, without much of a warnin’, and I’m takin’ up a lot of space, too."
    Merel "您说我是客人，我倒觉得自己像个突然闯进来的。来得这么急，事先也没好好打招呼，还占了这么多地方。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:342
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ecaef6bb_1:

    # Merel "Your house ain’t all that big, and I’m just another mouth to feed."
    Merel "你们家本来就不大，又多了我一张嘴。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:344
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3334e7b9_1:

    # Merel "I appreciate your apple pancakes — they’re just as yummy as I remember — so I’ve gotta do something to repay you for your kindness! It’s only fair!"
    Merel "苹果煎饼真的很好吃，跟我记得的一样！受了你们这么多照顾，我总得做点什么回报呀，这才公平！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:345
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6578eb71_1:

    # Emiel "Only fair, is it?"
    Emiel "这才公平，是吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:347
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c965668b_1:

    # "My father comes loping into the café, a smile on his face. His shirt sleeves are rolled up above his elbow and there’s some flour on his cheeks."
    "爸爸笑着大步走进咖啡馆。衬衫袖子卷到胳膊肘上面，脸颊上还沾着面粉。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:348
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6c05e8bf_1:

    # "He must have been in the kitchens, preparing the dough for our scones and our varied pastries."
    "刚才他一定在厨房，为司康和各种酥点揉面。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:349
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c2a16b8e_1:

    # "That’s how we tend to do things in Fleur de Lys."
    "我们百合花平时就是这样分工的。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:350
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7ae47e39_1:

    # "My father prepares the dough in the back, and then my mother makes and bakes most of the goods: the delicate plaited almond twists and the raspberry danishes and all of our flaky, crispy scones."
    "爸爸在后厨备好面团，再由妈妈制作、烘烤大部分点心：精巧的杏仁辫子酥、覆盆子丹麦酥，还有一盘盘酥脆松香的司康。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:352
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9e0446cf_1:

    # "My father has only caught the tail end of my mother and Merel’s conversation, but he ingratiates himself into it smoothly, like a duck taking to the water."
    "爸爸只听见了妈妈和梅蕾尔谈话的尾巴，却像鸭子入水一样，自自然然就接上了话。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:353
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7b174c7d_1:

    # Emiel "You’re a credit to yourself, Merel! I don’t know what Bastian has been saying to you, but he’s done a wonderful job raising you. I’ve never known a more considerate young girl..."
    Emiel "梅蕾尔，真是个好孩子！不知道巴斯蒂安平时都教你些什么，不过，他把你教得可真好。我还没见过比你更体贴的姑娘……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:354
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c207378b_1:

    # Emiel "Apart from my Nienke here, of course! She’s a credit to us too, but I do appreciate that you want to help out, Merel."
    Emiel "当然，除了我们家妮恩克！她也让我们很骄傲。不过梅蕾尔，你肯帮忙，我真的很高兴。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:355
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f6d65b7e_1:

    # Emiel "You really don’t need to, dear. You’ll only be here for a week. Are you sure you don’t want to relax?"
    Emiel "但你完全不用这样，孩子。你总共才待一周，真的不想好好休息吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:357
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_dc1b561d_1:

    # Merel "I think workin’ with you will be relaxing!"
    Merel "跟你们一起干活，对我来说就是休息呀！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:359
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e4057a78_1:

    # Merel "You know what I’m like, Mr Faber. I’ve never been able to sit still in one spot for long."
    Merel "法贝尔先生，您知道我的。我从小就没法老老实实在一个地方坐太久。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:361
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_83f62960_1:

    # Merel "I’m offerin’ to help out ’cause I like helpin’ out. I wanna make myself useful! I’d feel real guilty if I sat around doing nothin’..."
    Merel "我主动说帮忙，就是因为我喜欢帮人嘛。我想派上点用场！要是坐着什么都不干，我反而会过意不去……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:362
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_78de7e77_1:

    # Merel "And it’s been years since I last saw Nienke! I wanna spend as much time with her as I can, which means I wanna help her work!"
    Merel "而且，我都好多年没见妮恩克了！想尽量多陪陪她，那当然就得帮她一起干活啦！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:364
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_cf4f66c4_1:

    # Merel "I always used to look out for her when we were kids, so it makes sense I’d try’n look out for her now! That’s how things have always been between us!"
    Merel "小时候都是我照顾她，现在当然也一样！我们俩一直就是这样的嘛！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:374
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_03438763_1:

    # Nienke "Speak for yourself..."
    Nienke "那是你自己说的……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:375
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1e514f94_1:

    # "I reply aloofly, my lips pursed."
    "我抿着嘴，冷淡地回了一句。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:377
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2b99cf26_1:

    # Nienke "You say you want to look out for me, but I have much more experience working in the café than you do."
    Nienke "你说要照顾我，可在咖啡馆工作，我比你有经验多了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:379
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_93fa6daf_1:

    # Nienke "Maybe you did look out for me when we were both children—"
    Nienke "也许小时候，你确实照顾过我——"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:380
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_cfcb5738_1:

    # "Though I can’t say I remember that."
    "虽然我不记得。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:382
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8cd00388_1:

    # Nienke "—but I’m sure I’ll be the one who has to show you the ropes today, if you insist on hanging about. Isn’t that right, Mother?"
    Nienke "——但今天你要是非留下不可，肯定还是得我教你。对吧，妈妈？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:383
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6634e1b2_1:

    # Elowen "That is what I was hoping, yes. Would you mind showing Merel what to do?"
    Elowen "是啊，我正想这么安排。你能教教梅蕾尔该怎么做吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:384
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a4e1cde9_1:

    # Elowen "I’m sure she’ll pick it up in no time, but it might be a bit much, throwing her into the deep end right away!"
    Elowen "她肯定很快就能上手，但一开始就让她独自应付，还是难了点！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:385
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_536448e0_1:

    # Elowen "It’ll be good for her to have somebody to guide her along. Would you like that, Merel?"
    Elowen "有人在旁边带着会好些。梅蕾尔，你觉得这样好吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:387
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4f68cb56_1:

    # "My mother doesn’t bother asking me whether {i}I{/i} would like that, or if I want to spend my time coaching Merel on how to do things which come naturally to me, but maybe that’s just as well."
    "妈妈压根没问{i}我{/i}觉得好不好，愿不愿意花时间把自己早就熟练掌握的事，一样样教给梅蕾尔。不过，没问也好。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:388
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a522db7b_1:

    # "If she did ask, I most definitely would have refused..."
    "要是她问，我肯定会拒绝……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:390
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_87b9af2f_1:

    # "Um, probably."
    "呃，大概吧。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:392
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_30ad6243_1:

    # "I’m not sure if I really have the heart to turn down a request from my mother: not when she’s always trying so hard herself."
    "妈妈自己总是这么努力，她开口拜托我，我还真不知道能不能狠下心拒绝。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:393
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e080dd59_1:

    # "I probably would’ve wound up going along with this, even if I don’t want to, because it’d make things easier. I know I’m just fooling myself when I try to say I’d turn her down, but it’s the principle of the thing!"
    "哪怕不情愿，我多半还是会答应，毕竟这样省事。我也知道，说什么一定拒绝，纯粹是在骗自己。但这是原则问题！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:395
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b490f064_1:

    # "My mother could at least have asked me about it..."
    "妈妈至少可以先问我一声嘛……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:397
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4ad5cd34_1:

    # Merel "Hehe. Well, I figured that’s how it’d work out. I’m sorry, Nienke, for being a pain!"
    Merel "嘿嘿，我就猜会这样。妮恩克，对不起啊，又给你添麻烦了！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:401
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5ab8d172_1:

    # Merel "I don’t wanna give you more work to do, and I really don’t wanna make your job harder. I actually want the opposite."
    Merel "我不想让你多干活，更不想让你的工作变得难做。其实，我想做的正好相反。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:403
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1176cb9d_1:

    # Merel "One of the reasons I’m offerin’ to help is to ease some of the burden off your slender shoulders..."
    Merel "我主动来帮忙，有一个原因，就是想替你这副纤细的小肩膀分担一点……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:405
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9a279093_1:

    # Merel "But I guess you will need to show me what to do first, so’s I don’t mess up. I don’t wanna end up spilling tea down all of the old ladies who come here, hehe."
    Merel "不过，为了不出岔子，还是得先麻烦你教教我。我可不想把茶泼到来喝茶的老太太们身上，嘿嘿。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:409
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b5b77014_1:

    # "I entertain an image of Mrs van Dijk covered in her usual Darjeeling, and I shudder."
    "想到范戴克太太被她常喝的大吉岭茶浇了一身的样子，我不禁打了个寒战。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:410
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f9d3099f_1:

    # "Dropping that cake on her yesterday was bad enough. I don’t even want to think how she would react if anybody spilled a cup of boiling tea over her."
    "昨天蛋糕掉到她身上，就已经够惨了。要是有人往她身上倒一杯滚烫的茶，我简直不敢想她会有什么反应。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:412
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_007c39bf_1:

    # Nienke "I hope you don’t spill tea down any of the old women either, for your sake."
    Nienke "为了你好，我也希望你别把茶泼到哪位老太太身上。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:414
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8a804bc4_1:

    # Merel "For my sake?"
    Merel "为了我好？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:415
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7312d959_1:

    # Nienke "Yes, yours."
    Nienke "对，为了你好。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:417
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_81584db2_1:

    # Merel "And not the little old ladies who’d get scalded?"
    Merel "不是为了那些会被烫到的老太太好？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:419
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4a2cae55_1:

    # Nienke "Well, it depends which little old lady you’re thinking of spilling tea all over. I wouldn’t do that to Mrs van Dijk if I were you, though. You wouldn’t want to get on her bad side."
    Nienke "那得看你打算泼的是哪位老太太。不过，换了我，可不敢泼范戴克太太。你不会想惹她生气的。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:420
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_71116f31_1:

    # Merel "Oh? Who’s this Mrs van Dijk?"
    Merel "哦？这位范戴克太太是谁呀？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:422
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2689f4e7_1:

    # Nienke "You’ll find out soon enough."
    Nienke "你很快就知道了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:423
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3c8f0831_1:

    # Elowen "She’s one of our regulars, dear."
    Elowen "亲爱的，她是我们店里的常客。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:424
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_45c161f1_1:

    # Elowen "She’s a kind woman, really — she used to give our Nienke piano lessons, and she was ever so patient with her — but she is rather old. She’s eighty-two now, or maybe eighty-three, and she’s rather set in her ways."
    Elowen "她其实心地很好。从前教妮恩克弹钢琴，可有耐心了。不过年纪确实大了，今年八十二，或者八十三了吧，有些习惯不容易改。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:425
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f20dc951_1:

    # Elowen "She comes here every single day for her Darjeeling and a few scones, or a slice of cake. I don’t doubt she’ll be here today, too."
    Elowen "她每天都来喝大吉岭茶，再吃几块司康，或者一片蛋糕。今天想必也会来。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:426
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_fbb2a4d6_1:

    # Elowen "She can be hard to please, but you just need to mind your manners with her."
    Elowen "她是难伺候了点，不过你只要有礼貌就好。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:427
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_393a4aa6_1:

    # Elowen "Don’t spill any tea on her lap, and you should be fine."
    Elowen "别把茶洒到她腿上，应该就没事。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:430
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7253b77e_1:

    # Merel "Yes, ma’am!"
    Merel "遵命，女士！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:431
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8bd25374_1:

    # "Merel replies, with a crisp salute which makes her look like a soldier."
    "梅蕾尔利落地敬了个礼，看着像个士兵。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:433
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_18b6d819_1:

    # "She grins then, nudging me in the side, she says..."
    "随后，她咧嘴笑了笑，拿胳膊肘轻轻碰我一下，说……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:434
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2f62e0b6_1:

    # Merel "It sounds like there’s some real interesting characters who visit this café. I can’t wait to meet them!"
    Merel "听起来，这家咖啡馆的客人都挺有个性嘛。我都等不及要认识他们了！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:436
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_244d6065_1:

    # Nienke "Well, we’ll have to see about that. I hope you don’t end up swallowing those words."
    Nienke "那就走着瞧吧。但愿到时候你别后悔说过这句话。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:438
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_76178960_1:

    # Elowen "Do you want to show Merel to the staff room, Nienke? We need to get a uniform for her."
    Elowen "妮恩克，带梅蕾尔去员工休息室好吗？我们得给她找一套制服。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:440
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_72903a82_1:

    # Merel "Oh, yes! I was lookin’ forward to this, hehe. Wearin’ a uniform’ll really make me feel like I belong here!"
    Merel "啊，好呀！我一直盼着呢，嘿嘿。穿上制服，才觉得自己真成了这里的一员嘛！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:442
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_44bb13b0_1:

    # Merel "Are the uniforms cute, Nienke?"
    Merel "妮恩克，制服可爱吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:444
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f9f4a55d_1:

    # Nienke "They’re rather frilly, yes..."
    Nienke "花边倒是挺多的……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:446
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8053a07d_1:

    # Nienke "But mostly, they’re demure."
    Nienke "不过，主要是端庄。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:448
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3b4f26e9_1:

    # Merel "Demure?"
    Merel "端庄？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:449
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d0fab3b0_1:

    # "Merel glances down at herself, her expression newly pensive. She smiles, scratching her cheek with her index finger, then says..."
    "梅蕾尔低头看了看自己，若有所思。她笑着用食指挠挠脸颊，说……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:451
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a9fdf985_1:

    # Merel "I dunno if that’s a look I can really pull off. I ain’t exactly a dainty maiden."
    Merel "不知道我能不能穿出那种感觉。我可不是什么娇滴滴的少女。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:453
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_978488c3_1:

    # Nienke "Well, you’ll just have to try. You can hardly serve the customers in shorts. They’d think it offensive: especially Mrs van Dijk."
    Nienke "那你也得试试。总不能穿着短裤去招待客人吧。他们会觉得很失礼，尤其是范戴克太太。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:455
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_975450d7_1:

    # Merel "Offensive, huh...?"
    Merel "失礼啊……？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:456
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c1788fab_1:

    # "Merel examines her thighs, which are plainly visible beneath the hem of her shorts. Then, she smiles."
    "梅蕾尔打量着短裤下露出的大腿，然后笑了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:458
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_25171460_1:

    # Merel "Is Mrs van Dijk the sort of woman who’d faint if she saw an uncovered ankle?"
    Merel "范戴克太太是那种看见别人露出脚踝，就会晕过去的女士吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:460
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_28dcf8a2_1:

    # Nienke "No, not quite. She isn’t really the fainting sort."
    Nienke "不，倒也没有。她可不是会晕倒的那种人。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:461
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_42e4ca6b_1:

    # Elowen "She seems more like the type who would hit you over the head with her walking stick for daring to be so shameless."
    Elowen "她更像是会拿拐杖敲你的头，问你怎么敢这么不知羞的人。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:462
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e9f1258c_1:

    # Elowen "Mrs van Dijk is rather good at lecturing people. She’s lain into me a few times because the scones I’ve prepared are too hard for her."
    Elowen "范戴克太太教训人很有一套。有几次嫌我做的司康太硬，还数落了我一顿呢。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:463
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ce69e8a2_1:

    # Elowen "I shudder to think what she would say if she could see you in those shorts, Merel! She’d think you indecent!"
    Elowen "梅蕾尔，要是看见你这条短裤，真不知道她会怎么说！肯定要嫌你不成体统了！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:465
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_71ea8c13_1:

    # Merel "Wahahaha! Well, alright! I’ll play along. I don’t want any old ladies hitting me over the head, so I’ll do my best to be suitably demure..."
    Merel "哇哈哈哈！好吧，那我配合！我可不想被老太太敲脑袋，会尽量表现得端庄一点的……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:466
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_87cea8e0_1:

    # Merel "Even if that is a bit of a funny idea, wahaha!"
    Merel "虽然想想还是挺好笑的，哇哈哈！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:467
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c23d4b87_1:

    # Merel "Where’s the staff room, Nienke?"
    Merel "妮恩克，休息室在哪儿？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:469
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_bb9ef481_1:

    # Nienke "It’s around the back. Just follow me."
    Nienke "在后面，跟我来。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:486
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_32d5ffd7_1:

    # Merel "Ooh, these dresses are so kyuuuute! They’s so sweet and frilly, and I love the little puffy sleeves!"
    Merel "哇，这些裙子好——可爱！甜甜的，全是花边，这种小泡泡袖我也好喜欢！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:488
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a035fac5_1:

    # Merel "Do you really get to wear this every day, Nienke?"
    Merel "妮恩克，你每天都能穿这个呀？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:490
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d556c781_1:

    # Nienke "That’s right."
    Nienke "没错。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:492
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_014d98f9_1:

    # "I answer Merel stiffly, my eyes narrowed, as I tie the apron of my maid’s dress."
    "我眯着眼睛，生硬地答了一句，同时系好女仆裙上的围裙。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:500
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_00ae6bdd_1:

    # "After coming to an agreement with my mother about working in Fleur de Lys, I led Merel (rather half-heartedly) into the break room."
    "和妈妈商量好在百合花帮忙的事之后，我就带梅蕾尔来了休息室，当然，心里没多情愿。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:501
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f771459e_1:

    # "It’s a small room, a little like a parlour, near the back of the house. There’s a wooden table here, and a few chairs, and some wicker baskets to put our belongings, and not much else."
    "休息室在房子靠后的地方，小小一间，有点像起居室。一张木桌，几把椅子，几个放随身物品的藤篮，除此之外就没什么了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:502
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7feb1540_1:

    # "My parents keep the maid outfits here, hung up on a rack pushed against the wall: all plain black dresses and frilly white aprons."
    "爸妈把女仆装都放在这里，挂在靠墙的衣架上：清一色朴素的黑裙子，配镶着花边的白围裙。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:503
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9ed3b438_1:

    # "I’ve been wearing these outfits since I was twelve, and I first started to pitch a hand at Fleur de Lys, so I’m used to wearing them. I can do up the buttons and tie the pristine white ribbon of the apron at the back without any issues."
    "从十二岁开始在百合花帮忙起，我就一直穿这种衣服，早就习惯了。扣好纽扣，把雪白的围裙系带在背后扎好，都轻而易举。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:504
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_366f0109_1:

    # "In fact, I could probably do it with my eyes closed."
    "其实，闭着眼睛我大概也会。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:505
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9f6cccd1_1:

    # "I could definitely handle a conversation with Merel, all while fastening up my dress..."
    "一边扣裙子，一边跟梅蕾尔说话，当然也不成问题……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:506
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0bff89ab_1:

    # "But I don’t."
    "可我没那么做。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:507
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1260a22e_1:

    # "I keep my eyes fixed firmly on the beige walls, my gaze narrowed."
    "我眯着眼睛，只管盯着米色的墙壁。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:508
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_bad9e264_1:

    # "It’s not that I find Merel so unpleasant I don’t want to look at her, though — or, at least, I don’t think that’s why I’m looking away from her so pointedly."
    "倒不是讨厌梅蕾尔，讨厌到连看都不想看她。至少，我觉得自己刻意移开视线，不是因为这个。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:509
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5c1cc2f1_1:

    # "I just want to give her some privacy. I mean, she is in the middle of getting undressed..."
    "我只是想给她一点隐私。毕竟她正在脱衣服……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:510
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c9178800_1:

    # "Or, at the very least, she {i}should{/i} be."
    "或者说，至少{i}应该{/i}在脱才对。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:511
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_68ddf03b_1:

    # "It sounds to me like she’s more interested in staring at the maid’s dress than getting changed into it, but I’m sure she’ll put it on eventually."
    "听动静，她似乎更热衷于盯着女仆裙看，而不是穿上它。不过，迟早会穿的吧。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:512
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2dde713d_1:

    # "She has to, if she’s as enthusiastic about working at Fleur de Lys as she claimed."
    "只要她真像自己说的那样，热切地想在百合花工作，就非穿不可。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:513
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f3a39f93_1:

    # "I don’t know why she’s so enthused about the idea, but maybe she wants to work here because it’s so novel?"
    "我不懂这有什么好兴奋的，也许只是图个新鲜？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:514
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_79d12f41_1:

    # "Working in a café might seem glamorous to somebody who’s spent most of their life living underground, in the dark and the cold."
    "对于大半辈子都住在又黑又冷的地下的人来说，在咖啡馆工作或许真是什么光鲜事。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:515
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_486c7ee6_1:

    # "Merel’s acting almost like a kid. She’s so enthusiastic, it might be enough to make me smile..."
    "梅蕾尔简直像个孩子。这股兴奋劲儿，本来都能逗得我笑出来……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:516
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_16188419_1:

    # "If I didn’t feel so tired after being woken up early, and so fed up into the bargain."
    "如果我不是一大早就被吵醒，困得要命，还烦得不行的话。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:527
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0f14bcd1_1:

    # "I finish putting on my dress, then ask Merel..."
    "我穿好裙子，问梅蕾尔……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:529
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3e781d8a_1:

    # Nienke "Are you nearly dressed? We need to go into the café to get everything ready for the customers."
    Nienke "你快穿好了吗？我们还得去店里准备，等会儿客人就来了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:532
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9552ced1_1:

    # Merel "Oh, right! Sorry, Nienke! I got so caught up lookin’ at the dress I didn’t try to put it on yet. I guess I got a little distracted..."
    Merel "啊，对！不好意思，妮恩克！光顾着看裙子，还没顾上穿呢。我好像有点走神了……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:534
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1f648bba_1:

    # Nienke "Somehow, I’m not surprised. That seems to happen to you a lot."
    Nienke "不知为什么，我一点都不意外。你好像经常这样。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:536
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8d108a92_1:

    # Merel "I guess you’re right! I have been driftin’ off recently, wahaha. I’m sure, if my own mother was here, she’d say I was away with the fairies..."
    Merel "还真是！最近老是想东想西，哇哈哈。要是我妈在这儿，肯定又要说我魂儿跟小仙子飞走了……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:538
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_db536b6d_1:

    # Merel "Or maybe my dad’d say that my head’s up in the clouds, all the way out into space!"
    Merel "换成我爸，大概会说我的脑袋飘进了云里，一直飘到太空去！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:540
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_74e7a7b9_1:

    # Nienke "Your dad, the bastion of all knowledge?"
    Nienke "你那位满载知识的“巴士”爸爸？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:542
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_09729ebe_1:

    # Merel "That’s right! My dad fancies himself as the smartest guy in Mors Paravail. He’s sooooo affected, with his glasses and all of his long hair."
    Merel "对呀！他自认是莫尔斯·帕拉维尔最聪明的人。戴副眼镜，留着一头长发，可——会摆架子了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:544
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_99af5adc_1:

    # Merel "He reckons he’s a genius, but there’s a lot about the world he doesn’t know about!"
    Merel "觉得自己是天才，其实这世界上他不知道的东西还多着呢！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:546
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d3288823_1:

    # Nienke "Such as...?"
    Nienke "比如……？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:548
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6c6d62ff_1:

    # Merel "Well, he doesn’t know the first thing about maid dresses, for one thing — or fashion in general, actually."
    Merel "比如女仆裙，他就一窍不通。其实不光女仆裙，他根本不懂穿衣打扮。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:550
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_19c2d6f8_1:

    # Merel "I bet he’d be totally stumped by all of these frills an’ ribbons, wahahaha!"
    Merel "这么多花边和缎带摆在他面前，他肯定傻眼，哇哈哈哈！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:554
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f13942d7_1:

    # "Merel laughs, while I roll my eyes."
    "梅蕾尔笑个不停，我则翻了个白眼。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:556
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_bd37a2c5_1:

    # Nienke "Maybe it’s a good thing your father doesn’t know anything about maid dresses. It’s not exactly a topic I would expect most men to care about."
    Nienke "你爸爸不懂女仆裙，说不定还是好事。我可不指望大多数男人会关心这种东西。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:557
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_cbb2cef3_1:

    # "...Well, that’s what I say, but maybe I’m being hypocritical."
    "……话虽这么说，可我好像也没什么立场。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:565
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_34a242d5_1:

    # "My own father is a bit of an aficionado when it comes to maid dresses, actually: the frillier, the better."
    "其实，我自己的爸爸就挺痴迷女仆裙的，花边越多越好。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:567
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_36cb617d_1:

    # "He has more of an interest in them than my mother does. He was the one who designed the dresses that the staff in Fleur de Lys wears, and he does all of the adjustments whenever we get any new members of staff."
    "他比妈妈还有兴趣。百合花员工穿的裙子就是他设计的，每次来了新人，也都是他负责修改尺寸。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:569
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7740e4e6_1:

    # "My dad’s pretty handy with a needle and thread. Maybe it comes from all of his years putting his dinky little ships together in their delicate bottles."
    "爸爸很会做针线活。也许是多年在那些精致的玻璃瓶里拼小船，练出来的本事吧。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:570
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_47f3ece5_1:

    # "He has steady hands, and he can thread a needle in under a split second. He never pricks himself with the pointed tip of the needle, either."
    "他的手很稳，穿针一眨眼就能完成，针尖也从来扎不到自己。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:571
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_17cb56cf_1:

    # "My father’s hands aren’t quite unwavering (I’ve seen his ships fall to pieces before), but he’s close enough. There’s something reassuring about them."
    "倒也不是稳到从不出错——我也见过他的船散架——不过已经很可靠了。看着那双手，就让人安心。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:573
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f3276d6c_1:

    # "He’s very deft, though he’s not particularly strong."
    "他的手很灵巧，力气却算不上大。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:574
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_fb429723_1:

    # "He used to pick me up when I was a small girl and spin me around, but he hasn’t done that in years. He says I’ve gotten too big for him, but I don’t know if that’s true."
    "我小时候，他还会把我抱起来转圈，可好多年没这样过了。他说是我长大了，抱不动了。但我不知道是不是真的。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:576
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_eddccc17_1:

    # "I’m not all that big. I think he’s just gotten weaker, and he was never that strong to begin with. The accident took a toll on him..."
    "我明明也没多大只。我觉得是他变虚弱了，何况原本就不算壮。那次意外让他受了不少罪……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:578
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3b1e951d_1:

    # "But he’s recovered well enough, and he’s pretty smiley now. Maybe things will be alright after all...?"
    "不过，他恢复得还不错，如今也常常笑着。也许一切真的会好起来吧……？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:579
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ffb70b5b_1:

    # "I’m busy thinking about this, when..."
    "我正想着这些，就听见……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:589
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8c679b40_1:

    # Merel "Oh, Nienke! Are you sayin’ that men can’t like sewing an’ fancy dresses an’ things?"
    Merel "喂，妮恩克！你是说男人不能喜欢做针线、漂亮裙子之类的东西吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:590
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_14bac05a_1:

    # "I probably shouldn’t say that, given my father’s hobbies, but..."
    "考虑到我爸爸的爱好，我似乎不该这么说，不过……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:592
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_78d64b19_1:

    # Nienke "I’m just saying that it’s unusual. None of the boys I went to school with were very interested in learning how to sew. They all said it was for girls."
    Nienke "我只是说不常见。以前班上的男生都不怎么想学针线活，说那是女孩子才做的事。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:594
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8f40c192_1:

    # Merel "Well, maybe there’s some truth in that. The men back in Mors Paravail ain’t all that hot about sewin’ either — or cookin’, for that matter. I think they fancy themselves as hunter gatherers!"
    Merel "嗯，好像也有道理。莫尔斯·帕拉维尔的男人也不爱缝东西，做饭也一样。我看他们都把自己当成狩猎采集的能手了！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:596
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_90c1560a_1:

    # Nienke "And your wise father? I imagine he doesn’t see himself like that."
    Nienke "那你那位博学的爸爸呢？他应该不这么想吧。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:598
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ce27e29d_1:

    # Merel "Oh, no, not him. He thinks that he’s a scholar! He says he’s different from the other elves in Mors Paravail: that he has ‘ambitions’..."
    Merel "哦，他才不会。他觉得自己是学者！总说自己跟莫尔斯·帕拉维尔的其他精灵不同，是有“抱负”的人……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:600
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_081fc595_1:

    # Merel "But if you ask me, his ‘ambitions’ mostly amount to him sittin’ around in fields late at night, lookin’ up at the stars!"
    Merel "可要我说，他那点“抱负”，也就是大半夜坐在田野里，抬头看看星星！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:604
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b7cea9e1_1:

    # Merel "I dunno if that’s all that impressive..."
    Merel "不知道这有什么了不起的……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:606
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e20bb80d_1:

    # Merel "But he has fun, and I’m glad he has his hobbies. It’s nice that he has a way to keep busy, hehe..."
    Merel "不过他乐在其中，有点爱好总归是好事。能找到事情做，也挺不错嘛，嘿嘿……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:608
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_67151a4f_1:

    # Merel "But, man oh man, is he missin’ out!"
    Merel "可是，唉呀，他错过的东西也太多啦！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:610
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_00c18d1e_1:

    # Nienke "On what...?"
    Nienke "什么东西……？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:612
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_739c041a_1:

    # Merel "I mean, there’s more to life than lookin’ up at the sky. It’s pretty, sure, but there’s a lot to be said for what goes on under our noses, too."
    Merel "我是说，生活里又不只有抬头看天这一件事。天是很美，可眼皮子底下的事，也有很多值得看呀。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:614
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9fdbc03e_1:

    # Merel "My father never wanted to leave Mors Paravail. He said all he needed was the sky to keep him happy, and my mother was content enough to stay with him..."
    Merel "我爸从来不想离开莫尔斯·帕拉维尔。他说，只要有天空看就心满意足了，我妈也乐意留下来陪着他……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:616
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c2aa2b60_1:

    # Merel "But he was so busy lookin’ up, he never thought to look down. He was never interested in Alpenrose, or all of the other villages and towns — or any of the cities, either."
    Merel "可他光顾着抬头，却从来没想过低头看看。阿尔彭罗瑟也好，其他村镇也好，甚至大城市，他全都没兴趣。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:618
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ab5a83ef_1:

    # Merel "I think he thought he was too good for it all?"
    Merel "我看，他是觉得这些东西都配不上他吧？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:620
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_662b2103_1:

    # Merel "He carved out his own little niche in the world, and he seems to be happy enough with it. He has his own interests, but they’re all up in the sky."
    Merel "他给自己圈了个小天地，待着也挺开心。是有自己感兴趣的东西，只不过全在天上。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:621
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_62610246_1:

    # Merel "He couldn’t care less about anything else: especially not cute dresses like this. He thinks fashion’s frivolous — but I know that has a rich history, too. It’s just not a history he cares about."
    Merel "别的他一概不关心，尤其是这种可爱的裙子。他觉得打扮是肤浅的事，可我知道，服饰也有很深的历史呢。只不过他不在乎这种历史。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:623
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_cd5b30c6_1:

    # Merel "Some bastion of knowledge, eh?"
    Merel "就这，还满载知识的“巴士”呢？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:625
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_dff5c60a_1:

    # "Merel chuckles and, to my surprise, I find myself smiling at her joke."
    "梅蕾尔轻笑起来。让我意外的是，我竟也被这句玩笑逗笑了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:633
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b4357325_1:

    # "I don’t know Merel’s father, but she has such a vivid way of speaking. She hasn’t told me all that much about him, yet I swear I can see him in my mind’s eye."
    "我不认识梅蕾尔的爸爸，可她说起话来特别生动。明明没讲多少，我却仿佛已经看见了那个人。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:635
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3a8f5a27_1:

    # "A man takes shape — not an old man, but not a young man either — with long hair a little like Merel’s."
    "一个男人的模样渐渐清晰起来，不老，也不年轻，留着和梅蕾尔有些相似的长发。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:636
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_52658f3a_1:

    # "He has eyes like Merel’s too: bright red like rubies and full of life."
    "眼睛也像她，红宝石一样鲜亮，满是神采。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:637
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_70c713e9_1:

    # "I can imagine this man talking like an excitable young boy, staring at the sky in rapt amazement..."
    "我能想象他兴奋得像个小男孩，一边说个不停，一边出神地仰望天空……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:638
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7ba6211a_1:

    # "But I can just as easily imagine the same man being distracted and distant — disinterested, maybe — whenever any other subjects come up beyond his immediate interests."
    "也能想象，一旦话题离开他在意的东西，他就会变得心不在焉，疏离，甚至是……漠不关心。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:643
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_da2f87c3_1:

    # "...Hmm. Maybe I remember more about Bastian than I thought. When I rack my brain, I think I can see a glint of light; the curve of steel. Did he wear glasses?"
    "……嗯。也许我对巴斯蒂安的记忆，比自己以为的更多。仔细想想，似乎能看见一点反光，一道弯曲的金属边。他戴眼镜吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:644
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5da55591_1:

    # "I’m about to posit this question to Merel, when..."
    "我正想问梅蕾尔，却听见……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:646
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0b44d478_1:

    # Merel "Maybe I shouldn’t be talkin’ about my father like that, though. S’not like I know much more’n he does when it comes to clothes, e-ehehe..."
    Merel "不过，我好像也不该这么说我爸。说起衣服，我懂得也没比他多多少，啊、啊哈哈……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:648
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_659ff87f_1:

    # Nienke "Oh?"
    Nienke "哦？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:649
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e499761a_1:

    # "I frown."
    "我皱起眉。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:650
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_181ff0e0_1:

    # "I’m pretty sure Merel’s been stripping off while we talk, because I heard her shorts fall to the ground and the distinctive sound of rustling fabric."
    "聊天时，梅蕾尔应该已经开始换衣服了。因为我听见她的短裤落地，还有布料摩擦的窸窣声。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:651
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a3630467_1:

    # "I’ve been looking away from her for her own sake, but now, I feel curious. Why does she sound so bashful?"
    "为了照顾她的隐私，我一直没往那边看，可现在有点好奇了。她怎么忽然不好意思起来？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:653
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3e4fe837_1:

    # Nienke "Is something wrong?"
    Nienke "怎么了？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:665
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8f7fa99f_1:

    # Merel "The zip at the back of my dress is givin’ me some trouble. I’ve been tryin’ and tryin’, but I can’t seem to get it done up properly."
    Merel "裙子后面的拉链有点难弄。我拉了半天，就是拉不好。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:666
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_266095c2_1:

    # Merel "I dunno what gives, but it keeps getting stuck!"
    Merel "也不知道怎么回事，老是卡住！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:667
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_077f0d2c_1:

    # "Hmm. I guess I should have known. These dresses can be a bit tricky to get on, because they don’t button up at the front."
    "嗯，早该想到的。这些裙子确实不太好穿，因为前面没法解开扣子。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:668
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_92a5c4f3_1:

    # "My father sneered at the thought of buttons (he thought they were distracting), so the front of our blouses are smooth. There are no buttons in sight."
    "爸爸对纽扣嗤之以鼻，说那会破坏整体感觉，于是制服前襟平平整整，一颗纽扣也看不见。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:669
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_35728561_1:

    # "To get these dresses on, you need to work at a zip at the back of the dress, but the zip can be a bit hard to finagle if you’re not used to it."
    "想穿上裙子，就得处理背后的拉链。不习惯的人，还真不好拉。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:670
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0b7057c6_1:

    # "You need to be able to contort your arms quite impressively just to reach the damned thing."
    "光是想够着那个讨厌的东西，胳膊就得扭成相当惊人的角度。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:671
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4fd0d28e_1:

    # "I’ve put these dresses on so many times that I could do it in my sleep, and the zips don’t pose any problems for me."
    "我穿过太多次，睡着都能穿，拉链对我来说自然不成问题。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:672
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_618dbe56_1:

    # "The same can’t be said for some of the other waitresses who’ve worked here over the years, however."
    "可这些年在店里做过的其他服务生，就不一定了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:673
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5ae329f5_1:

    # "Cornelia always used to have trouble putting her dress on, so I had to help her."
    "科妮莉娅以前穿裙子总是不顺利，得让我帮她。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:674
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a7a7166a_1:

    # "I didn’t mind doing that, but I’m not sure how I feel about helping Merel."
    "帮她我倒没觉得什么，可要帮梅蕾尔，心里就有点说不清。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:675
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9030c253_1:

    # "There’s something a little too intimate about the idea: especially given there’s quite a bit of her back on display."
    "总觉得这样太亲密了些，尤其她现在还露着一大截后背。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:676
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_da44d9a8_1:

    # "My stomach squirms uncomfortably..."
    "我腹中一阵莫名的紧张……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:677
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6c2afc11_1:

    # "But I’m aware all the while that I agreed to look out for Merel. I’m supposed to be showing her the ropes, and I suppose that includes helping her with her dress."
    "可我也没忘，自己答应过照顾她。既然要教她工作，那帮忙穿衣服，大概也算在内吧。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:678
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5ce955c4_1:

    # "I don’t want to get too close to her, but..."
    "我不想离她太近，可是……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:679
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_77410402_1:

    # Nienke "Do you want me to help you?"
    Nienke "要我帮你吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:680
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_bddccdfd_1:

    # Merel "Would you mind? I’d appreciate it a lot!"
    Merel "可以吗？那就太感谢啦！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:681
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2d7dbabc_1:

    # Nienke "Alright then. Let me see..."
    Nienke "好吧。让我看看……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:682
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_20b532db_1:

    # "I approach Merel, then frown."
    "我走近梅蕾尔，皱了皱眉。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:683
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_fa2d6bd1_1:

    # Nienke "It looks like you barely made a start on the zip."
    Nienke "这拉链看起来根本没拉上去多少啊。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:684
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a31e9bef_1:

    # Merel "Yeah, I know, though it’s not for lack of tryin’! I was working at the zip for almost a full minute before I gave up! You made it seem so easy, but I was gettin’ all out of breath, and I’m still sweating!"
    Merel "我知道，可不是没努力过！我跟它较了快一分钟的劲才放弃！看你弄得那么轻松，我却累得直喘气，现在还在冒汗呢！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:685
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a1d9e241_1:

    # Merel "Am I a dummy, Nienke?"
    Merel "妮恩克，我是不是很笨啊？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:686
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3a242011_1:

    # Nienke "N-No, um... This is my father’s fault for designing these dresses like this. I don’t blame you for this."
    Nienke "不、不是，嗯……这得怪我爸爸，把裙子设计成这样。不是你的问题。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:687
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1a75f619_1:

    # Merel "Oh, good! I was startin’ to panic. I didn’t want you writin’ me off before I’d had a chance to serve any of the customers!"
    Merel "那就好！我刚才都有点慌了。客人还没招待一个，可不能先被你判定没救了呀！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:688
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_955a4cd5_1:

    # Nienke "Well, I don’t have much faith in your abilities..."
    Nienke "嗯，我对你的本事确实没什么信心……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:689
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_635eb5ff_1:

    # Merel "Hey!"
    Merel "喂！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:690
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_af1ffdf8_1:

    # Nienke "...but you’ve not served any of the customers yet, like you said. You might yet prove to have hidden depths."
    Nienke "……不过，就像你说的，你还没招待过客人呢。说不定有我没发现的本领。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:691
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_61dadc40_1:

    # Nienke "Now, um... Stand there? I’ll try to get your dress zipped up for you — if that’s alright with you?"
    Nienke "现在，嗯……你站着别动？我帮你把裙子的拉链拉上，可以吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:692
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b4eba3c8_1:

    # Merel "Well, of course it is! I’m the one who asked for your help! I’d never be able to do this on my own!"
    Merel "当然可以！是我请你帮忙的呀！光靠自己，我肯定弄不好！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:700
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_fb07ffb8_1:

    # Nienke "R-Right, um... Of course. Let me, then."
    Nienke "对、对哦，嗯……那我来吧。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:701
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_00d52ed3_1:

    # "I eye Merel uneasily, almost like I’m examining a pony who hasn’t been broken in yet."
    "我不安地打量着她，简直像在观察一匹还没驯服的小马。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:702
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5cccdd1e_1:

    # "It’s hard not to feel uncomfortable whilst in the close proximity of somebody so pretty, but I already offered to help her."
    "离这么漂亮的人这么近，实在很难自在。可我已经主动说要帮她了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:706
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0736c00a_1:

    # "I can’t go back on my offer now. That would make me look weak!"
    "现在不能反悔。那样显得我多没出息！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:708
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_25d65113_1:

    # "I grit my teeth together in determination."
    "我下定决心，咬紧牙关。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:709
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_310144e2_1:

    # "Then, I zip up the back of Merel’s dress as quickly as I can, to obscure her back from view."
    "然后尽快拉好裙子背后的拉链，遮住她的后背。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:718
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d0e96e5b_1:

    # "I’m able to get the dress zipped up with surprising ease, while Merel gasps."
    "没想到一下就拉好了，梅蕾尔惊叹了一声。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:719
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_bbc48a25_1:

    # Merel "Ooh! Did you do it, Nienke?"
    Merel "哦！弄好了吗，妮恩克？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:720
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e2db3bc3_1:

    # Nienke "Not quite. I need to zip up the apron next too. Can you hold still?"
    Nienke "还没。围裙的拉链也得拉。你能别动吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:721
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_06e86110_1:

    # Merel "Aye, aye! You’re the boss, Nienke!"
    Merel "遵命！你说了算，妮恩克！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:722
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d0c7cdfe_1:

    # Merel "I don’t wanna cause no trouble, and I’d prefer to get zipped up into this dress before Michaelmas, so I’ll stay right here. I won’t make any problems for you: I promise!"
    Merel "我可不想添乱，也不想拖到圣米迦勒节都还没穿好裙子。我就站在这里，保证不给你找麻烦！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:723
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a15a2b48_1:

    # Nienke "You keep saying that, but it’s too late..."
    Nienke "你总这么说，可惜早就来不及了……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:724
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7d14c1d3_1:

    # Merel "What was that?"
    Merel "你说什么？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:725
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f3fc461f_1:

    # Nienke "Oh, nothing. Don’t worry about it. Now, let me..."
    Nienke "啊，没什么，别在意。现在，让我……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:726
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_603edc32_1:

    # "I clear my throat, my cheeks a little flushed (it feels like the image of Merel’s back has been burnt into my eyelids) as I start nudging at the zip of Merel’s dress."
    "我清了清嗓子，脸颊有些发烫——梅蕾尔后背的样子，好像已经印在眼皮里面了——伸手去拨弄她背后的拉链。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:727
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f608dc83_1:

    # "The zip is pretty stubborn, just like Merel herself, and unlike the zipper of her dress, it refuses to budge."
    "这条拉链跟梅蕾尔本人一样固执。刚才裙子的拉链还挺听话，这条却怎么也拉不动。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:728
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_396fcc93_1:

    # "It must have gotten stuck. Did she yank at it too hard?"
    "一定是卡住了。是她刚才拽得太用力吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:729
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a0c63cd4_1:

    # "I’m not sure if the stuck zip is Merel’s fault, or whether it’s the apron itself. My mother had to get a spare maid outfit for Merel out of the storage, and I don’t think it’s been used in a while."
    "我也不知道该怪梅蕾尔，还是怪围裙本身。妈妈特意从储物间找了套备用制服给她，应该已经好久没穿过了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:730
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4a68bb05_1:

    # "We don’t have that many employees at Fleur de Lys. It used to be me and Cornelia, and Willemijn, but Cornelia is currently at university and Willemijn is looking after her sickly grandmother in Leiden."
    "百合花的员工本来就没几个。以前是我、科妮莉娅和威廉敏，可现在科妮莉娅上大学去了，威廉敏则在莱顿照顾生病的奶奶。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:731
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a37ee517_1:

    # "We’re down two members of staff, and Fleur de Lys has been struggling because of it."
    "一下少了两个人，百合花也跟着有些吃不消。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:732
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_20038f19_1:

    # "Having Merel around should, ostensibly, be a help..."
    "照理说，多一个梅蕾尔，应该能帮上忙……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:733
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_51479420_1:

    # Merel "Hey, Nienke? Are you alright? You’ve gone pretty quiet back there, an’ my apron doesn’t feel like it’s been done up any."
    Merel "喂，妮恩克？你还好吗？在后面一点声音都没有，围裙好像也没拉上去多少。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:734
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d0fe32b3_1:

    # Merel "Are you even movin’ your fingers down there?"
    Merel "你的手指到底有没有在动呀？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:735
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_262ea0de_1:

    # "But I feel horribly flushed around her."
    "可在她身边，我总是脸热得厉害。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:736
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_bc7b51ac_1:

    # "Is it because she’s being so pushy? I’ve not met anybody before who was so determined to be my friend — other than Cornelia, I guess."
    "是因为她太主动了吗？我以前从没遇见过这么铁了心要跟我做朋友的人……除了科妮莉娅，大概。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:737
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e223dd28_1:

    # "Being in such close proximity to Merel feels embarrassing."
    "和梅蕾尔离这么近，总觉得不好意思。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:738
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3cf95a72_1:

    # "I can’t help but flush as I think about the curve of her back; the nape of her neck. Her back might be obscured to me, but I can still remember those muscles beneath her dark skin."
    "一想到她后背的曲线，还有颈后的肌肤，我就忍不住脸红。虽然已经看不见了，可深色皮肤下的肌肉线条，我还记得清清楚楚。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:739
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d8020fb7_1:

    # "I look away, my fingers trembling around the zip (“Nienke? Are you okay?”), and blurt out..."
    "我移开视线，捏着拉链的手指有点发抖——“妮恩克？你没事吧？”——赶忙脱口而出……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:740
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e5a509bc_1:

    # Nienke "Y-Yes, I’m fine! I just, um, h-had a bit of trouble unsticking the zip."
    Nienke "没、没事！只是，嗯，拉链有点卡、不好弄。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:741
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4734f9e6_1:

    # Nienke "I don’t know what you’ve done, but you’ve gotten it all jammed. It’s a pain to move it, b-but I’ve just about sorted it!"
    Nienke "不知道你怎么弄的，卡得这么死。拉起来很费劲，不、不过我差不多弄好了！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:742
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6c0d5502_1:

    # Merel "Oh, right. I’m glad to hear it, wahaha — and I’m sorry, Nienke."
    Merel "哦，那就好，哇哈哈。妮恩克，对不起啦。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:743
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d4edc4bb_1:

    # Nienke "H-Huh? Why are you apologising to me...?"
    Nienke "啊、啊？干吗跟我道歉……？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:744
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a939ee18_1:

    # Merel "For gettin’ the zip jammed! That seems like exactly the kinda thing I would do, ’cause I’m so careless!"
    Merel "因为把拉链弄卡了呀！我就是这么粗心，这种事一听就像我会干出来的！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:745
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_913d8626_1:

    # Merel "I wouldn’t say I’m clumsy exactly, but I can rush things sometimes."
    Merel "倒也不是笨手笨脚啦，就是有时太着急。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:746
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7f449a8b_1:

    # Merel "I get too excited, see, an’ I don’t take my time."
    Merel "一兴奋，就没耐心慢慢来了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:747
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f55176bd_1:

    # Merel "I was starting to worry I’d ruined this apron for good, an’ that’d be a real shame! It’s so cute and frilly!"
    Merel "刚才我都担心，把这条围裙彻底弄坏了。那多可惜呀！花边这么可爱！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:748
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5f95ba30_1:

    # Nienke "Oh, no, um... It’s alright. I’ve already fixed it, like I said. You don’t have to feel guilty."
    Nienke "啊，没有，嗯……没事了。我说过，已经弄好了。你不用自责。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:749
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_547875a8_1:

    # Nienke "Just... try to be more careful in the future, alright?"
    Nienke "只是……以后小心一点，好吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:750
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c541bd5c_1:

    # Merel "Aye, aye! I can do that!"
    Merel "遵命！没问题！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:751
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_fa69063e_1:

    # Nienke "Well, good. I hope you can: especially when it comes to serving Mrs van Dijk. I might be a merciful woman, but I can’t say the same about her."
    Nienke "那就好。希望你做得到，尤其是招待范戴克太太的时候。我还算宽宏大量，可她就不一定了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:752
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6d6bbed7_1:

    # "I finish zipping up Merel’s apron as I speak, all the way to the top."
    "说话间，我把梅蕾尔围裙的拉链一路拉到了顶。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:753
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8a8ea2fa_1:

    # "Then, I adjust the hem of her dress, trying not to brush my fingers against Merel’s thighs (i-it’s not like I want to feel her muscles or anything!), and take a sharp step back."
    "又替她整理好裙摆，努力不让手指碰到她的大腿——我、我才不是想摸她的肌肉什么的！——然后飞快地退了一步。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:764
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d2d992de_1:

    # Merel "Whew! I’ve finally gotten this stupid thing on."
    Merel "呼！可算把这讨厌的东西穿上了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:765
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c2826548_1:

    # Merel "Thanks, Nienke! You’ve been a huge help!"
    Merel "谢谢你，妮恩克！帮大忙啦！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:767
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b78e57a5_1:

    # Nienke "It’s no problem..."
    Nienke "没什么……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:769
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ee5ce641_1:

    # Nienke "Or, well, I’d like to say that, but it was a {i}bit{/i} of a problem. I still think it would be for the best if you knew how to put your own clothes on..."
    Nienke "嗯，本来是想这么说的，可也确实{i}有点{/i}麻烦。我还是觉得，自己的衣服最好能自己穿……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:771
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_942418b6_1:

    # Nienke "But we can work on it, I suppose."
    Nienke "不过，这个可以慢慢学。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:773
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d4b72866_1:

    # Nienke "Just don’t ask me for anything else today. I think I’ve done enough favours for you already!"
    Nienke "今天可别再提别的要求了。我帮你的忙已经够多了！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:776
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5b11f4ff_1:

    # Merel "What? But Nienke! You can’t abandon me now! You’ve still gotta show me around, remember?"
    Merel "啊？可是妮恩克！现在可不能丢下我呀！你还得带我熟悉工作，记得吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:778
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4450ace5_1:

    # Nienke "Hmph..."
    Nienke "哼……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:780
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d678f0d5_1:

    # "I pout."
    "我噘起嘴。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:781
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_697d2881_1:

    # "I wish it wasn’t the case (my heart is still feeling a little fluttery after doing up the back of Merel’s dress), but she is right."
    "虽然很不愿意承认——刚才帮她拉裙子，弄得我到现在还有点心慌——可她说得对。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:783
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_981a02e2_1:

    # Nienke "Okay, fine. I can tell you where all of the cleaning supplies are, and I can give you the run through of what you’re supposed to say to the customers."
    Nienke "好吧好吧。我可以告诉你清洁用品放在哪儿，再教你该怎么跟客人说话。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:785
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b8e3e2d4_1:

    # Nienke "We don’t have that much time left now, since the place will open in ten minutes, but I should be able to tell you enough for you to get by."
    Nienke "再过十分钟就开门，时间不多了。不过，应该来得及教会你最基本的。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:786
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_22bc5ef5_1:

    # Nienke "How does that sound?"
    Nienke "这样可以吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:788
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_01de1277_1:

    # Merel "Aye, aye, Captain! That sounds perfect!"
    Merel "遵命，船长！再好不过啦！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:790
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_fc712799_1:

    # Merel "Just tell me what you want me to do, and I’ll do my best! I’m always workin’ hard!"
    Merel "你让我做什么，尽管说，我一定尽力！我一向很努力的！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:792
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e590852f_1:

    # Nienke "Well, we’ll just see about that."
    Nienke "那就等着看吧。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:794
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0bf2d374_1:

    # Nienke "...Now, come on. There’s no point hanging about, wasting time. It is of the essence, or so I have heard."
    Nienke "……好了，走吧。站在这里浪费时间也没意义。人家不都说，时间宝贵吗。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:796
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_bc2651f8_1:

    # Merel "You too, huh? That’s one of my father’s favourite sayings, hehe. Now, let’s get this show on the road!"
    Merel "你也听过呀？这可是我爸最爱说的话之一，嘿嘿。那我们开工吧！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:810
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c4a8d258_1:

    # "I spent the next ten minutes giving Merel some quick, rapid-fire instructions on how to run the café, but I’m afraid I’ve not done a very thorough job. It’s not like I have much time."
    "接下来的十分钟，我连珠炮似的给梅蕾尔讲了咖啡馆的工作要领。可惜时间太少，恐怕讲得算不上周全。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:811
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3e4b8777_1:

    # "09:00 rolls around pretty quickly, and when it does, the café opens for business."
    "转眼就到了九点，咖啡馆正式开门营业。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:813
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_fdf98ecc_1:

    # "I do worry, initially, whether Merel will be able to keep up with the hustle and bustle of it all..."
    "起初，我还有点担心，她能不能应付店里的忙碌……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:814
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4e509103_1:

    # "But despite my misgivings, she seems to be doing alright."
    "不过，看来是我多虑了，她做得还不错。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:815
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b341a4c6_1:

    # "In fact, I think Merel might be doing better than just ‘alright’."
    "说真的，或许还不止“不错”。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:819
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b460f384_1:

    # "She’s been wandering about the café in her sensible black dress, the equally sensible white apron draped on top, as she tends to the customers."
    "她穿着规规矩矩的黑裙子，外面罩着同样规矩的白围裙，在店里来回走动，招待客人。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:820
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_88cb6d05_1:

    # "Initially, she hung back, watching how I interacted with the steady trickle of customers which ebbed and flowed in and out of the café, but she’s definitely built her confidence now."
    "一开始，她还站在后面，看我怎样应对陆续进出咖啡馆的客人。如今却明显有了信心。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:821
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_733846b6_1:

    # "She approaches the customers with a smile on her face: one so wide and bright her teeth sparkle in the lights of Fleur de Lys."
    "她笑着走向客人，笑容又大又灿烂，连牙齿都在百合花的灯光下闪闪发亮。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:830
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8fca74fe_1:

    # Merel "Hello there, my valued customers! My name is Merel, and I’m gonna be workin’ here this week!"
    Merel "各位贵客，你们好呀！我叫梅蕾尔，这一周都会在这里工作！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:832
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_cfe2d389_1:

    # Merel "It’s real nice to meet all of you, hehe. I’m here to serve, and I’m happy to make myself useful!"
    Merel "很高兴认识大家，嘿嘿。我是来为大家服务的，能帮上忙就开心啦！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:834
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_475e891a_1:

    # Merel "Please, let me show you to your table — and do you want a menu? I can get that for you right away!"
    Merel "来，我带你们入座。需要菜单吗？我马上拿来！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:836
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0699baaa_1:

    # Merel "Now, what do you want to eat? To drink? Please, let me take your orders. I’ll try’n get ’em filled double quick, wahaha!"
    Merel "想吃点什么？喝点什么？我来替你们点单，争取用最快的速度送上来，哇哈哈！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:838
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_190f7928_1:

    # "Merel dashes about the shop hither and thither like a hurricane, never once pausing. She’s so light on her feet, she positively looks like she’s floating."
    "梅蕾尔像一阵旋风，在店里跑来跑去，片刻不停。她脚步轻快得像是在飘。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:840
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_aa1ad381_1:

    # "I did worry, initially, that Merel’s enthusiasm might put most of the customers off — the clientele of Fleur de Lys does tend to skew pretty old — but that doesn’t seem to be the case."
    "起初，我担心她这么热情会让多数客人吃不消，毕竟百合花的客人年纪普遍偏大。不过，似乎并没有。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:841
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_fe4c6746_1:

    # "Instead, the customers are all smiling at Merel in apparent amusement. They seem to find her entertaining: maybe because she’s so bold and brash."
    "相反，大家都笑眯眯地看着她，显然被逗乐了。或许就是她这股大方又莽撞的劲儿，让人觉得有趣。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:843
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_fd2d0929_1:

    # "Merel is a little bit like Cornelia, I think — she was always energetic too — but she’s even bubblier than she is."
    "我觉得梅蕾尔有点像科妮莉娅。科妮莉娅也总是精力十足，但梅蕾尔比她还要活泼。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:844
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_85d1df90_1:

    # "It’s almost impossible not to be drawn to Merel. She’s acting like she’s in her element."
    "想不被她吸引都难。她在这里简直如鱼得水。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:845
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6940ee40_1:

    # "I’m starting to feel cautiously optimistic that Merel might actually be able to aid me..."
    "我开始谨慎地期待，也许她真的能帮我分担一些……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:857
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_06fd643f_1:

    # W "Now, what is this racket? Who in the world is this?"
    W "怎么这么吵？这到底是谁啊？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:858
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_476ea555_1:

    # "But a crotchety voice soon draws me from my inner monologue."
    "一个不耐烦的声音，很快打断了我的思绪。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:862
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_311424fb_1:

    # "Mrs van Dijk has arrived, like she always does."
    "范戴克太太和往常一样来了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:863
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_184ab522_1:

    # "I wonder what she’ll say to Merel. Will she take against her?"
    "她会怎么评价梅蕾尔呢？会不喜欢她吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:864
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0c84a066_1:

    # "I don’t believe that Mrs van Dijk will scorn Merel for her appearance, though some people might (Hendrik included), but perhaps she’ll scold her for her cheery way of talking."
    "我倒不觉得她会因为梅蕾尔的外貌就看不起她，虽然亨德里克之类的人可能会。不过，梅蕾尔说话这么欢脱，她或许要训几句。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:865
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a5aea675_1:

    # "Merel might have been able to win everybody else over, but I doubt it’ll be so easy with Mrs van Dijk."
    "梅蕾尔是讨了其他所有人的喜欢，但面对范戴克太太，恐怕就没这么容易了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:866
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4525425c_1:

    # "It seems almost inevitable that Mrs van Dijk will take against Merel at once. She takes against everything that’s new. She’s still mistrustful of telephones, for goodness’ sake..."
    "她一见梅蕾尔就不顺眼，似乎才是理所当然的。她一向看不惯新事物。老天，她到现在连电话都信不过呢……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:867
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_36589c0a_1:

    # "But, to my surprise, Mrs van Dijk doesn’t scowl at Merel. She doesn’t even look perturbed. Her blue eyes look softer than usual, and slightly less piercing, as she says..."
    "然而，出乎意料，她并没有瞪梅蕾尔，甚至没显出半点不高兴。蓝眼睛比平时柔和，也没那么锐利了。她开口道……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:869
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4d2e99d0_1:

    # VD "I don’t think I’ve seen you around here before. Are you a new employee here?"
    VD "以前好像没在这里见过你。新来的员工吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:879
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_72b814b6_1:

    # Merel "That’s right! I’ll only be here for a week, but I’m lookin’ forward to helpin’ out, wahaha~!"
    Merel "是呀！我只待一周，不过很期待在这里帮忙，哇哈哈～！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:881
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_87cfd3f4_1:

    # VD "A week, is it? I see. That’s not very long at all."
    VD "一周，是吗？这样啊。那可真够短的。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:883
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ee244afd_1:

    # VD "Why are you here for such a short amount of time? Don’t tell me Emiel can’t afford to pay you for more than that!"
    VD "怎么只做这么点时间？别告诉我，埃米尔连多雇你几天的工资都付不起！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:891
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7a76c96f_1:

    # "Hmph. I can’t help but scowl at this slight."
    "哼。听见这句挖苦，我忍不住沉下脸。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:893
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_537982e7_1:

    # "It’s true that Fleur de Lys isn’t all that successful, and my parents don’t earn all that much money, but Mrs van Dijk doesn’t need to come out and say it!"
    "百合花的生意是没那么红火，爸妈赚的钱也不多，可她也不用直接说出来啊！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:895
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3dbc57c5_1:

    # "It doesn’t matter that she’s a regular customer, or that she often tips handsomely. It’s still rude!"
    "就算是常客，就算常常给很丰厚的小费，这话也一样没礼貌！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:896
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_37775442_1:

    # "It’s not like my parents’ financials are so woeful that they can’t afford to pay a new part-timer!"
    "爸妈的经济状况又没糟到连一个新兼职都雇不起！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:898
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a8c91775_1:

    # "In fact, we do have another part-timer. We still have Willemijn, even if she’s been staying with her grandmother recently."
    "再说，我们本来就还有兼职员工。威廉敏只是最近在奶奶家住着，又不是不做了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:899
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_639cc8bd_1:

    # "We didn’t let her go because of financial concerns. She’ll be back soon enough, so we really don’t need any more employees."
    "我们没有因为钱的问题辞退她。她很快就会回来，根本用不着再招人。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:901
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ee8869d9_1:

    # "Sure, I’ve been rushed off my feet recently, and sure, waiting all of these tables on my own has been a bit tricky, but we’re making do! Everything’s fine!"
    "没错，我最近确实忙得脚不沾地，一个人照顾这么多桌也确实有点吃力，可我们应付得来！一切都好！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:903
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d2b609b1_1:

    # "I’m tempted to tell Mrs van Dijk all of this, if it’ll stop her from being so smugly self-satisfied, but I’m afraid I’d sound defensive."
    "真想把这些话全告诉范戴克太太，省得她那么自以为是。可又怕听起来像是在急着辩解。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:904
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_20d35fbe_1:

    # "I don’t want to give her more reasons to pity me — and anyway, Merel is more than capable of replying for herself."
    "我不想再给她可怜我的理由。再说，梅蕾尔完全能自己回答。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:914
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7740ad9d_1:

    # Merel "Oh, no, it’s not the money! The Fabers have been really good to me!"
    Merel "啊，不是，不是钱的问题！法贝尔一家对我可好啦！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:916
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b733f10e_1:

    # Merel "They’re paying me pretty well, in fact, for this week, even though I said they didn’t have to bother! I mean, it’s not like they ever officially hired me!"
    Merel "其实，这一周给我的报酬还挺丰厚呢，明明我说过不用的！毕竟他们又没正式雇我嘛！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:918
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6ee482c6_1:

    # VD "They didn’t?"
    VD "没雇你？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:920
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_495dc2fe_1:

    # Merel "Nope! I didn’t come here to work. I came here to spend time with Nienke instead, ’cause we’re friends..."
    Merel "没有！我来这里不是为了工作，是来陪妮恩克的。我们是朋友呀……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:922
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_256eb553_1:

    # Merel "Or, at least, we were. It’s been a while since we last saw one another, but I’ve been lookin’ forward to seein’ her again, wahaha~"
    Merel "至少以前是。上次见面已经是很久以前的事了，不过我一直盼着能再见到她，哇哈哈～"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:924
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5b0134fd_1:

    # Merel "She’s very dear to me!"
    Merel "她对我来说非常重要！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:926
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f3467f8c_1:

    # VD "Really, now? I see..."
    VD "哦，是吗？原来如此……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:928
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_36bc4a8a_1:

    # "Mrs van Dijk nods thoughtfully, still massaging her chin with one ropey hand."
    "范戴克太太若有所思地点点头，一只青筋浮起的手还在揉着下巴。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:930
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7c3be6b8_1:

    # VD "I must say, this is unexpected."
    VD "这倒真让我意外。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:942
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2503330b_1:

    # Nienke "In what sense?"
    Nienke "哪里意外？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:944
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2503fece_1:

    # VD "You’ve not mentioned this Merel girl to me before, Nienke. I’ve known you for a long while: ever since you were this tall—"
    VD "妮恩克，你以前可没提过这位梅蕾尔。我认识你好多年了，你才这么高的时候，我就认识你——"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:945
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c6fd34b6_1:

    # "Mrs van Dijk gestures with her right hand."
    "范戴克太太抬起右手，比画了一下。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:947
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_347e5a1f_1:

    # VD "—but she never came up in conversation."
    VD "——可从没听你聊起她。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:949
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_957298c0_1:

    # VD "I imagine she might have done, if the pair of you were that close, but perhaps not?"
    VD "要是真有这么亲近，我想总该提过吧。难道不是？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:951
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_46c5c9a4_1:

    # Merel "Well, we were friends, but this was a long time ago. I don’t think Nienke remembers me, it’s been so long since we last hung out, but I remember her!"
    Merel "我们确实是朋友，不过那都是很久以前的事啦。太久没一起玩，妮恩克大概已经不记得我了，可我记得她！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:952
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_923171fb_1:

    # VD "Do you, indeed?"
    VD "哦，真的？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:954
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_73a13b7b_1:

    # Merel "That’s right! She’ll always be dear to me, whether she remembers me or not! It’s more important that I remember — and I know she’s still my dear Nienke!"
    Merel "当然！不管她记不记得我，她对我都一样重要！要紧的是我还记得，也知道她还是我亲爱的妮恩克！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:956
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_bc0e3c28_1:

    # Merel "I’m really lookin’ forward to spending more time with her, even if she’s not all that stoked to be spendin’ time with me."
    Merel "我真的很期待多陪陪她，就算她不怎么期待跟我待在一起。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:958
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_55a07d19_1:

    # Merel "I don’t have any experience being a waitress, but Nienke was kind enough to show me the ropes. There’s still a lot I need to learn, but I’m doin’ my best!"
    Merel "我没做过服务生，不过妮恩克人很好，肯教我。要学的还很多，但我在努力啦！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:960
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8b115885_1:

    # Merel "I just hope you can bear with me while I’m still figuring out how everything works, ma’am! I hope I don’t cause you too many issues!"
    Merel "女士，我还在摸索呢，还请您多包涵！希望不会给您添太多麻烦！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:962
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f70c9280_1:

    # "It’s with this remark that Merel takes both sides of her dark, sensible skirt, then offers Mrs van Dijk a neat curtsy."
    "说着，梅蕾尔提起深色裙摆的两侧，向范戴克太太端端正正地行了个屈膝礼。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:964
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a37ebdb1_1:

    # "This polite, almost elegant gesture seems to clash with her easygoing way of talking."
    "这个礼数周到、甚至颇有几分优雅的动作，和她随随便便的说话方式实在不太搭。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:966
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2cb4864c_1:

    # "I wonder if Mrs van Dijk will decry Merel for being too chatty, but..."
    "我还在想，范戴克太太会不会嫌她太多话，却听见……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:970
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3714f860_1:

    # VD "Well, now. That’s what I like to hear!"
    VD "这还像话。我就爱听这个！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:974
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4ad7b7b1_1:

    # VD "I can see you still have a fair bit to learn about customer service, but I don’t doubt your sincerity. It’s obvious that you mean well — and you’re awfully earnest, too."
    VD "待客之道，你确实还有不少要学。不过，你的诚意倒不必怀疑。看得出是好心，人也很实在。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:976
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1e5f3724_1:

    # VD "You have a lot of admirable traits, Miss... Merel, was it?"
    VD "你身上有不少值得称赞的地方呢，小姐……叫梅蕾尔，是吧？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:978
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_fba97625_1:

    # Merel "Yes, that’s right! I’m Merel Asphodel! It’s a pleasure to meet you, wahaha~"
    Merel "没错！梅蕾尔·阿斯福德尔！很高兴认识您，哇哈哈～"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:980
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6ae9b234_1:

    # VD "Likewise. I am gratified I was able to meet a friend of Nienke’s: one who is not Cornelia. That girl could be somewhat...{w} disrespectful..."
    VD "我也是。能认识妮恩克的一位朋友，而且还是科妮莉娅以外的朋友，我很欣慰。那个姑娘有时实在……{w}没规矩……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:982
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b4261682_1:

    # "Mrs van Dijk presses her lips together. She shakes her head, as though trying to disturb a fly, then says..."
    "范戴克太太抿紧嘴唇，像要赶走一只苍蝇似的摇了摇头，接着说……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:984
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c46e78ee_1:

    # VD "But you seem like a very hard worker indeed. I’m sure you’ll be a wonderful addition to Fleur de Lys."
    VD "不过，你倒真是个肯吃苦的孩子。有你加入，百合花一定能添不少助力。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:985
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_17269480_1:

    # VD "I’m very much looking forward to having you wait on me. It should prove to be quite a breath of fresh air!"
    VD "我很期待由你来招待。想必会有一番新气象！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:987
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_67c5e282_1:

    # Merel "I hope so! I’m lookin’ forward to serving you too, ma’am! It would be my pleasure!"
    Merel "希望如此！我也很期待为您服务，女士！这是我的荣幸！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:988
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_35eea1b9_1:

    # VD "Yes, that’s a good answer. It’s exactly what I was hoping to hear."
    VD "嗯，答得不错。正是我想听的。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:992
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ac40a35c_1:

    # VD "It seems a shame you’ll only be working here for a week. I feel like that sour-faced Willemijn girl could learn a lot from you..."
    VD "只做一周，实在可惜。那个成天苦着脸的威廉敏，应该多跟你学学……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:994
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_27979e81_1:

    # VD "And so could you, for that matter, Nienke."
    VD "妮恩克，说起来，你也是。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:997
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_72f2fb00_2:

    # Nienke "Huh?"
    Nienke "啊？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:999
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b998ddb1_1:

    # Nienke "Wh-What’s wrong with me, um... Mrs van Dijk?"
    Nienke "我、我哪里做得不好了，呃……范戴克太太？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1001
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0a10db49_1:

    # VD "What a question. Where should I begin?"
    VD "这话问的。你让我从哪儿说起好呢？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1003
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b1e0e3aa_1:

    # VD "You aren’t a bad girl, Nienke, but you can be rather morose at times. It would hardly kill you to smile. Sometimes, you look so gloomy it puts me off my food!"
    VD "妮恩克，你不是坏孩子，可有时也太阴沉了。笑一笑又不会要你的命。有时候看你那张苦脸，我连东西都吃不下了！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1007
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b6c353d8_1:

    # Merel "Wahaha! That’s Nienke alright. She’s been serious ever since I’ve known her, but don’t worry. I’ll try’n inject a little levity into her life!"
    Merel "哇哈哈！她就是这样。我认识她起，她就一本正经的。不过您放心，我会努力让她过得开心一点！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1009
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3a3fd28b_1:

    # Merel "I’m gonna do my best to make her smile!"
    Merel "我一定想办法让她笑起来！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1011
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ab9f5c00_1:

    # VD "Yes, please do. She could use it."
    VD "嗯，那就拜托你了。她是该多笑笑。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1016
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0566f13b_1:

    # "Mrs van Dijk then tells Merel what she wants to order — her usual Darjeeling, alongside a couple of apple rose tarts — while I grit my teeth together."
    "接着，范戴克太太向梅蕾尔点了单：照例一杯大吉岭茶，再加两份苹果玫瑰挞。我在旁边咬紧了牙。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1024
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b0c47f7a_1:

    # "This wasn’t supposed to happen! How come Merel and Mrs van Dijk are on such friendly terms?"
    "事情不该是这样的啊！为什么她们俩关系这么好了？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1025
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d9deb2d3_1:

    # "I was certain that Mrs van Dijk would remain unmoved by Merel’s bright smile: a stony, immovable fortress."
    "我本来以为，面对梅蕾尔灿烂的笑脸，范戴克太太也会不为所动，像一座坚不可摧的石头堡垒。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1026
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8f91598b_1:

    # "I didn’t want to believe that even Mrs van Dijk would be swayed by her..."
    "真不想相信，连她都被梅蕾尔打动了……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1028
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4d0b5782_1:

    # "But it’s high time I faced up to the facts. Merel really {i}is{/i} popular."
    "可我也该认清事实了。梅蕾尔{i}就是{/i}很受欢迎。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1030
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d9c75695_1:

    # "She’s much more popular than I am, even, and I’ve worked in Fleur de Lys ever since I was a kid!"
    "甚至比我还受欢迎得多。可我从小就在百合花工作啊！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1031
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f8497fb5_1:

    # "I know it’s immature to get too upset by this turn of events, but this is so unfair!!!"
    "我知道，为这种事生闷气很幼稚，可这也太不公平了吧！！！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1046
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_96ba0ca2_1:

    # Merel "Phew! That was a lot of fun!"
    Merel "呼！真好玩！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1048
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_761229a1_1:

    # "Merel sighs, sounding rather satisfied, later that night."
    "当天夜里，梅蕾尔长舒了一口气，听着相当满足。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1056
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_32afd97f_1:

    # "We’ve since finished with our shifts, and we’ve also finished eating dinner."
    "我们已经下了班，也吃过晚饭了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1057
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5bcd455e_1:

    # "Now, Merel’s sitting on my bed, stretching. She’s already had a bath, so she looks faintly flushed from the warm water, and her fair hair is sticking to her cheeks; her neck."
    "这会儿，她坐在我的床上伸懒腰。刚洗过澡，热水蒸得脸颊微红，浅色的发丝贴着脸侧和脖颈。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1058
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a3977cb9_1:

    # "She’s wearing her pyjamas, which (thankfully) cover up much more of her muscular frame than her casual clothes."
    "她穿着睡衣，谢天谢地，比平时那套便服遮得严实多了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1059
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_285f8204_1:

    # "That’s a little funny, since nobody’s going to see Merel in her pyjamas: nobody except me, seemingly."
    "这倒有点好笑。毕竟睡衣又没别人看见，看来也就只有我。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1060
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c5e78d21_1:

    # "You’d think she would be a bit more self-conscious about what she wears during the day to day, as opposed to what she wears to go to sleep..."
    "照理说，比起睡觉时穿什么，平时出门的打扮才更该在意一点吧……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1061
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_67ad6529_1:

    # "But I don’t think Merel belongs in the same sentence as the word ‘self-conscious’. She practically seems to defy it."
    "可梅蕾尔这人，跟“在意别人的眼光”根本不沾边，简直就是反着来的。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1062
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_16848b6e_1:

    # "I don’t know if she even has the ability to be self-conscious."
    "我甚至怀疑，她有没有这种意识。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1063
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6642564b_1:

    # "She was practically in her element at work earlier. She wandered about the café with an unwavering smile, taking orders and even pausing to chat with some of the younger patrons."
    "今天工作时，她完全如鱼得水。笑容从没离开过脸，一边在店里替客人点单，一边还能停下来跟年轻些的客人聊几句。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1064
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ac965935_1:

    # "Conversation flowed from her easily, just like a fountain, and everybody seemed taken in by her easygoing charms."
    "她的话自然而然地涌出来，像泉水一样。大家似乎都被她轻松随和的魅力吸引了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1065
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_04768ad6_1:

    # "She was even able to make Mrs van Dijk smile: something which I’ve long thought to be an impossibility."
    "她甚至能逗范戴克太太笑。我一直以为，那是不可能的事。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1066
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a3e53910_1:

    # "How is Merel so good at simply talking to other people?"
    "为什么只是跟别人说话，她就能做得那么好？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1067
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6e877290_1:

    # "I do my best, but I’ve never been able to ingratiate myself with the customers quite as easily as Merel clearly can."
    "我也一直很努力，却从来没法像她那样，轻轻松松就跟客人打成一片。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1068
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4dc4e7f2_1:

    # "It’s enough to make me wonder whether she has some sort of supernatural ability."
    "真让人怀疑，她是不是有什么超自然的本领。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1069
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_13c3a7dc_1:

    # "Maybe she has psychic powers?"
    "难道会读心术？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1070
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_053cab0c_1:

    # "It would certainly help if I could read minds. Then, I wouldn’t have to struggle my way through so many social interactions."
    "如果能读心，我肯定也会轻松不少，就不用每次跟人打交道都这么费力了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1079
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9c722b2b_1:

    # Merel "It was fun talkin’ to all of these people, and it was fun workin’ for your parents too! They’re real nice!"
    Merel "跟这么多人聊天好开心，替你爸妈工作也很开心！他们人真好！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1081
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3596905b_1:

    # Merel "I’m glad I was able to help out, even if I only did a little bit. I’d feel way too guilty, sittin’ around here sponging off your charity."
    Merel "能帮上一点忙，我很高兴。要是坐在这里，白吃白住，什么都靠你们，我肯定会过意不去。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1082
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9593d8ce_1:

    # Merel "I wanna make myself useful as best I can..."
    Merel "我想尽量派上点用场……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1084
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1900bcdc_1:

    # Merel "But what did you think, Nienke? D’you think I did a good job?"
    Merel "不过，你觉得怎么样，妮恩克？我今天做得好吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1086
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4cb95a74_1:

    # "There’s something eager about the expression on Merel’s face and the tone of her voice. She sounds almost desperate for praise."
    "她的神情和语气都透着期待，简直像迫不及待地想被夸奖。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1087
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e28f67e2_1:

    # "Once again, I’m reminded of a puppy. If she had a tail, I’m sure she’d be wagging it."
    "我又一次想到了小狗。要是有尾巴，她一定已经摇起来了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1088
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e3cf1725_1:

    # "I’m sure some people would find her earnestness endearing, but as for me..."
    "有人可能会觉得，这股认真的劲儿很可爱。至于我……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1090
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_cd88453c_1:

    # Merel "Nienke? Don’t’cha have any feedback? You’ve been working at Fleur de Lys for waaaaay longer’n I have, so I figured you’d have a few pointers."
    Merel "妮恩克？不给点意见吗？你在百合花干的时间比我长多——了，我以为你能指点几句呢。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1091
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0c84eba4_1:

    # Merel "Is there anything you think I should change?"
    Merel "有没有哪里需要改的？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1093
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_317d3a88_1:

    # "I just find it irritating."
    "我只觉得烦。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1095
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_531bc9ae_1:

    # "It seems like almost everybody likes Merel, but I’m not going to follow suit. I’m not going to let her win me over!"
    "好像所有人都喜欢梅蕾尔，可我不会跟风。我才不会这么容易就被她讨好！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1096
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c05b600e_1:

    # "I finish running my brush through my hair, then drop my brush down on my vanity table with a little more force than is probably necessary."
    "梳完头，我把梳子往梳妆台上一放，力气大得似乎没什么必要。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1097
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_65a85a61_1:

    # "Then, I flounce on over to my bed."
    "接着，气鼓鼓地走向床边。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1109
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_13eb5075_1:

    # "I flop down on it dramatically, my hair fluttering, and say..."
    "我故意重重坐下，头发随着动作扬起，开口道……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1111
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9e54c5c7_1:

    # Nienke "Sorry, Merel, but it’s getting late. I’m not really in the mood to give you a blow-by-blow account of exactly everything you did wrong, and where you can improve. I’d much rather go to bed."
    Nienke "抱歉，梅蕾尔，已经很晚了。我现在没心情一项项细数你哪里做错、哪里还需要改。我更想睡觉。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1113
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ebd915f8_1:

    # Merel "Whaaat?!"
    Merel "诶——？！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1115
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ae88ad6e_1:

    # "Merel pouts at my snippy retort, her exclamation loud enough that Engelmund, who was perched on her lap, meows indignantly."
    "听见我这不客气的回答，梅蕾尔噘起了嘴。惊叫声太大，连窝在她腿上的恩格尔蒙德都不满地喵了一声。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1119
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_545d7446_1:

    # "Engelmund’s eyes widen, and he hops off Merel and onto the wooden floor, landing with a dull thump."
    "恩格尔蒙德睁大眼睛，从她身上跳到木地板上，落地时发出一声闷响。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1120
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ae803365_1:

    # "Engelmund might have gotten his name from a famous saint who died of a fever, wasting away on his deathbed until there was no trace of him left, but I don’t think Engelmund himself is in any danger of wasting away any time soon."
    "他的名字取自一位著名圣人。那位圣人死于高热，在病榻上日渐消瘦，几乎瘦得不成人形。可我们家这位，暂时肯定不用担心这种事。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1121
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_96e50956_1:

    # "He’s very stocky as far as cats go: this soft white puffball which might have been better off named Snowball or Snowman than after a venerated saint."
    "就猫而言，他实在挺敦实。一团软绵绵的白毛，与其用德高望重的圣人命名，不如叫雪球或者雪人更合适。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1123
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6d45fc43_1:

    # "I love Engelmund all the same, however, despite him being so bulky."
    "不过，就算长得这么圆，我还是爱恩格尔蒙德。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1124
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7cb5f84a_1:

    # "In fact, he’s probably bulky because I love him so much. I keep sneaking him treats, even though I know I shouldn’t."
    "其实，也许正因为我太爱他，他才这么圆。明知道不该，我还是总偷偷给他零食。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1125
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_456468a1_1:

    # "I just can’t resist the temptation, though: not when he looks up at me with those big old eyes of his. He really is too precious."
    "可他一抬起那双大眼睛看我，我就忍不住嘛。实在太可爱了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1127
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f1f4d8fd_1:

    # "I’ve been feeling a little peeved that Engelmund seems to favour Merel’s lap over mine, and I feel a flicker of satisfaction when he abandons her..."
    "他好像更喜欢窝在梅蕾尔腿上，而不是我腿上，这本来让我有点不高兴。所以看见他离开她，我心里闪过一丝得意……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1129
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a25ba2ca_1:

    # "But I can’t enjoy the feeling for long: not with Merel holding my gaze, her lower lip jutting out."
    "可这点得意没能持续多久。梅蕾尔还噘着下唇，直直盯着我呢。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1131
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_96a79524_1:

    # Merel "It’s not that late, Nienke! It’s not even 23:00 yet!"
    Merel "妮恩克，哪有那么晚！还没到十一点呀！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1133
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_89a72ebe_1:

    # Merel "Surely we can stay up talking just a little longer? Isn’t that what girls are meant to do during sleepovers? I wanted to chat with you at least a little more!"
    Merel "就不能再聊一小会儿吗？女孩子一起过夜，不就是要这样嘛。我还想多跟你说几句话呢！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1135
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_26826dbc_1:

    # Nienke "And I’m flattered you care about my opinions that much, but I need to get my beauty rest. I’ll develop bags under my eyes otherwise, and then the customers will tut at me: especially Mrs van Dijk."
    Nienke "你这么重视我的意见，我很荣幸。不过，我需要睡美容觉，不然会长眼袋，客人又要说我，尤其范戴克太太。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1139
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b854d1c6_1:

    # Nienke "I don’t need her saying I look like a zombie, amongst everything else..."
    Nienke "她已经说我够多了，我可不想再加一句“像僵尸”……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1140
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_47209c39_1:

    # Nienke "And besides, I thought you yourself told me I needed to get better at waking up in the mornings."
    Nienke "再说，不是你自己说，我该改改早上起不来的毛病吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1142
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_684631b9_1:

    # Merel "I did?"
    Merel "我说过？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1144
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8f5b3722_1:

    # Nienke "Yes, you did. Don’t think I’ve forgotten what you said to me this morning. You called me a lazy lump!"
    Nienke "对，你说过。别以为早上的话我忘了。你还说我是个大懒虫！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1146
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2e680d99_1:

    # Merel "What...? I don’t—"
    Merel "什么……？我没——"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1148
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_fde500b1_1:

    # Merel "Oooooh. Now that you mention it, I {i}did{/i} say that, didn’t I?"
    Merel "哦——你这么一说，我好像{i}确实{/i}说过，是吧？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1150
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_66c722c4_1:

    # Nienke "Yes, you did. I’d rather not make another spectacle out of myself, so I need to set a good example."
    Nienke "对，就是你说的。我可不想再出丑，所以得作个好榜样。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1152
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7267944f_1:

    # Nienke "I think that’s much, much more important than staying awake half of the night chattering, don’t you?"
    Nienke "比起熬到半夜闲聊，我觉得这重要得多。你说呢？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1154
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2a409b24_1:

    # Merel "Well, you’ve got me there. I can’t argue with that—"
    Merel "好吧，这我确实没法反驳——"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1156
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_29081804_1:

    # "And yet, here she is, still talking."
    "然而她还在说。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1158
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6a6a8aff_1:

    # Merel "—so maybe I will let you get some shut-eye, hehe. I’m sorry for bothering you, Nienke. I just hope you can forgive me!"
    Merel "——那就让你好好睡吧，嘿嘿。妮恩克，对不起，又烦到你了，希望你能原谅我！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1160
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2ad8f104_2:

    # Nienke "...Hmph."
    Nienke "……哼。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1165
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_faefe9ab_1:

    # "Now it’s my turn to pout."
    "这次轮到我噘嘴了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1171
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1790138a_1:

    # "I lie down, the mattress moaning softly beneath me, then mumble..."
    "我躺下来，床垫在身下轻轻吱呀一声。我低声嘟囔……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1175
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9adf2c58_1:

    # Nienke "Whatever. Don’t worry about it too much."
    Nienke "随便啦。不用太放在心上。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1176
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7ad5b96a_1:

    # "Like she’s worrying at all. Merel doesn’t strike me as the sort to bother, she’s so cheerfully carefree."
    "说得好像她会放在心上一样。这人整天乐呵呵、无忧无虑的，看着就不像会为这种事烦恼。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1178
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b7345fc9_1:

    # Nienke "Now, I really am going to sleep. Goodnight, Merel."
    Nienke "现在我真的要睡了。晚安，梅蕾尔。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1180
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ed30a9d3_1:

    # Merel "Right, right. G’night, Nienke! Don’t let the bedbugs bite, and all that."
    Merel "好好好。晚安，妮恩克！祝你睡个好觉，别被臭虫咬啦。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1182
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8c8a17e4_1:

    # Merel "I hope you sleep well..."
    Merel "希望你睡得安稳……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1184
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1141531a_1:

    # Merel "But would it kill you to give me a compliment or two?"
    Merel "不过，夸我一两句又不会怎么样嘛。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1192
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0ccc274c_1:

    # "Merel’s speaking quietly, doubtless in the hopes that I can’t overhear her, but this is a pointless effort."
    "梅蕾尔说得很轻，显然是不想让我听见，可惜白费力气。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1193
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1d3b218e_1:

    # "As an elf, my ears are rather long and sensitive. I can pick up on all sorts of sounds from many miles away: even the most subtle of them."
    "身为精灵，我的耳朵又长又敏锐。几英里外的各种声音，甚至细微的动静，我都能听见。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1195
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1b184bb1_1:

    # "Her whispers reach me with ease: so much so she might very well have pressed her lips against my ears."
    "她的低语轻轻松松就传了过来，清楚得像贴着我的耳朵说的一样。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1196
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b3ea8886_1:

    # "I guess she’s more perturbed by my aloofness than she’d like to admit to..."
    "看来，我的冷淡其实让她挺在意，只是不愿承认……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1198
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3d94a7fb_1:

    # "But that’s her problem, not mine."
    "可那是她的问题，不是我的。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1199
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a747798c_1:

    # "She isn’t even supposed to be here."
    "她本来就不该在这里。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1200
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0dd170a1_1:

    # "This isn’t her home, and Engelmund isn’t her cat, and my parents aren’t hers."
    "这里不是她的家，恩格尔蒙德不是她的猫，我的爸妈也不是她的。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1202
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6e535775_1:

    # "She doesn’t belong here."
    "这里没有她的位置。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1204
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f760b291_1:

    # "I’m already tired of her."
    "我已经受够她了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1218
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0ddef9b7_1:

    # "The following day goes by smoothly enough: almost surprisingly so."
    "第二天过得还算顺利，甚至顺利得让人意外。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1219
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3a0a9c4a_1:

    # "Merel manages the customers with a swiftness and efficiency which is impressive..."
    "梅蕾尔招待起客人来又快又利落，挺让人佩服……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1220
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8bb762eb_1:

    # "At least, it would be impressive, but I’ve already told myself I’m not going to get pulled into her rhythm."
    "至少，本来是该佩服的。可我已经告诉过自己，不能被她牵着走。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1221
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4f1b13a8_1:

    # "There’s really no need for me to commend her, so I don’t. I don’t want to give her an inflated ego."
    "没什么非夸她不可的理由，所以我没夸。我可不想让她太得意。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1222
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c8956abf_1:

    # "I think she has too much of an ego already, the way the customers have all been flattering her. She’s proven herself to be incredibly popular in only two days, even with Mrs van Dijk."
    "客人们已经把她夸得够飘飘然了。短短两天，她就成了大红人，连范戴克太太都喜欢她。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1223
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_875c4ba4_1:

    # "That still smarts a little, actually. This might sound silly, but it almost feels like a betrayal that Mrs van Dijk has taken to her so much, when Mrs van Dijk is known for having a temper as short as her stature."
    "说真的，这一点现在想来还有点刺痛。听起来或许很傻，可范戴克太太那样喜欢她，简直像背叛了我。明明她人又矮，脾气又急，是出了名的。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1224
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_24dba0a1_1:

    # "What’s so special about Merel, anyway, that makes Mrs van Dijk ask for her over me?"
    "梅蕾尔到底有什么特别的，值得她放着我不要，偏偏要梅蕾尔来招待？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1225
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ab300f64_1:

    # "Why does she like Merel so much? I can’t see the appeal whatsoever..."
    "为什么那么喜欢她？我完全看不出她哪里好……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1226
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9bd9d7e0_1:

    # "But never mind that. I’m trying not to dwell on it, so I don’t."
    "算了，不管了。我不想纠结，也就不去想。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1227
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_648f77ec_1:

    # "The day comes to a close, and I finish cleaning up the café with Merel (not that she’s all that helpful or anything. Hmph)."
    "一天结束后，我跟梅蕾尔一起把店里打扫干净——倒也不是说她帮了多大的忙，哼。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1237
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1e7f8cfd_1:

    # "With this task completed, I then change out of my maid’s uniform and retreat upstairs."
    "做完这些，我换下女仆装，回到楼上。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1239
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_44e6a46c_1:

    # "I’m hoping to while the time away with a book, but Merel has other ideas."
    "本想读本书打发时间，梅蕾尔却另有打算。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1251
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_bbac34c0_1:

    # "She descends upon me, her red eyes bright, then says..."
    "她凑到我面前，红眼睛亮晶晶的，开口道……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1253
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1bfcee69_1:

    # Merel "Hey, Nienke! Have I told you how nice your folks are?"
    Merel "喂，妮恩克！我有没有跟你说过，你爸妈人真好？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1256
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_72f2fb00_3:

    # Nienke "Huh?"
    Nienke "啊？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1257
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_58d0a95d_1:

    # "I set my book aside with a small sigh and sit up, my brow furrowed."
    "我轻叹一声，把书放到旁边，皱着眉坐起来。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1259
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_fbd0e4fb_1:

    # Nienke "Why are you talking about my parents?"
    Nienke "怎么忽然说起我爸妈了？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1261
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_29f0df67_1:

    # Merel "Well, why not? They’ve been real good to me! They’re payin’ me for my work, and they’re payin’ pretty well, too!"
    Merel "为什么不能说？他们真的很照顾我呀！给我发工资，而且给得还不少！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1263
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a8afa794_1:

    # Merel "I’m making out like a bandit here! I feel almost guilty, they’re practically rainin’ money down on me!"
    Merel "这下可赚大啦！简直像在往我身上撒钱，我都有点不好意思了！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1264
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7be96069_1:

    # Merel "It’s like, “Hey, you don’t have to go that far! I’m not worthy...”"
    Merel "就想说：“喂，真不用给这么多，我哪受得起……”"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1267
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1174ca9f_1:

    # Merel "But, if you’re sure you wanna pay me that much, I’m not exactly gonna say no, ya know? Wahahaha!"
    Merel "不过，既然你们一定要给，我也不会硬推回去嘛，对吧？哇哈哈哈！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1269
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e32fe0b8_1:

    # Nienke "Did they pay you already? I presumed they’d do it once the week was up..."
    Nienke "已经付你工资了？我还以为会等到一周结束……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1271
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_415198ba_1:

    # Merel "Me too, me too — but your father pulled me to one side earlier, after I’d finished washin’ up the dishes, an’ he said he wanted to give me some of my wages in advance!"
    Merel "我也是这么想的！可刚才洗完碗，你爸爸把我叫到一边，说想先预支一部分给我！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1275
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_266c636d_1:

    # Merel "He said it was a token of his esteem, ’cause I’d been workin’ so hard..."
    Merel "他说，这是谢谢我这么努力干活的一点心意……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1277
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_de7ee46c_1:

    # Merel "An’ he said it’d be sad if he paid me right at the end of my stay, ’cause I wouldn’t have a chance to buy any souvenirs!"
    Merel "还说，要是等到我临走才发钱，连买纪念品的机会都没有，那多可惜！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1278
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a2e201b8_1:

    # Merel "He seemed worried I wouldn’t be able to bring my folks anything nice back, and they’d think that I’d been mistreated!"
    Merel "他好像很担心，我没给爸妈带点好东西回去，他们会以为我受了委屈！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1280
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c077b21e_1:

    # Nienke "Would your parents assume you’re being mistreated?"
    Nienke "你爸妈会觉得你受委屈了吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1282
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_798257b1_1:

    # Merel "Probably not. Our folks are friends, and they should know your parents would never make me work from dawn to dusk, or sleep in an attic..."
    Merel "应该不会吧。咱们爸妈是朋友，他们应该知道，你爸妈又不会逼我从早干到晚，也不会让我睡阁楼……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1284
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f2d3b453_1:

    # Merel "But it’s been a while since they saw one another. I guess your old man was worried about making a bad impression?"
    Merel "不过，他们确实很久没见了。我猜你爸爸怕给人留下坏印象吧？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1286
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_821902de_1:

    # Merel "He seemed kinda antsy, actually, that I go out an’ get myself something nice, so why don’t we go and do that?"
    Merel "他还挺着急的，催我出去给自己买点好东西。那我们就去吧？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1288
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2d0e7514_1:

    # Nienke "Do you want to?"
    Nienke "你想去？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1290
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_58ec427c_1:

    # Merel "Yeah! I’ve been here for a couple of days now, but I’ve not had much of a chance to look around."
    Merel "想呀！来这里都两天了，还没怎么好好逛过呢。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1292
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_97046c34_1:

    # Merel "It’s not so late, so why don’t we go for a bit of a wander? I wanna look inside some of the shops!"
    Merel "现在也不晚，一起出去走走吧？我想进几家店看看！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1294
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2d9e9e15_1:

    # "I look at Merel impassively for a few moments, my lips pressed together."
    "我抿着嘴，面无表情地望了她一会儿。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1295
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9218cd2a_1:

    # "If I’m being wholly honest, I have no real desire to go wandering around. It sounds like too much of a pain."
    "说实话，我一点都不想出去闲逛。听着就麻烦。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1297
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_fae19574_1:

    # "I’d rather stay inside with a book..."
    "我宁愿留在屋里看书……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1299
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5aff9af3_1:

    # "But Merel is being very insistent — and she won’t, I have to remind myself, be in Alpenrose for very long."
    "可梅蕾尔很坚持。而且我得提醒自己，她在阿尔彭罗瑟待不了多久。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1300
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b036ed06_1:

    # "Her opportunities to go looking around will be few and far between."
    "能出去四处看看的机会，其实没有多少。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1301
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5d23835a_1:

    # "That being the case, I feel like I should humour her just this once. I don’t want to deny her a chance to enjoy this village."
    "既然这样，就陪她这一次吧。我也不想剥夺她享受这座村子的机会。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1303
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f2114af3_1:

    # Nienke "...Well, alright. If you want to look around that badly, then we can. Let’s go."
    Nienke "……好吧。既然你这么想逛，那就去。走吧。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1306
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7ae28fbe_1:

    # Merel "Yay! This is gonna be so much fun! I can’t wait!"
    Merel "好耶！肯定很好玩！我都等不及了！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1308
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e30bf224_1:

    # Nienke "Well, good. You won’t have to. It’s not like I had anything better to do..."
    Nienke "那正好，也不用等。反正我也没别的要紧事……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1312
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_befd3968_1:

    # "Other than fail to read my book, I suppose."
    "除了继续看不进书，大概。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1322
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_530ff63b_1:

    # "I exit the house about a minute later, Merel at my heels (she feels a bit like an over-eager puppy), then wander down Prinsstraat: the street Fleur de Lys is located on, which connects to the village plaza."
    "一分钟后，我出了门，梅蕾尔紧跟在后面，像只热情过头的小狗。我们沿着王子街往前走，百合花就在这条街上，往前便是村里的广场。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1323
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8539bfb9_1:

    # "It’s a pleasant sort of a street, maybe because Alpenrose is such a pleasant sort of a village."
    "这是条让人舒服的街。也许因为阿尔彭罗瑟本来就是个让人舒服的村子。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1324
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_bced3df3_1:

    # "I’ve heard from Mrs van Dijk that Prinsstraat is one of the oldest streets in Alpenrose, which dates back to the 18th century, and you can definitely see it in the architecture."
    "听范戴克太太说，王子街是村里最古老的街道之一，可以追溯到十八世纪。从建筑上确实看得出来。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1325
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3dd394d0_1:

    # "The street is all cobblestones, and there are old-fashioned lampposts everywhere: wrought iron, like licorice, with lights atop which flicker to life during the nights, when the cool breeze starts to creep across the village."
    "路面铺满石头，沿途都是老式路灯。锻铁灯柱像甘草糖条一样，等到凉风悄悄吹过村庄的夜晚，顶上的灯就会亮起来。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1326
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_69dce17c_1:

    # "The street is lined with a lot of little buildings, so square and neat they look like illustrations on a box of chocolates."
    "一栋栋小房子沿街而立，方方正正，整整齐齐，像巧克力盒上的插画。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1327
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d1d3602e_1:

    # "The houses are almost as old as the street itself, but they wear their old age well."
    "这些房子几乎和街道一样老，却老得很体面。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1328
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8f78940d_1:

    # "They’re pretty brick with slate windows, the blinds and the doors different pastel colours: pale blue, refreshing mint green, and pastel pink."
    "漂亮的砖墙配着石板窗框，百叶窗和门刷成各种柔和的颜色：浅蓝、清爽的薄荷绿，还有淡粉。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1329
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6c724676_1:

    # "There are boxes of flowers beneath the windows, which have sash curtains, and they have little stone steps which lead up to the doors."
    "窗子挂着短帘，下面摆着花箱，门前有几级小小的石阶。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1330
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2b04a74d_1:

    # "It’s all very picturesque..."
    "一切都像画一样……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1340
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7469bc7f_1:

    # Merel "Ooh! I thought this when I first got here, but this place is seriously adorable! It just screams ‘small mountain village’, y’know?"
    Merel "哇！刚来时我就想说，这里真的好可爱！一看就是那种“小山村”的感觉，你懂吧？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1342
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_73749d74_1:

    # "But Merel’s constant stream of unasked for commentary makes me feel a little on edge."
    "可梅蕾尔这没完没了、也没人请她发表的评论，让我有点烦躁。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1343
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1ac2c0fe_1:

    # "I know she’s trying to be complimentary, but I can’t help but feel like she’s looking down on me."
    "我知道她是在夸，可又忍不住觉得，她好像在看不起我。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1345
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b48a8669_1:

    # "She might as well be calling me unworldly, living in such a small village."
    "简直像在说，住在这么小的村子里，我肯定没见过世面。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1346
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_dbb1be06_1:

    # "I’ve never left Alpenrose before, and there’s a lot about the outside world I’m unfamiliar with."
    "我从来没离开过阿尔彭罗瑟，对外面的世界有太多不了解的地方。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1348
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_91537fa2_1:

    # "I know this village is small, and I know it doesn’t have all that much to offer, but Merel doesn’t need to keep mentioning it!"
    "我知道这里小，也知道这里没多少东西，可她不用一遍遍提醒我吧！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1349
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6e39a7d7_1:

    # "...Well, I’m probably being paranoid. I know she doesn’t mean any ill. There’s no sense in snipping at her. I should be polite."
    "……好吧，大概是我太多心了。我知道她没有恶意，没必要冲她发火。应该客气一点。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1359
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e0eac3dc_1:

    # Nienke "It is pretty, yes. I’m fond of it myself..."
    Nienke "嗯，是很漂亮。我自己也挺喜欢……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1361
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7783d9db_1:

    # Nienke "But is there anywhere in particular you want to go?"
    Nienke "不过，你有没有特别想去的地方？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1365
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8d4432dd_1:

    # Nienke "There’s not that much to do, but there’s a few shops by the plaza — and this village does have an art gallery, too."
    Nienke "这里能做的事不多，但广场附近有几家店，村里也有一座美术馆。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1366
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_862e1911_1:

    # Nienke "It’s pretty small, but I’ve been a few times. It’s quite charming."
    Nienke "规模挺小的，不过我去过几次，还蛮有意思。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1368
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_868adb7a_1:

    # Merel "That does sound like fun, but maybe we can go another time. I actually have an idea, hehe."
    Merel "听着是不错，不过留到下次吧。其实，我已经有主意了，嘿嘿。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1370
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_51435131_1:

    # Nienke "An idea?"
    Nienke "有主意了？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1374
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_12dfc9ab_1:

    # Merel "That’s right! I wanna get a gift for my parents — like, some sort of memento that I came here!"
    Merel "对呀！我想给爸妈买点礼物，算是来过这里的纪念！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1376
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7e728fe0_1:

    # Merel "My mother likes pastries an’ fancy desserts an’ stuff, so I figured I’d pick her up some nice macarons in a box before I leave. I don’t wanna hang onto them for too long, or they’d go bad..."
    Merel "我妈喜欢酥点，还有精致的甜食，所以打算临走前给她买盒好一点的马卡龙。不能提前太久买，不然会坏……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1378
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_38bc7906_1:

    # Merel "But my father’s a real brainbox! He likes old books — the more ancient and weather-worn, the better — so I was thinkin’ we could go to that one shop I saw on the way here: The Book Nook?"
    Merel "可我爸是个大学究！他喜欢旧书，越古老、越破旧越好。所以我想，去我来时看见的那家店怎么样，叫……书角？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1380
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_95c6e7dc_1:

    # Nienke "Ooh, right..."
    Nienke "哦，那里啊……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1393
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_86a83799_1:

    # "The Book Nook is a small second-hand bookshop owned by the van de Lindens. Engelmund likes nosing around its doorstep when he can, in the hopes of coaxing a second breakfast from Jenny."
    "书角是范德林登一家开的小二手书店。恩格尔蒙德一有机会，就爱在店门口探头探脑，盼着从珍妮那里再讨一顿早饭。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1394
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8fc30800_1:

    # "Engelmund can be very tricksy like that, and he’s very shameless."
    "他在这种事上特别狡猾，而且毫不害臊。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1395
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1a353c12_1:

    # "I’m not sure if he even understands the concept of shame, which might not be too surprising, given he is a cat..."
    "我都怀疑他懂不懂害臊。毕竟是只猫，好像也不奇怪……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1396
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_30ce3159_1:

    # "But I digress."
    "不过，扯远了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1400
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3ad6177a_1:

    # "I like Jenny van der Linden, and I like The Book Nook. I go there pretty often myself, since I have a penchant for reading."
    "我喜欢珍妮·范德林登，也喜欢书角。我爱看书，所以经常去。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1401
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_001ae04e_1:

    # "I used to stop by on my way home from school every Friday, actually, after my mother had given me some pocket money, so I could peruse what was available on the dusty old shelves."
    "以前每周五放学，拿了妈妈给的零花钱，我都会顺路进去，看看那些积着灰的旧书架上有什么。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1402
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_793810c6_1:

    # "Cornelia used to accompany me, but I don’t think she enjoyed these jaunts very much."
    "科妮莉娅以前会陪我，可我觉得她不怎么享受这种闲逛。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1403
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3f283b18_1:

    # "She would always click her tongue and fold her arms, and tap her foot on the ground and ask if I was almost finished."
    "她总是啧一声，抱着胳膊，用脚点着地面，问我到底看完了没有。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1411
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_83217321_1:

    # Cornelia "{i}I don’t know why you love looking through these dusty old books so much, Niene! This is boring, and it’s gonna set my allergies off.{/i}"
    Cornelia "{i}妮妮，我真不懂你为什么这么爱翻这些灰扑扑的旧书！无聊死了，我都要过敏了。{/i}"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1412
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5723e1e6_1:

    # Cornelia "{i}Can’t we leave now? I’m tired of this place!{/i}"
    Cornelia "{i}还不能走吗？这地方我待够了！{/i}"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1413
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4777b3f1_1:

    # "Cornelia was never very enthusiastic about books..."
    "科妮莉娅对书一向不热衷……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1414
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c78c27de_1:

    # "But at least Merel seems interested, even if it is for her father’s sake."
    "可至少梅蕾尔看起来有兴趣，哪怕是为了她爸爸。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1415
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1cc14340_1:

    # "I doubt Merel has all that much interest in reading herself, but it’s...{w} strangely gratifying, I guess, that she wants to visit a book shop at all."
    "我不觉得她自己多爱读书。不过……{w}她愿意去书店这件事，本身就莫名让我有点高兴。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1416
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8ede5bee_1:

    # "I was prepared to consign myself to a tedious afternoon of aimless wandering, but maybe this won’t be so bad after all."
    "本来都认命了，觉得会漫无目的地走一下午，无聊透顶。现在看来，也许没那么糟。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1432
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_34eb34c9_1:

    # Nienke "Alright then. We can do that. I don’t know what sort of books your father likes, but there’s quite a wide selection in The Book Nook."
    Nienke "好啊，那就去那里。我不知道你爸爸喜欢什么书，不过书角的种类还挺多的。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1433
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_aafd8495_1:

    # Nienke "I’m sure we’ll be able to find something he’ll enjoy."
    Nienke "肯定能找到合他胃口的。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1436
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_82b7cb33_1:

    # Merel "Oh, I’m positive! My father loves anything dry and dense. He’s a total nerd, like I said..."
    Merel "那肯定！只要又枯燥又难啃，我爸就喜欢。我说过嘛，他是个十足的书呆子……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1438
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3dd4fe02_1:

    # Merel "Though he tends to prefer science fiction: the harder, the better..."
    Merel "不过，他更偏爱科幻，越硬的越好……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1440
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2470d277_1:

    # Merel "And he likes anything to do with space, too. My father’s head really is in the clouds, wahaha!"
    Merel "跟太空有关的东西，他也都喜欢。我爸的脑袋可真是一直飘在云端，哇哈哈！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1442
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b531044a_1:

    # "Merel laughs uproariously: so loud a couple of passing elderly ladies pause to look at us."
    "梅蕾尔放声大笑，声音大得让路过的几位老太太都停下来朝我们看。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1446
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_711c663f_1:

    # "Under other circumstances, I’d find this a touch embarrassing, but my thoughts towards Merel have mellowed out somewhat."
    "换作平时，我大概会觉得有点丢脸。不过现在，对她的心情倒是缓和了一些。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1448
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1a773ee4_1:

    # "I used to visit this store almost religiously, but it’s been a while since I last wandered amongst its dusty old shelves. I wonder if I’ll find anything interesting?"
    "以前我几乎雷打不动地来这家店，可已经好久没在那些灰扑扑的旧书架间走过了。不知道能不能找到什么有趣的东西？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1450
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1e90633a_1:

    # "There’s only one way to tell {font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"
    "去看看就知道了{font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1458
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ef90d4dc_1:

    # "Merel and I wander the streets companionably, and we soon arrive at The Book Nook. It doesn’t look like Mr van der Linden is there today, but Jenny is, sitting behind the counter."
    "我和梅蕾尔并肩走着，气氛融洽，很快就到了书角。今天范德林登先生似乎不在，珍妮倒在，坐在柜台后面。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1467
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_df27c1d2_1:

    # "Jenny is a fellow alumni of Stelle Lyceum but, given Jenny is three years my senior, we weren’t at the school together for very long."
    "珍妮也是斯特勒中学毕业的。不过她比我大三岁，我们在同一所学校待的时间不长。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1468
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_30d6bcc0_1:

    # "I know her well enough, however, from my frequent visits to the shop: not just to buy books, but to retrieve Engelmund."
    "但我经常来店里，不光买书，也来领恩格尔蒙德回家，所以跟她还算熟。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1469
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_880609ea_1:

    # "Part of me wishes Jenny and her father wouldn’t coddle him so much, but that’s how the van der Lindens are. They’re very kind: almost to a fault..."
    "我有时真希望，她和她爸爸别再这么宠他了。可范德林登一家就是这样，好心得几乎过了头……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1470
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b4f8cf83_1:

    # "Or Mr van der Linden and his daughter are, at least."
    "至少范德林登先生和他的女儿是如此。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1471
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e486ca29_1:

    # "Jenny’s mother doesn’t work at The Book Nook, largely because she doesn’t live in Alpenrose anymore."
    "珍妮的妈妈不在书角工作，主要是因为她已经不住在阿尔彭罗瑟了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1472
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d1815d4e_1:

    # "The former Mrs van der Linden (she’s since remarried), has been through six different husbands in three decades, and now she’s angling for a seventh."
    "这位前范德林登太太后来又改嫁了，三十年里换过六任丈夫，如今还在物色第七任。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1473
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b0b66d7d_1:

    # "I know it’s not my place to judge, but there’s something rather salacious about the former Mrs van der Linden’s relationships."
    "我知道自己没资格评判，可她的感情经历，实在有点香艳得过头。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1474
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1d212f03_1:

    # "Her longest lived marriage, to Jenny’s father, lasted about fifteen years, while the shortest lived one lasted (from what I’ve gathered) three weeks."
    "最长的一段婚姻，就是和珍妮爸爸那十五年。至于最短的一段，据我听说，只维持了三个星期。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1475
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ce783b07_1:

    # "She sounds like a modern day Henry VIII, though she’s clearly trying to break his record."
    "听着简直像当代亨利八世，只不过她显然还想打破他的纪录。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1476
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_fe2c121d_1:

    # "Mrs van de Linden moved several years ago, after her relationship with Jenny’s father fell apart."
    "几年前，和珍妮爸爸的感情破裂后，范德林登太太就搬走了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1477
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2a8d80eb_1:

    # "Jenny opted to stay in Alpenrose with her father, and she’s been helping him with his old-fashioned bookshop ever since."
    "珍妮选择跟爸爸留在阿尔彭罗瑟，从那以后，一直帮他经营这家老派书店。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1488
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1004557c_1:

    # "Jenny used to work part time, when she still attended the lyceum, but once she’d graduated she started to work at The Book Nook full time."
    "还在中学读书时，她只是兼职帮忙，毕业后就全职在书角工作了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1489
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_408b306b_1:

    # "I’ve always felt a bit of a connection with Jenny, largely because we’ve both spent a lot of our childhoods helping our parents with their businesses."
    "我总觉得跟珍妮有几分相似，主要是因为我们从小就花了不少时间，帮父母打理生意。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1490
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c57715ea_1:

    # "Few girls in the lyceum worked, since most of them came from well-to-do families, so Jenny is one of the few girls I can relate to."
    "学校里的女生大多家境不错，很少有人工作。所以珍妮是少数能让我找到共同话题的人。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1491
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_dd4687db_1:

    # "She might be three years older than I am, but she’s a friend of sorts."
    "虽然比我大三岁，也算是个朋友。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1492
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2a5e8614_1:

    # "I’m not as close to Jenny as I am to Cornelia, but we’ve been chatting on and off ever since I left the lyceum."
    "我和她不如跟科妮莉娅那么亲近，不过毕业以后，也一直断断续续地聊着。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1493
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_932928e7_1:

    # "Now we’re no longer in school together, separated by three years, it feels easier to talk to her."
    "不再同处一所学校，隔着三个年级，反而觉得跟她说话更容易了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1494
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d816589e_1:

    # "Jenny seems pleased enough to see me, in any case, when I enter the shop."
    "总之，我走进店里时，珍妮看起来挺高兴见到我。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1495
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_770343f9_1:

    # "She was hunched over the counter, doodling something in her sketchbook, but she snaps to attention at the sound of the bell, like a trained cadet."
    "她原本趴在柜台上，在素描本里画着什么。门铃一响，就像受过训练的军校学员一样，立刻打起精神。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1496
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_93caf791_1:

    # "She readies her welcoming spiel — “Hello, and welcome to The Book Nook. Can I be of any assistance?” — but her voice trails off when she sees me."
    "她准备好迎客的惯例开场白：“你好，欢迎来到书角，有什么需要帮忙的吗？”可一看见我，话音就慢了下来。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1506
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_78f52daf_1:

    # "She blinks, then says..."
    "她眨眨眼，说……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1508
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0a1ae778_1:

    # Jenny "Oh! Hello, Nienke! It feels like it’s been a while. How’re you doing?"
    Jenny "啊！妮恩克，你好！好像有阵子没见了，最近怎么样？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1510
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f87ac392_1:

    # Nienke "I’m alright, thank you. I have been rather busy myself though, as it happens."
    Nienke "还好，谢谢。只是最近确实有点忙。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1512
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d864c333_1:

    # Jenny "Oh yeah? Is it because of the café, or..."
    Jenny "哦，是吗？因为咖啡馆的事，还是……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1514
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_bc9d8217_1:

    # "Jenny’s green eyes flicker to the right, where Merel is standing. She blinks, then says..."
    "珍妮的绿眼睛向右一转，望向梅蕾尔站着的地方。她眨了眨眼，问……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1516
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7e3ddcda_1:

    # Jenny "Do you have a friend staying with you?"
    Jenny "有朋友来你家住？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1518
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2d927212_1:

    # Nienke "Well, I’m not sure if I’d call Merel a friend, exactly..."
    Nienke "嗯，要说梅蕾尔算不算朋友，我还真不确定……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1519
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e4f42b7f_1:

    # "I mumble an uncertain reply, while Merel beams."
    "我含含糊糊地回答，梅蕾尔却笑得灿烂。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1531
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_06d2ea88_1:

    # Merel "That’s right! I’m Nienke’s friend — her childhood friend, actually — and I’ve been staying with her in Alpenrose the last few days!"
    Merel "没错！我是妮恩克的朋友，准确说，是从小的朋友！这几天都跟她一起住在阿尔彭罗瑟！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1533
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0807995e_1:

    # Merel "It’s nice to meetcha, Miss...?"
    Merel "很高兴认识你，小姐，怎么称呼……？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1535
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9955b3a3_1:

    # Jenny "Oh, you don’t need to call me ‘miss’. I’m just Jenny!"
    Jenny "啊，不用叫小姐，叫我珍妮就好！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1539
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_eb16055e_1:

    # Merel "Okay, Just Jenny!"
    Merel "好的，“珍妮就好”！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1541
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_cb14a144_1:

    # Merel "I’m Just Merel! Are you one of Nienke’s friends too?"
    Merel "我是“梅蕾尔就好”！你也是妮恩克的朋友吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1543
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_79a5022c_1:

    # Jenny "Well, we knew one another back in school, though we never did talk very much. I think we’re acquaintances, more than anything..."
    Jenny "嗯，我们上学时就认识，不过以前没怎么说过话。与其说朋友，大概更算熟人吧……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1545
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0c1ba4b2_1:

    # Jenny "But I always enjoy seeing her. She’s one of my most valuable customers!"
    Jenny "但每次见到她，我都很开心。她可是我最重要的顾客之一！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1547
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_315f9c2e_1:

    # Merel "Ooh, I didn’t know that. Are you a patron of the arts, Nienke?"
    Merel "哦，这我倒不知道。妮恩克，你还是位艺术赞助人呀？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1549
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_aa172644_1:

    # Nienke "Hardly. I just like picking up a few books every once in a while. It gives me something to do, that’s all."
    Nienke "哪有。我只是偶尔买几本书，给自己找点事做而已。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1553
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_32d60a73_1:

    # Jenny "Oh, I think you pick up more than a few books. You come in here every other day, or so it feels.."
    Jenny "哎，我看可不只是偶尔几本。感觉你隔三差五就来呢……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1557
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8d950c27_1:

    # Jenny "But don’t let me distract you! Don’t you want to look around with your friend?"
    Jenny "不过，我就不耽误你了！不跟朋友四处看看吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1559
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_24341550_1:

    # Merel "I don’t mind if I do! There’s so many books here, I’m sure there’ll be somethin’ in here my dad’ll like. I wonder where I should begin..."
    Merel "那我就不客气啦！这里这么多书，肯定有我爸喜欢的。不知道从哪儿开始好呢……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1577
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f96ec79b_1:

    # "Merel starts to peruse the shelves, while I approach the counter where Jenny sits. It’s true that I want to look at the books, but I am a little curious."
    "梅蕾尔开始翻看书架，我则走向珍妮坐着的柜台。书当然想看，不过我也有点好奇。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1578
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_02c291df_1:

    # "I know they say that curiosity killed the cat, but I’m not afraid of Jenny van der Linden. She’s always been exceedingly nice to Engelmund."
    "俗话说，好奇害死猫。可我又不怕珍妮·范德林登，她对恩格尔蒙德一向好得不得了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1579
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4d9eeea0_1:

    # "In fact, I think it’s more likely she’ll end up killing him from kindness, rather than any malicious intent."
    "其实，真要出什么事，多半也是好心得害了他，绝不会有什么恶意。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1580
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_24bde667_1:

    # "I have faith in her, therefore, as I approach. I cock my head, then say..."
    "所以，我放心地凑过去，歪着头问……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1582
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_606c4b8a_1:

    # Nienke "Were you drawing something for your portfolio?"
    Nienke "在为作品集画画吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1584
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_40d85bb8_1:

    # "I know Jenny well enough to know that she’s been hoping to go to art college for the last few years: ever since she finished at the lyceum."
