translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e28afd6a_1:

    # Jenny "Maybe. I just gotta try and think of some ideas. That’s something I need to do on my own, so don’t feel obliged to hang about."
    Jenny "也许吧。就是得再想点主意。这只能靠我自己，你不用特意留下陪我。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1631
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_fda64196_1:

    # Jenny "Go and browse! The world is your oyster!"
    Jenny "去挑书吧！随便逛，尽情看！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1635
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9d4deac9_1:

    # Jenny "We even got a few new books in, if you wanna see them. There’s some good courtly romances — or, um, I think they’re good."
    Jenny "想看的话，我们刚进了几本新书。有些挺不错的骑士爱情小说，呃，我想应该不错。"

