    Jenny "我还没读过，不过看着是你喜欢的那种。封面上有骑士，还有为爱倾倒的姑娘。你不是喜欢这些吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1638
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_83383549_1:

    # Nienke "I could do without the swooning women, but I guess I am a little interested in the knights. I’ll take a look, then."
    Nienke "那些为爱倾倒的姑娘倒也不必，不过骑士，我是有点兴趣。那我去看看。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1647
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e393f875_1:

