# game/chapter2.rpyc:1653
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c8f4cbb3_1:

    # "These books don’t tend to have the most unusual or interesting titles. It’s all stuff like {i}The Princess’s Knight{/i} and {i}The Fair Lady’s Token,{/i} but I have a soft spot for these books."
    "这类书的名字通常没多新奇有趣，无非是{i}《公主的骑士》{/i}、{i}《淑女的信物》{/i}之类。可我就是偏爱它们。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1655
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_cf18a79e_1:

    # "They transport me into another time and place; a whole new world."
    "它们能把我带到另一个时空，一个全新的世界。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1657
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7fddf0be_1:

    # "I’m content enough to examine these books, while Jenny pores over her sketchbook in the background..."
    "我心满意足地翻看这些书，身后，珍妮还在埋头研究素描本……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1670
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_16618a8d_1:

    # Merel "Hey, Nienke! I just found something really interestin’!"
    Merel "喂，妮恩克！我发现了个特别有意思的东西！"

