    Merel "你肯定猜不到！这么正经的书店，居然也有这种东西，哇哈哈！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1682
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b5cd6ef7_1:

    # Merel "It took me by surprise when I saw it on the shelf. I thought my eyes must’ve been playin’ tricks on me, but I can’t misread the illustration, too. Just look!"
