# game/chapter2.rpyc:1685
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_493a0e1c_1:

    # "Naturally, she’s holding a book. This isn’t unexpected, given we are in a book shop."
    "当然，是一本书。毕竟身在书店，这倒没什么意外。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1686
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4c194e3b_1:

    # "I would have assumed that the interesting object she wanted me to examine would be a book, given our location, but..."
    "她说要给我看有意思的东西，我本来也猜是书。可是……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1688
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_92a55759_1:

    # Nienke "O-Oh..."
    Nienke "啊、啊……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1689
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d318853a_1:

    # "It’s the nature of the book which makes me pause."
    "让我愣住的，是这本书的内容。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1691
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9cd3a354_1:

    # "I’m glad I set my own romance back on the shelf, else I probably would have dropped it with a loud, resultant thud after clapping my eyes on this."
    "幸好刚才已经把手里的爱情小说放回去了，不然一看见这个，我恐怕就会失手让它咚地掉到地上。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1693
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_22489e42_1:

    # Merel "So, whaddaya think? It’s kinda wild, isn’t it?"
