    # Merel "I can’t believe a book like this is lyin’ around here: not with Jenny at the desk! She seems like such a nice girl..."
    Merel "这里居然会摆着这种书，真不敢相信！还是珍妮在看店呢，她看着明明是个好姑娘……"

