    Merel "不过，人不可貌相嘛，哇哈哈！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1699
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d2dbbaf2_1:

    # Merel "D’you think she’s into this kind of thing, Nienke? D’you think I should ask?!"
    Merel "妮恩克，你说她喜欢这种东西吗？要不我去问问？！"

