    Merel "如果你觉得封面就够露骨了，那跟里面比可差远了！有些姿势，我都没想过人能摆得出来！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1717
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4caae980_1:

    # Merel "You’d have to be really, really flexible to pull some of this off. Don’t you think it’s funny, Nienke?"
    Merel "身体得特别、特别柔软才做得到吧。妮恩克，你不觉得好玩吗？"

