    # "Merel nudges me in the side with her elbow. She seems genuinely confused by my reaction — or lack of, I suppose, since I’ve yet to say anything about this..."
    "梅蕾尔拿胳膊肘轻轻碰我。她似乎真不明白我为什么这么反应。或者说，为什么没反应，毕竟我还一句评价都没说……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1726
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ae54b0eb_1:

    # "B-But what did she expect?!"
    "可、可她还想让我怎么样？！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1728
