translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ced4ae9e_1:

    # "B-But, since Merel told me the insides were even worse, I feel compelled to take a look!"
    "可、可梅蕾尔偏偏说里面更夸张，弄得我忍不住想翻开看看！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1745
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_49ca54e3_1:

