    # Merel "Oh, I think you do know what I mean! You’ve been starin’ at that book {i}pre~tty{/i} hard, hihihi~"
    Merel "哦，我看你清楚得很嘛！你盯着这书，看得可是{i}相～当{/i}认真呢，嘻嘻～"

