    # Merel "Then, we’ll have to buy it. We won’t have any choice: not if you wind up damagin’ it. You’d have to take responsibility, Nienke! Should we buy it?"
    Merel "那我们就只能买下来了。真弄坏了，可没得选。妮恩克，你得负责呀！要不要买？"

