    # Nienke "Wh-What? Wh-Why would I do that?!"
    Nienke "什、什么？我、我为什么要买？！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1755
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c486b7f1_1:

    # Merel "Well, why not? You seem like you’re into it!"
    Merel "为什么不买？你看着挺喜欢呀！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1763
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7386fd45_1:

    # Nienke "N-No, um... I-I don’t... I-I mean..."
    Nienke "不、不是，嗯……我、我没……我、我是说……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1764
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7d524051_1:

    # "Abashed, I open my mouth."
    "我羞得张开嘴。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1766
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d789e010_1:

    # "Aghast, I close it."
    "又惊慌地闭上。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1768
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_da0909ad_1:

    # "Then, my face on fire, I cry..."
    "最后，满脸滚烫地叫出声……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1777
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2264f476_1:

    # Nienke "I-I’m not interested in this book at all! I couldn’t care less about what women who love one another do their spare time! I-It’s not like I’m the target audience for this kind of thing!"
    Nienke "我、我对这本书一点兴趣都没有！相爱的女人私底下做什么，跟我有什么关系！我、我又不是这种书的读者！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1778
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f8f8e92a_1:

    # Nienke "I’m really, seriously not interested! You’re such an idiot, Merel!!!"
    Nienke "我真的、真的没兴趣！梅蕾尔，你这个大笨蛋！！！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1792
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0fa4f8e8_1:

    # Jenny "Wha...?!"
    Jenny "什……？！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1793
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_98660aa3_1:

    # "Jenny was in the midst of refining one of her sketches, but my loud yell must have jerked her to attention."
    "珍妮正忙着修改一张素描，大概被我的叫声吓了一跳。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1794
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1d09b8d8_1:

    # "She snaps her head up, her eyes wide, just in time to see me leaving the shop..."
    "她猛地抬头，睁大眼睛，正好看见我往店门口走……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1796
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_65bbfaeb_1:

    # Merel "Hey, Nienke, wait!"
    Merel "喂，妮恩克，等等！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1797
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ee9dc00b_1:

    # Jenny "Nienke...?!"
    Jenny "妮恩克……？！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1799
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9b732764_1:

    # Nienke "{sc=3}Eek?!{/sc}"
    Nienke "{sc=3}呀？！{/sc}"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1800
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c3249556_1:

    # "Or, at least, I mean to leave the shop."
    "至少，我本来是想离开书店的。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1801
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8b7d0d19_1:

    # "I don’t get very far, however."
    "可惜，没走出多远。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1809
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f4620256_1:

    # "In my haste to depart, I somehow manage to stumble over my own feet. Then, I list dramatically to one side."
    "急着出门，我不知怎么竟绊到了自己的脚，整个人猛地歪向一边。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1810
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7b3508b4_1:

    # "I fall through the air, my long hair fluttering around my shoulders; my lips curved into an ‘o’ of surprise..."
    "身体在半空中栽倒，长发在肩边飞扬，嘴巴惊得张成了圆形……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1815
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8c1dc888_1:

    # "And I crash into one of the bookcases."
    "然后撞上了一座书架。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1816
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c85e3d62_1:

    # "The bookcase groans in response, like an elderly man who’s suffering from a particularly painful bout of indigestion."
    "书架呻吟了一声，像个正被严重消化不良折磨的老头。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1817
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_176e3f59_1:

    # "It shifts, dislodging books in the process, several tomes falling to the floor like butterflies."
    "它晃动起来，几本书被震落，像蝴蝶似的扑向地面。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1818
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ff3d3b0d_1:

    # "Then, the bookcase is tipped over backwards."
    "紧接着，整座书架向后翻倒。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1820
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_29c85b97_1:

    # "It hits the wall behind it with a dull, wooden thud..."
    "木头重重撞上后面的墙，发出沉闷的一声……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1829
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_977ca769_1:

    # Nienke "O-Ow... That hurt..."
    Nienke "呜、呜……好痛……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1830
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5cc96abc_1:

    # "While I simultaneously hit the floor."
    "与此同时，我也摔到了地上。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1832
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_42e45791_1:

    # "I wince, winded, pressing one hand to my behind. It’s throbbing uncomfortably, but my own physical discomfort is the last of my worries."
    "我痛得皱起脸，喘不过气，一只手捂着屁股。那里一阵阵地疼，可眼下最不值得操心的，就是这点皮肉之苦。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1833
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c3049307_1:

    # "It looks that I’ve made a pretty big mess."
    "我好像闯了个不小的祸。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1834
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ef6ec2e6_1:

    # "That bookcase is lying on one side like a beached whale, and all of the books..."
    "书架像搁浅的鲸鱼一样倒在一边，那些书……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1837
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_055d595a_1:

    # Jenny "Oh no...! What am I gonna tell my dad? He’ll hit the roof when he sees this!"
    Jenny "天哪……！这让我怎么跟爸爸说？他看见肯定要气炸了！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1838
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_da6a83ad_1:

    # "They’re scattered across the floor, just like autumn leaves."
    "散了一地，像满地秋叶。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1840
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b44e6483_1:

    # "...Well. So much for my dramatic exit."
    "……好吧。我的气势汹汹离场，就这么收场了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1842
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2b8f6f4f_1:

    # "I’m such an idiot."
    "我真是个笨蛋。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1863
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c987f83a_3:

    # "{i}Brush, brush, brush.{/i}"
    "{i}梳啊，梳啊，梳啊。{/i}"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1864
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_eb87fbf1_1:

    # Merel "Hey, um, Nienke? Are you still mad at me?"
    Merel "喂，那个，妮恩克？还在生我的气吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1865
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c987f83a_4:

    # "{i}Brush, brush, brush.{/i}"
    "{i}梳啊，梳啊，梳啊。{/i}"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1867
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_382a12a2_1:

    # Merel "Um, Nienke? Are you plannin’ to talk to me any time soon?"
    Merel "妮恩克？你打算什么时候跟我说话呀？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1868
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c987f83a_5:

    # "{i}Brush, brush, brush.{/i}"
    "{i}梳啊，梳啊，梳啊。{/i}"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1873
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8e794793_1:

    # Merel "Nienke? Earth to Nienke? You aren’t seriously gonna ignore me all night, are you? I already said I was sorry!"
    Merel "妮恩克？妮恩克，听得见吗？你不会真打算一晚上不理我吧？我已经道过歉了！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1875
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9d92ef5d_1:

    # "I can see Merel’s expression reflected at me in the mirror of my vanity, hovering just over my shoulder, but I don’t bother replying to her."
    "梳妆镜里，梅蕾尔的脸就在我的肩膀上方。我看得见她的表情，却懒得回答。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1879
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_52596e20_1:

    # "I don’t see the point."
    "没那个必要。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1881
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a1c5bd31_1:

    # "Why should I talk to her, after she pulled that ridiculous, childish prank with that... that... that {i}filthy{/i} book back in The Book Nook?"
    "在书角拿那本……那本……那本{i}不知羞{/i}的书，开了那么荒唐幼稚的玩笑，我凭什么还要理她？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1883
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9418d020_1:

    # "If it wasn’t for her, I never would have noticed that book in the shop at all — and even if I had noticed it on my own, I never would’ve picked it up..."
    "要不是她，我根本不会注意到那本书。就算自己看见了，也绝不会拿起来……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1884
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5ecac999_1:

    # "And, even if I had picked it up, I wouldn’t have gone thumbing through it..."
    "就算拿起来，也不会翻看……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1886
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_bb88cec6_1:

    # "And, even if I had gone thumbing through it, I wouldn’t have lingered for such a long time on all of those depictions of women tangled up together, involved in..."
    "就算翻看，也不会盯着那些女人纠缠在一起，做着……做着那种事的画面，看那么久……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1888
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d17e0ee5_1:

    # Merel "Nienke, pleaaaase! You’ve been ignorin’ me ever since we got back from the shop!"
    Merel "妮恩克，拜——托！从书店回来，你就一直不理我！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1890
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_424cc11b_1:

    # "In..."
    "做着……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1892
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_520001a3_1:

    # Merel "Can’t you at least turn to look at me? You don’t gotta talk to me, I just want you to acknowledge that I’m here!"
    Merel "至少转过来看我一眼吧？不说话也行，我只是想让你表示一下，知道我在这里！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1894
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2fafbb3b_1:

    # "In all sorts of carnal activities!!!"
    "各种肉欲之事！！！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1896
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3cfff677_1:

    # Merel "I’m getting all lonely here, being ignored by you like this! You’re makin’ me feel like I did something wrong! I didn’t seriously upset you, did I?"
    Merel "你一直不理我，我很寂寞耶！弄得好像我做错什么一样。我真把你惹得这么生气吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1898
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2ad8f104_3:

    # Nienke "...Hmph."
    Nienke "……哼。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1900
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5660d42e_1:

    # "Once again, I refuse to dignify this question with an answer. I don’t think Merel deserves it."
    "我再次拒绝回答。这个问题不值得我回答，梅蕾尔也不配。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1901
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1664ebcb_1:

    # "I continue to look away from her pointedly..."
    "我继续故意看向别处……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1903
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a043a286_1:

    # "Or, at least, I {i}try{/i} to look away from her pointedly. It’s a bit hard to do that, however, when I’m in the middle of brushing my hair, sat at my vanity table."
    "至少，{i}努力{/i}这么做。可我正在梳妆台前梳头，想躲开还真有点难。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1905
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7f300328_1:

    # "I started brushing my hair as a means to avoid Merel, but I can still see her reflection in the mirror."
    "本来拿起梳子，就是为了不理梅蕾尔，偏偏镜子里还是能看见她。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1906
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_79e24223_1:

    # "I can see her looking at me, her eyes boring into my own."
    "她一直望着我，视线仿佛要钻进我的眼睛。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1907
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4d5faf57_1:

    # "She’s pouting, waiting for some sort of apology..."
    "她噘着嘴，像在等我说句什么，赔个不是……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1908
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a3e405ce_1:

    # "But if that’s what she’s after, I’m afraid she won’t be getting it. She embarrassed me so much, she might as well be dead to me."
    "要是她想等这个，那可等不着。让我那么丢脸，我都想当她不存在了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1910
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6596c31c_1:

    # "She’s a jerk, and I want nothing to do with her whatsoever, so {i}there!{/i} Hmph!!!"
    "她就是个讨厌鬼，我一点也不想跟她扯上关系。{i}就是这样！{/i}哼！！！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1924
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_78ea9666_1:

    # "I’m in a bad mood when I finish brushing my hair, and when I turn in for the night."
    "梳完头，准备睡觉时，我心情还是很差。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1925
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_01a10d5b_1:

    # "Merel tries to apologise once again as I slide beneath the sheets, but I’m not having any of it."
    "我钻进被窝，梅蕾尔又试着道了一次歉，可我不想听。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1926
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5327bf19_1:

    # "I stare at the wall pointedly, trying to ignore her."
    "我故意盯着墙，努力无视她。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1927
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_525e0308_1:

    # "A few awkward minutes pass like this until Merel eventually gives in. She sighs, doubtless realising I’m not to be swayed, and mumbles..."
    "几分钟就在尴尬中过去了，梅蕾尔终于放弃。她叹了口气，大概明白我不会心软，低声说……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1937
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f607090f_1:

    # Merel "Oh, alright. Have it your way. You don’t need to talk to me, Nienke, if you don’t wanna, but I wish you’d at least acknowledge what I’m saying."
    Merel "好吧，随你。妮恩克，不想说话就不说吧，可至少让我知道，你听见我说什么了嘛。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1939
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7291ea99_1:

    # Merel "We’ll have to work together tomorrow, y’know? You can’t just ignore me then, can you?"
    Merel "明天还得一起工作呢。到时候总不能也不理我吧？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1940
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_04ed3b65_1:

    # "Ha. If Merel thinks I can’t ignore her, then she’s sorely mistaken."
    "呵。如果她觉得我做不到，那可大错特错了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1941
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d00fbe25_1:

    # "I’ll show her. She has no idea what it means to be ignored yet!"
    "我会让她见识的。她还不知道，什么才叫彻底无视！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1942
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_fd960039_1:

    # "Mwohohohoho!"
    "哦呵呵呵呵！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1956
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_fcd7f803_1:

    # "I continue my silent treatment the following morning, when we’re having breakfast, and later in the staff room when we both get changed."
    "第二天早上吃饭时，我继续不理她。后来一起在休息室换衣服，也一样。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1957
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_445228a2_1:

    # "Merel doesn’t ask for my help getting her dress on this time, thank goodness, so I’m able to avoid her."
    "谢天谢地，这次她没让我帮忙穿裙子，我也就能继续躲着她。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1958
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_13ca3d98_1:

    # "I finish zipping up my own maid’s dress and fastening my apron, then head out into the café to commence a brand new work day."
    "拉好自己女仆裙的拉链，系好围裙，我走进咖啡馆，开始新一天的工作。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1959
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_78fd79b2_1:

    # "All the while, as I work, I make it a point to avoid Merel. I let her work on the left-hand side of the café, while I take the right."
    "工作时，我也始终刻意避开梅蕾尔。她负责店的左半边，我负责右半边。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1960
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a49ea0d5_1:

    # "Things seem to be working out for the most part. I don’t speak to Merel, or even look at her, but we’re unusually busy today, and I’m not sure if any of our patrons have noticed the rift between us."
    "大体上还算顺利。我不跟她说话，也不看她。不过今天格外忙，不知道客人有没有发现我们之间的别扭。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1961
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_11146963_1:

    # "I’d rather not think about this rift myself, either. I just want to focus on my work."
    "我自己也不愿想这件事，只想专心工作。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1962
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_45871b1a_1:

    # "I don’t feel especially conscious of Merel’s company, and it’s not like I jump when she passes me by, holding a tray laden with cakes and teacups for a family of six. I don’t care at all!"
    "我又没有特别在意她。她端着满是蛋糕和茶杯的托盘，从我旁边经过，去招待一家六口时，我也才没有吓得一跳。我一点都不在乎！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1963
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b9a7c9cb_1:

    # "I keep telling myself that, at least, throughout the work day: as I take orders and wipe down tables..."
    "至少，整天点单、擦桌子时，我都这么告诉自己……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1964
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a29a6b55_1:

    # "But I still feel a little flustered about that silly book Merel showed me yesterday. It keeps surfacing to the forefront of my mind, unbidden, like a snatch of some half-remembered song from childhood."
    "可昨天那本破书，还是让我有点心慌。它总是不请自来地浮上脑海，像小时候听过、如今只记得半句的歌。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1965
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a8003f6d_1:

    # "It continues to torment me, as though superimposed beneath my eyelids."
    "那些画面仿佛叠在眼皮下面，纠缠不休。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1966
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_414c149a_1:

    # "Whenever I blink, I see it: the two women on that front cover, arranged in an amorous embrace..."
    "每次眨眼，我就看见封面上的两个女人，亲昵地拥抱在一起……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1978
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_64db716a_1:

    # VD "Well, I never! What in the world is wrong with you, Nienke? You don’t usually make mistakes like this."
    VD "真是岂有此理！妮恩克，你到底怎么了？你以前可不会犯这种错。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1979
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9fdbc474_1:

    # VD "I always thought that you were a sensible girl, but you’ve been acting awfully distracted lately."
    VD "我一直以为你是个稳重的孩子，最近却总是心不在焉。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1981
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a50eeaa5_1:

    # VD "How could you have made such a simple error with my order? This is getting to be beyond a joke!"
    VD "我点的东西，这么简单都能记错？实在太不像话了！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1983
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_846107a8_1:

    # "Which might be why I wind up making a mistake with Mrs van Dijk’s order."
    "所以，我才会把范戴克太太的单子弄错吧。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1991
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a87ea385_1:

    # "I must have written down her order incorrectly, because instead of the apple strudel she asked for, I’ve actually served her a piece of battenburg cake."
    "一定是记录时出了岔子。她要的是苹果卷，我端来的却是一块巴滕伯格蛋糕。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1993
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_bc509f3d_1:

    # "The battenburg looks rather appetising, if I do say so myself. It’s a small, squarish cake made out of pastel pink and pale yellow sponge, all coated in marzipan."
    "虽说有自卖自夸的嫌疑，这蛋糕看着确实很诱人。小小的方块，粉色和浅黄色的海绵蛋糕拼在一起，外面裹着杏仁糖膏。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1994
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1268ffe7_1:

    # "It’s a very sweet confection, however, which some people might find sickly."
    "不过它非常甜，有些人可能会觉得腻。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1995
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_48ddeced_1:

    # "The soft coating of marzipan around the cake, meanwhile, can cause problems for people with weak teeth: especially elderly people like Mrs van Dijk."
    "外面那层软软的杏仁糖膏，对牙口不好的人也不太友好，尤其范戴克太太这样的老人。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1997
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0d4a9af3_1:

    # "I’m not sure why I brought her a piece of battenburg cake, of all things. I should have known that Mrs van Dijk wouldn’t want to eat something like this."
    "我怎么偏偏给她端了这种蛋糕？明明该知道，她不会想吃这个。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:1999
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_02706c12_1:

    # "Her tastes are rather mild, and she rarely selects sweet items from our menu: not the excessively sweet ones, at least."
    "她口味偏清淡，很少点菜单上的甜食，至少不会点甜得过头的。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2000
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_60d0d1b2_1:

    # "She gives the chocolate gateaus and strawberry shortcakes a wide berth, and she typically plumps for the simpler options: poppyseed cake, scones, and (in this case) a simple apple strudel."
    "巧克力奶油蛋糕和草莓奶油蛋糕，她都敬而远之，通常只选简单的：罂粟籽蛋糕、司康，或者像这次，一份普通的苹果卷。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2002
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2579644c_1:

    # "I’m not sure how I misconstrued ‘apple strudel’ as ‘batternburg’, but there is one thing I am certain of: Mrs van Dijk is incensed."
    "我不知道自己怎么会把“苹果卷”听成“巴滕伯格”，但有一点很确定：范戴克太太气坏了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2012
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_07015fd7_1:

    # VD "Now, look here, Nienke. I try to be patient with you, because I’ve known you since you were a small girl."
    VD "听着，妮恩克。我愿意对你多些耐心，因为从你还是个小姑娘起，我就认识你。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2014
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e7fc12dd_1:

    # VD "You’re very diligent — or, at least, you usually are — and though you were a bit slow to pick up the piano, I don’t doubt that you did your best."
    VD "你做事很认真，至少平时如此。虽然钢琴学得慢了点，可我从不怀疑你已经尽力了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2016
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c88b2549_1:

    # VD "I might be a cantankerous, crotchety old lady, but I’m not completely unreasonable. I don’t lay into people for the sake of it, you know?"
    VD "我是个脾气坏、爱挑剔的老太太，但也不是完全不讲道理。我不会平白无故就训人，明白吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2018
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_494160b8_1:

    # VD "I take no pleasure in scolding people: especially not you. I am fond of you, whether or not you believe it, but {i}this—{/i}"
    VD "我不以教训人为乐，尤其不想训你。不管你信不信，我是真心喜欢你这个孩子，可{i}这——{/i}"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2020
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_dfc94218_1:

    # "Mrs van Dijk gestures towards her pastel slice of (seemingly) unassuming battenburg."
    "范戴克太太指了指眼前那片颜色柔和、看起来人畜无害的巴滕伯格蛋糕。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2021
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3584f3b5_1:

    # VD "—simply isn’t acceptable! Do you know that I’m allergic to marzipan?"
    VD "——实在不像话！你知不知道，我对杏仁糖膏过敏？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2023
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_69125667_1:

    # Nienke "Oh, um..."
    Nienke "啊，那个……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2024
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ba99a7d4_1:

    # "I quail beneath Mrs van Dijk’s glare, my fingers twined at my front."
    "被范戴克太太瞪着，我畏缩起来，手指在身前绞成一团。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2026
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_083a0707_1:

    # "I didn’t know that Mrs van Dijk was allergic to marzipan, actually, which is a bit of a surprise. You would think the subject would come up, given I’ve known her for almost fifteen years..."
    "我还真不知道她对杏仁糖膏过敏，这有点让人意外。认识都快十五年了，按理说，总该聊到过……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2028
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a9478d59_1:

    # "But I suppose I’ve never been foolish enough to try and serve her a slice of battenburg cake before. This is definitely a new low for me."
    "不过，我以前也没蠢到给她端一片巴滕伯格蛋糕。这回真是又刷新了自己的下限。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2030
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4d336c56_1:

    # Nienke "I, um... I-I’m really very sorry. I, um, d-didn’t know..."
    Nienke "我，那个……真、真的很抱歉。我、我不知道……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2031
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_62d2f2a7_1:

    # VD "Yes, I know you didn’t, but now, you do. You really must be more careful in the future."
    VD "是，我知道你不知道。可现在知道了，以后一定要更小心。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2035
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7c02c34f_1:

    # VD "My vision is still impeccable for such an old woman, perhaps down to my years of playing the piano, so I knew not to touch that cake."
    VD "我这么大年纪，眼神还很好，或许是多年弹钢琴练出来的。所以一看就知道，这蛋糕不能碰。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2037
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_092897bb_1:

    # VD "What if you’d made a similar mistake with a customer less perceptive than I, though?"
    VD "可你要是对别的客人也犯这种错，而人家又没我这么仔细呢？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2038
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c493444c_1:

    # VD "That really might have spelled disaster."
    VD "那可真会酿成大祸。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2040
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b9312fa5_1:

    # VD "You need to think, Nienke. As much as I care for you, I cannot condone a mistake like this."
    VD "妮恩克，你得动动脑子。再怎么喜欢你，我也不能纵容这种错误。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2042
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4b2262cf_1:

    # VD "You’re already twenty years old, for goodness’ sake. You should be too old to make such a simple error!"
    VD "老天，你都二十岁了！这么大的人，还不该懂得避免这种低级错误吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2043
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0e74eafd_1:

    # VD "Why are you drifting about with your head in the clouds, anyway? If you can’t pay attention to your customers and their needs, then you’ve no place serving anybody."
    VD "你到底为什么整天神游天外？连客人和他们的需求都没法留心，还怎么招待别人？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2044
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_451efd22_1:

    # VD "It’s an insult to me, and to the rest of your customers, that you aren’t paying us our due attention. Why don’t you use some common sense?"
    VD "该给我们的重视，你却没给。这不光是对我的怠慢，也是对其他客人的。能不能长点心？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2046
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_eec03e7b_1:

    # Nienke "I-I, um... I-I’m very—"
    Nienke "我、我，嗯……我真的很——"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2048
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e81e7317_1:

    # "{i}Sorry,{/i} I mean to say, but I can’t get the word out. It catches in my throat like a burr, large and spiky against my throat, and I wince."
    "我想说{i}抱歉{/i}，可那个词却像一团又大又扎人的刺果，卡在喉咙里，怎么也吐不出来。我难受地皱起脸。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2053
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9460cfff_1:

    # "I don’t want to cry over something like this, but my eyes start to sting regardless."
    "我不想因为这种事掉眼泪，眼眶却还是开始发酸。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2054
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b7a69e6f_1:

    # "I don’t resent Mrs van Dijk for her remarks, but hasn’t she been thorough enough in dressing me down?"
    "我不是怨范戴克太太说我，可她训得还不够吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2056
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_fc757292_1:

    # "I already get the point! She doesn’t need to labour it so much..."
    "我已经明白了啊！用不着一遍遍地强调……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2069
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0c756d5d_1:

    # Merel "Hey, hey, hey! What’s going on here?"
    Merel "喂，喂，怎么了？这里出什么事啦？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2071
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e47230df_1:

    # "And, to make matters worse, Merel has now noticed that something’s amiss."
    "更糟的是，梅蕾尔现在也注意到不对劲了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2073
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2a80bc44_1:

    # Merel "Did Nienke do something to upset you, Mrs VD?"
    Merel "范太太，妮恩克做了什么，惹您不高兴了吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2075
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d91898bf_1:

    # "VD? Since when did Merel refer to the indomitable Mrs van Dijk as Mrs VD?"
    "范太太？她什么时候开始这样简称这位威风凛凛的范戴克太太了？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2077
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8c72ac24_1:

    # "I knew that Mrs van Dijk had a soft spot for Merel, but I didn’t realise they were that close!"
    "我知道范戴克太太偏爱梅蕾尔，可不知道已经亲近到这份上了！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2081
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d306f749_1:

    # "I’m sure, if I tried to shorten Mrs van Dijk’s name like that, she’d have my guts for garters..."
    "换了我，敢这么把她的名字缩短，肯定要被她扒下一层皮……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2083
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5b31fcb3_1:

    # "Um, whatever that means."
    "呃，虽然我也不太清楚这句话到底什么意思。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2085
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_316c1fb3_1:

    # "I look back at Mrs van Dijk, utterly bemused. I’m expecting to her raise an issue over this casual form of address, but..."
    "我困惑地看回范戴克太太，等着她挑这随便称呼的毛病。可是……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2087
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7c31d994_1:

    # VD "Yes, indeed, she did."
    VD "是啊，确实有。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2089
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_dfb5b520_1:

    # VD "She caused quite a bit of upset, actually. You see, this girl—"
    VD "还真把我气得不轻。你看，这姑娘——"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2091
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7271856f_1:

    # "So, I’m ‘this girl’, am I? Do I not even get the privilege of being addressed by my name anymore? That’s harsh..."
    "现在变成“这姑娘”了？我连被叫名字的资格都没了吗？好过分……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2093
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4e935710_1:

    # VD "—has made a huge error. She brought me a slice of battenburg cake, when I am allergic to marzipan."
    VD "——犯了个大错。我对杏仁糖膏过敏，她却给我端了一片巴滕伯格蛋糕。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2095
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e9d60100_1:

    # VD "I was simply trying to correct her about this grave oversight. A single bite of that cake might very well be enough to leave me wheezing!"
    VD "我只是在纠正她这个严重的疏忽。那蛋糕，哪怕只吃一口，都可能让我喘不上气！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2098
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4c8006b6_1:

    # Merel "Oh no! That does sound serious. I’m sorry Nienke did somethin’ so thoughtless, but I’m sure it wasn’t deliberate."
    Merel "天哪！那确实严重。妮恩克这么不小心，真对不起您。不过，我相信她不是故意的。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2102
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_121a7674_1:

    # Merel "You didn’t mean to hurt Mrs VD, did you?"
    Merel "你没想伤害范太太，对吧？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2104
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_84044303_1:

    # Nienke "Of course not! I-It was all an accident!"
    Nienke "当然没有！这、这只是个意外！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2106
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5faea1a6_1:

    # VD "A potentially lethal one. There are some things too serious to be waved aside as mere accidents, Nienke: especially at your age."
    VD "是可能致命的意外。有些事太严重，不能轻飘飘一句“意外”就揭过去，妮恩克，尤其你已经这个年纪了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2110
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ef4029af_1:

    # Merel "Yeah, I kinda agree. Nienke should pay more attention when she’s on the clock, so things like this don’t happen..."
    Merel "嗯，这我也赞同。上班时，妮恩克是该多留心，才不会发生这种事……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2112
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f5536078_1:

    # Merel "But let’s try to look on the bright side! No harm was done in the end!"
    Merel "不过，我们也往好的方面想想嘛！最后并没有人受伤呀！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2114
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ef36240d_1:

    # Merel "I know it must be annoyin’, being served something you’re allergic to, but Nienke didn’t wanna cause any fuss! She was just...{w} drifting off, I guess, and she wasn’t really thinking."
    Merel "端来的东西自己过敏，肯定让人不高兴，这我懂。可妮恩克真没想惹麻烦！她只是……{w}走神了吧，没顾上多想。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2116
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_075b324a_1:

    # Merel "I know that’s no excuse, but I think she’s learned the error of her ways! I think she’s been spacin’ out, is all, ’cause she’s been workin’ too hard!"
    Merel "我知道这不能当借口，但她肯定已经认识到错误了！我想她只是最近工作太辛苦，所以有点恍惚！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2118
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_892b0194_1:

    # VD "Too hard?"
    VD "太辛苦？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2120
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_959559bf_1:

    # "Mrs van Dijk frowns. There’s a small pause, and then..."
    "范戴克太太皱起眉，停顿片刻，然后……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2122
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6e69408f_1:

    # VD "Well, I suppose she has been serving the customers more or less on her own, ever since Willemijn had to take time off."
    VD "嗯，自从威廉敏请假以来，客人确实差不多都由她一个人照顾。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2123
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f6bd05ca_1:

    # VD "It must have been rather trying. She does often look rather distracted..."
    VD "想必不轻松。她最近是经常心不在焉……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2125
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3cad5aed_1:

    # Merel "There, y’see? If Nienke looks distracted, it’s ’cause she’s trying to do way too much!"
    Merel "您看，就是这样嘛！她看着走神，是因为想做的事太多啦！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2127
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_457e5778_1:

    # Merel "I’m here now, of course, to help take some of the load off, but she’s still been pushing herself way too hard for way too long!"
    Merel "我现在来了，是能帮她分担一点，可她一个人撑得太久，也逼自己太紧了！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2129
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_41fdaffc_1:

    # Merel "Can’t you have a heart, Mrs VD? Please, don’t scold her too much! She’s really tryin’!"
    Merel "范太太，您就心软一下吧？别再训她了，好不好？她真的很努力！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2131
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ef5b8201_1:

    # VD "Hmm. Well, I am not one to coddle people over their mistakes, but I do realise that no harm was meant here."
    VD "嗯。我不会因为心软就纵容别人犯错，不过，我也知道这次不是存心的。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2132
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b09411f3_1:

    # VD "Perhaps I was a bit too...{w} ahem, enthusiastic in my scolding. I will be the first to admit I can be a bit too eager sometimes."
    VD "也许，我教训得确实有点……{w}咳，过于起劲了。我不否认，自己有时是容易说过头。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2134
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7e4e1f7a_1:

    # VD "I apologise, Nienke, for belabouring the point. You’re a smart girl, so I’m certain you already understand the error of your ways."
    VD "妮恩克，对不起，不该翻来覆去地说。你是聪明孩子，肯定已经明白自己错在哪里了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2136
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_229ab951_1:

    # Nienke "O-Oh, no, um... Th-That’s alright. I should be the one to apologise, really, for causing such a fuss."
    Nienke "啊、不，那个……没、没关系。给您添了这么多麻烦，真的该道歉的是我。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2138
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ff1c1cb5_1:

    # Nienke "I’m, um, very sorry..."
    Nienke "我，嗯，非常抱歉……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2146
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1a1a494a_1:

    # "I mutter an apology, my thoughts racing all the while."
    "我低声道歉，心里却翻来覆去地想着另一件事。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2148
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d7996c75_1:

    # "Why did Merel come to my defence like that?"
    "梅蕾尔为什么要这样替我解围？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2150
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7c8da2a9_1:

    # "I’m not sure if I really deserve it; not when I spent all of last night, and most of today, steadfastly ignoring her."
    "我不知道自己配不配。明明整个昨晚，还有今天的大半天，我都铁了心不理她。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2151
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_41866c08_1:

    # "If I were in Merel’s position, I wouldn’t care at all about seeing me get scolded."
    "换成我是梅蕾尔，看见我被训，肯定懒得管。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2153
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f4730dd2_1:

    # "In fact, I’d probably think it was deserved — and, in this case, I’m afraid it really might have been. I did get Mrs van Dijk’s order disastrously wrong."
    "甚至会觉得活该。而这次，恐怕也确实如此。我把范戴克太太的单子弄得一塌糊涂。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2154
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_395d70ee_1:

    # "I don’t think I deserve to be defended..."
    "我不觉得自己值得有人出面维护……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2156
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_bba1b313_1:

    # "But there {i}is{/i} something almost nostalgic about this."
    "可这一幕，{i}确实{/i}有种近乎怀念的感觉。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2158
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_bf907226_1:

    # "I can remember something similar happening when I was a child. I got into a scrape, and somebody leapt to my defence."
    "小时候，好像也发生过类似的事。我遇上麻烦，有个人立刻站出来护着我。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2160
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d40b4380_1:

    # "I’m pretty sure they said..."
    "她当时好像说……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2172
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_76912169_1:

    # W "{i}You leave Nienke alone! She didn’t do anythin’ wrong. You’re pathetic, picking on her because she won’t roll over and take your abuse!{/i}"
    W "{i}不许欺负妮恩克！她又没做错！就因为她不肯任你们欺负，就专门找她麻烦，你们也太没出息了！{/i}"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2176
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a9538944_1:

    # W "{i}I know Niene might be small, but she makes you feel even smaller: isn’t that right?{/i}"
    W "{i}妮妮个子是小，可在她面前，你们觉得自己更矮一截，对不对？{/i}"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2177
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_94e69195_1:

    # W "{i}You think, if you can intimidate her, then it’ll prove how strong and manly you are, but that’s ridiculous!{/i}"
    W "{i}以为吓住她，就能证明自己厉害、有男子气概？简直可笑！{/i}"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2178
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7bdb8177_1:

    # W "{i}All it does is show how pitiful you are, that you have to make yourselves feel better by hurting somebody so much smaller than you!{/i}"
    W "{i}非要欺负一个比自己小那么多的人，才能让自己舒服一点，这只说明你们有多可怜！{/i}"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2179
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7a18ac26_1:

    # W "{i}Now, leave her alone! Scram! Shoo! Don’t let me catch you botherin’ my Niene again!{/i}"
    W "{i}离她远点！滚开！走开！别再让我看见你们欺负我的妮妮！{/i}"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2180
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_53b6f014_1:

    # W "{i}If you do, you’ll be in for a whole world of hurt!{/i}"
    W "{i}不然，有你们好受的！{/i}"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2193
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_10f62634_1:

    # "...Hmm. I’ve never given these dreams too much thought before, but they feel familiar now."
    "……嗯。以前从没仔细想过这些梦，现在却觉得好熟悉。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2195
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_94b6f6fb_1:

    # "I wonder."
    "难道说……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2196
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_15b47098_1:

    # "Could my knight in shining armour have been Merel all along...?"
    "一直以来，那个救我的骑士，都是梅蕾尔……？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2210
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b6bbf5d0_1:

    # "Later that night finds me sitting at my vanity, running a brush diligently through my hair."
    "当天晚上，我又坐在梳妆台前，认认真真地梳着头。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2211
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b1091fc7_1:

    # "My hair occupies a lot of my time at night, once I’ve finished in the bathtub. I usually spend at least ten minutes working on it: sliding the bristles of my brush through it so it crackles."
    "每天洗完澡，头发都要占去我不少时间。通常至少得花十分钟，让梳齿一遍遍穿过发丝，梳得细细作响。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2212
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5bd65ec2_1:

    # "Sometimes, I find this ritual tiring."
    "有时候，这个步骤很累人。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2213
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e13d4332_1:

    # "At other times, however, it’s soothing. It stops me from thinking about things — or {i}over{/i}thinking things, rather."
    "有时候却又让人安心，能让我不再想事情。准确说，是不再{i}胡思乱想{/i}。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2214
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e65f8349_1:

    # "Keeping my arm occupied helps to keep my mind occupied, too. It keeps me too busy to worry about things, and I’ve been worrying rather a lot lately."
    "胳膊忙起来，脑子也就有事可做，顾不上烦恼。最近，我烦心的事实在太多了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2215
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f7ead8df_1:

    # "I’m not sure why, but my thoughts keep on turning to Merel. She’s weighing on my mind heavily, but why is that?"
    "不知道为什么，思绪总绕回梅蕾尔。她一直压在我心头，到底为什么呢？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2216
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1c911986_1:

    # "She might claim that we’re close friends, but I barely know her. She’s little more than a stranger to me."
    "她说我们是很好的朋友，可我几乎不了解她。对我来说，她跟陌生人没什么两样。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2217
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c89a0ba1_1:

    # "I know I shouldn’t think about her so much, and yet..."
    "我知道，不该总想着她。可是……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2230
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5d983fab_1:

    # Nienke "Haa..."
    Nienke "唉……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2231
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_82ba797d_1:

    # "I can’t help myself."
    "就是忍不住。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2233
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b20c0ac0_1:

    # "Merel is never far from my mind, and it doesn’t help that she’s never far from my side, either."
    "脑子里总有梅蕾尔。而她本人也总待在我身边，更让人没办法。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2234
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_13e8dd79_1:

    # "I’m trying to ignore her pointedly, consumed by my regular hair brushing, but I’m not free from her."
    "我专心梳头，刻意不去理她，可还是摆脱不了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2242
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a59188fd_1:

    # "As if to prove my point, my bedroom door opens with a creak. Merel steps inside, a little damp from the bath; still faintly flushed."
    "仿佛为了证明这一点，房门吱呀一声开了。梅蕾尔走进来，洗过澡的身体还带着些湿气，脸上微微泛红。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2245
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_662bc546_1:

    # "Engelmund is by Merel’s shoes, rubbing his fluffy head against her bare right ankle."
    "恩格尔蒙德就在她鞋边，拿毛茸茸的脑袋蹭着她露出的右脚踝。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2247
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f0017ba9_1:

    # "He really must like her, to nuzzle against her like that when she has no food to hand."
    "她手上明明没有吃的，他还这么蹭。看来是真的喜欢她。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2248
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e0b050b5_1:

    # "I don’t sense any of Engelmund’s usual superciliousness in the way he’s cosying up to Merel, and the way he’s mewling is positively saccharine."
    "他黏着梅蕾尔的样子，半点没有平时的傲慢，连喵喵声都甜得发腻。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2252
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_81eb1e8c_1:

    # "I was annoyed by how easily Mrs van Dijk took to her, but I’m even more hurt about Engelmund."
    "范戴克太太那么容易就喜欢上她，已经让我不快了。可恩格尔蒙德这样，更让我受伤。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2253
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e5c2e103_1:

    # "It took him months before he felt comfortable nuzzling agianst me, and I rescued him from the streets, damn it!"
    "他花了好几个月，才肯放心地蹭我。而且，明明是我把他从街上救回来的啊！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2255
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_82797868_1:

    # "I look away from Merel pointedly, my pride stung. I don’t even want to acknowledge her, let alone speak to her."
    "自尊心受了伤，我故意把脸转开。别说跟她说话了，连表示一下注意到她都不想。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2257
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_433d71f5_1:

    # "I focus on my hair, running the bristles of my brush through it slowly, when..."
    "我只顾着头发，慢慢把梳齿从发间梳过去，就听见……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2259
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6eedfda9_1:

    # Merel "Hey, Nienke! How long have you been brushin’ your hair?"
    Merel "喂，妮恩克！你这头发梳多久啦？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2261
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_72c0947c_1:

    # Nienke "...A while."
    Nienke "……一会儿了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2263
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b13ae87a_1:

    # Merel "I figured as much! You were brushin’ your hair when I left for the bathroom, an’ you’re still doin’ it! You must take your hair real serious, wahaha!"
    Merel "我就知道！去浴室时你在梳，回来还在梳。你可真重视这头秀发，哇哈哈！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2265
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e5795ce6_1:

    # Nienke "Well, of course. My looks are important, and I do have a lot of hair. Taking care of it is a time-consuming process, but anything worth doing is worth doing properly."
    Nienke "那当然。外表很重要，我头发又多，打理起来当然费时间。不过，值得做的事，就值得好好做。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2269
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ec11cb62_1:

    # Nienke "Haven’t you heard that saying before?"
    Nienke "这句话你没听过吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2270
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_af215b03_1:

    # "It’s one of Mrs van Dijk’s favourites, as it happened. She trotted it out a lot during our piano lessons, but Merel looks none the wiser. She smiles, then says..."
    "其实，这正是范戴克太太最爱说的话之一，以前钢琴课上总能听见。可梅蕾尔似乎没听明白，只笑着说……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2272
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d4c9f1bc_1:

    # Merel "I dunno. can’t say I’ve ever cared all that much about my own looks, wahaha~"
    Merel "不知道耶。我对自己的外表没怎么上过心，哇哈哈～"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2274
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_eb58b156_1:

    # Merel "In fact, I’ve often thought about cuttin’ my hair. Having it this long is just a pain!"
    Merel "说真的，我经常想把头发剪了，留这么长真麻烦！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2275
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c67f1872_1:

    # "I was wondering about that, actually. I’m trying not to pay Merel more attention than is strictly necessary, but..."
    "我其实也在想这个。虽然尽量不多关注她，可还是……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2277
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_93f642b4_1:

    # Nienke "If you don’t care about your appearance, why did you let your hair grow so long?"
    Nienke "既然不在乎外表，为什么又把头发留这么长？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2279
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_63fe996a_1:

    # Merel "I guess I figured cuttin’ it would be a pain too, an’ I’ve never really known what style I want."
    Merel "大概觉得剪头发也麻烦吧，而且一直没想好要什么发型。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2280
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_985b4ce9_1:

    # Merel "It seemed easier to just let it grow out, though it’s gotten pretty heavy: ’specially after I bathe. It’s a huge hassle..."
    Merel "干脆让它长着，好像更省事。不过现在还挺沉的，尤其洗完澡，烦死啦……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2282
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3ce1eced_1:

    # Merel "But your hair looks like a hassle to take care of too! It’s so long and silky an’ straight, brushin’ it must take forever!"
    Merel "但你的头发看起来也不好打理呢！又长又顺又直，梳起来得花老半天吧！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2284
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_bf6f3420_1:

    # Nienke "It does tend to take me ten minutes each night, yes."
    Nienke "嗯，通常每晚都要十分钟。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2288
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8c7e45ab_1:

    # Merel "Ten minutes?!"
    Merel "十分钟？！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2292
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c25bf465_1:

    # Nienke "Yes, ten minutes — though sometimes, it can take even longer."
    Nienke "对，十分钟。有时候还会更久。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2293
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_81584264_1:

    # Merel "Longer, eh? And I barely brush my hair at all!"
    Merel "还更久啊？我可几乎不梳头！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2295
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_22020a67_1:

    # "I’m not surprised by that, though her laissez-faire response does make my nose wrinkle."
    "这倒不意外。不过，她这么随意地说出来，我还是忍不住皱了皱鼻子。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2297
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_cf583560_1:

    # Merel "I’d never be able to spend so much time on my hair! I think I’d go mad..."
    Merel "让我花这么多时间打理头发，我可受不了！肯定会疯的……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2299
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_be020df8_1:

    # Merel "But doesn’t brushin’ it for that long make your arm hurt, Nienke?"
    Merel "可是妮恩克，梳这么久，胳膊不会酸吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2301
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2fffcf1d_1:

    # Nienke "It can, but I’m used to it. It’s simply part of my routine."
    Nienke "会，不过习惯了。只是每天该做的事而已。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2303
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_84a9a09c_1:

    # Merel "Yeah, I get that. I figure you’re just doin’ what comes natural to you, Nienke, but..."
    Merel "嗯，我懂。对你来说，这就是顺理成章的事嘛。不过……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2305
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_65b0eb4f_1:

    # Merel "Hey! Why don’t you let me help?"
    Merel "对了！让我帮你怎么样？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2307
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_cada6ad6_1:

    # Nienke "Help how?"
    Nienke "怎么帮？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2309
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ea0748b2_1:

    # Merel "I mean, won’t’cha let me brush your hair? I don’t want your poor arms gettin’ sore: not when you have to do so much fetchin’ and carryin’ at work..."
    Merel "我帮你梳头呀？你上班已经得端来端去、跑来跑去了，我可不想让你的小胳膊再累酸……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2310
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0f59b7c6_1:

    # Merel "And I feel like I owe you, on account of what happened at the bookstore the other day. I’m afraid I might’ve embarrassed you just a little—"
    Merel "而且，那天书店的事，我觉得挺对不起你。可能让你稍微有一点难堪——"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2312
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ef461c5d_1:

    # "A little, she says. {i}A little.{/i}"
    "一点，她说。{i}一点。{/i}"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2313
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_fed4b7fd_1:

    # "That’s a rather generous estimation."
    "这可真是往轻了说。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2317
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_527d39fe_1:

    # Merel "—so I wanna make amends! Won’t you let me look after you, Nienke?"
    Merel "——所以我想补偿一下！妮恩克，就让我照顾你嘛？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2321
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b9aa59c7_1:

    # Nienke "Well..."
    Nienke "这个……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2325
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1c2bbaab_1:

    # "I examine Merel’s face — or, to be more precise, her reflection — in the mirror on my vanity table."
    "我望着梳妆镜，打量她的脸。准确说，是镜子里的她。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2327
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_167afd27_1:

    # "I’m not really sure how I feel about Merel’s offer. I’m afraid it might be a bit too intimate..."
    "对这个提议，我有点拿不准。总觉得也许太亲密了……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2329
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f2886aec_1:

    # "But it’s probably past the point where I can fuss about that. I mean, we’ve already shared a bed together. Why not?"
    "可我们都已经同床睡过，现在再纠结这些，好像也晚了。有什么不行呢？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2331
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_40fac4b3_1:

    # "Besides, Merel is a visitor here, not a guest, so she might as well pull her weight."
    "再说，梅蕾尔只是来访，又不是付钱住店的客人，出点力也应该。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2332
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5dc173d7_1:

    # "She isn’t paying for a room, so she can at least make herself useful."
    "房钱不用交，至少也该派点用场嘛。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2334
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ccd81201_1:

    # Nienke "...Okay, fine. You can brush my hair if you really want to, though I’m not sure if I see the appeal. I doubt it’ll be all that entertaining."
    Nienke "……好吧。你真想梳就梳，虽然我不明白有什么好玩的。应该挺无聊的。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2336
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c2c51ba1_1:

    # Merel "Oh, you don’t know that, Nienke! I think brushin’ your hair will be lots of fun!"
    Merel "妮恩克，那可不一定！我觉得帮你梳头肯定很好玩！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2337
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_70781dd7_1:

    # Merel "I bet it’ll feel really good to run my hands through it — just like patting a pony, hehe!"
    Merel "手指从里面穿过去，肯定很舒服，就像摸小马一样，嘿嘿！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2341
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c121daa4_1:

    # Nienke "A pony...?"
    Nienke "小马……？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2353
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ee5c5956_1:

    # "Merel takes the brush from my right hand, and I try not to tremble as I feel her fingertips skim against my own."
    "梅蕾尔从我右手接过梳子，指尖轻轻擦过我的手指。我努力让自己别发抖。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2354
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b93bd27f_1:

    # Nienke "I don’t know if that’s the most flattering comparison..."
    Nienke "我不觉得这是个多好听的比喻……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2355
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_cbc6ad36_1:

    # Merel "It isn’t?"
    Merel "不是吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2356
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b6cb7b15_1:

    # Nienke "I wouldn’t say so. How many women want to be likened to a pony? They’re just animals."
    Nienke "我觉得不是。有几个女人会想被比作小马？那只是动物啊。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2357
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_83c957cb_1:

    # Merel "Well, yes, they are, but they’re lovely animals, don’t you think? Their pelts are so nice and smooth, and I love their tails!"
    Merel "是动物没错，可很可爱呀，对吧？毛又顺又滑，尾巴我也好喜欢！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2358
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_171f67e7_1:

    # Merel "They’re so cute! I’ve always been very fond of them."
    Merel "多可爱！我一直很喜欢小马。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2359
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f323735a_1:

    # Nienke "...I’ll take your word for it. I can’t say I’m all that fond of them myself, though."
    Nienke "……你说是就是吧。反正我没那么喜欢。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2360
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3ab71b71_1:

    # Merel "You aren’t?"
    Merel "不喜欢？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2361
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ec2e1a90_1:

    # Nienke "No. Why should I be? They’re large, boxy creatures, and they have powerful hind legs. They could kick my head in if they wanted to."
    Nienke "不喜欢。有什么可喜欢的？身体又大又方，后腿那么有力，真想踢的话，都能把我的脑袋踢碎。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2362
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_01007649_1:

    # Merel "Hmm. I dunno about that. I don’t think any pony would do anything so cruel: not to you! You’re a sweetheart."
    Merel "嗯，我倒不这么想。小马不会这么残忍吧，尤其不会对你！你这么惹人爱。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2363
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_cfd25576_1:

    # Merel "I’ve seen the way you talk to Engelmund, hehe. He obviously adores you!"
    Merel "我听过你跟恩格尔蒙德说话，嘿嘿。他明显很爱你呀！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2364
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d9016be4_1:

    # Nienke "I’m not so sure about that..."
    Nienke "那可不一定……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2365
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_fbafda25_1:

    # Nienke "I think Engelmund loves food more than anything else. I’m just a convenient dispensary."
    Nienke "我看他最爱的还是吃的。我只是个方便的投食器。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2366
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e1fc7556_1:

    # Merel "You say that, but he’s always sitting on your lap! Doesn’t that mean he likes you?"
    Merel "嘴上这么说，可他总坐在你腿上！这还不能说明喜欢你吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2367
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_43d78cec_1:

    # Nienke "No, that means he thinks I’m a convenient pillow too."
    Nienke "不能，只能说明我还兼任一个方便的枕头。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2368
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d8ddd36b_1:

    # Merel "Oh, you! Were you always so cynical, Nienke?"
    Merel "你呀！妮恩克，你以前也这么爱往坏处想吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2369
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_cb1ba5cf_1:

    # Nienke "I don’t know. I can’t remember much of my past, as you should be aware. You’ll have to tell me that."
    Nienke "不知道。你也清楚，我不记得多少以前的事。得由你告诉我。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2370
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6e3517b4_1:

    # Merel "Hehe, well. When I knew you, you were such a little thing. You were so small, and you were kind of shy. I worried about you, so I wanted to look out for you."
    Merel "嘿嘿，好吧。认识你的时候，你还是小小的一只，个头小，又有点怕生。我不放心，就想护着你。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2371
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2669e592_1:

    # Merel "We always spent time together, and I used to brush your hair too, just like this. Do you remember that?"
    Merel "我们总是一起玩，我也给你梳过头，就像现在这样。记得吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2372
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2dd9e02a_1:

    # Nienke "Hmm..."
    Nienke "嗯……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2373
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e63dc47d_1:

    # "I frown, trying to rack my brain. My brow furrows in thought, but..."
    "我蹙起眉，努力回想。可想了半天，还是……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2374
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_82ff795b_1:

    # Nienke "...Sorry, but it doesn’t ring a bell."
    Nienke "……对不起，没什么印象。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2375
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1afa9ce5_1:

    # Merel "Hehe. I thought you might say that. If you didn’t remember my name, there’s no way you’d remember the things we did together..."
    Merel "嘿嘿，就知道你会这么说。连名字都忘了，怎么会记得一起做过什么呢……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2376
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f8bd983a_1:

    # Merel "But that’s alright! You might not remember me, but I remember you. I remember brushing out your hair, and how you liked me to handle it, so just leave everything to me."
    Merel "不过没关系！你不记得我，我记得你就行。我记得给你梳过头，也记得你喜欢怎么梳，全交给我吧。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2377
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_cb991072_1:

    # Merel "I’m sure I’ll be able to make you feel good!"
    Merel "肯定让你舒舒服服的！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2378
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e82c31cf_1:

    # Nienke "You sound awfully confident."
    Nienke "你倒是很有自信。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2379
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3bcf4137_1:

    # Merel "As I should be! I’m at an advantage here, since I remember so much about you. You left a real impression, Nienke!"
    Merel "那当然！我记得你这么多事，占着优势嘛。妮恩克，你给我留下的印象可深了！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2380
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_52fe2ac8_1:

    # Nienke "Hmm. I wish I could say the same about you..."
    Nienke "嗯。真希望我也能这么说你……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2381
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b5deef09_1:

    # Merel "Wahaha! How cutting!"
    Merel "哇哈哈！好伤人！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2382
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_98f873c6_1:

    # Nienke "...but you do have quite the presence, now I think about it. You’re rather commanding..."
    Nienke "……不过，仔细想想，你确实很有存在感。挺有发号施令的架势……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2383
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f26d559b_1:

    # Nienke "Or maybe I could call you bossy."
    Nienke "也可以说，爱指使人。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2384
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a6de6db9_1:

    # Merel "Bossy, eh? It wouldn’t be the first time I’ve been called that."
    Merel "爱指使人啊？倒也不是第一次听见了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2385
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_29de2138_1:

    # Merel "Heck, it wouldn’t even be the first time that you’ve called me that. I know I can be pretty pushy, wahaha!"
    Merel "别说别人，连你都不是第一次这么说我了。我知道自己有时候很强势，哇哈哈！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2386
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_69565a7e_1:

    # Nienke "And yet, you insist on acting the same as you always have..."
    Nienke "知道了，却还是坚持老样子……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2387
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3d524403_1:

    # Merel "Well, yeah. A leopard can’t change its spots that easily!"
    Merel "是呀，本性哪有那么容易改嘛！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2388
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d7d9cc9f_1:

    # Nienke "So you’re saying if you were annoying once, you’ll always be annoying?"
    Nienke "所以你的意思是，从前烦人，以后也会一直烦人？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2389
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_31160425_1:

    # Merel "Somethin’ like that, I guess. I’m afraid it might be too late for me already. I’ll never be a well-mannered young lady: not like you, Nienke."
    Merel "差不多吧，恐怕早就没救了。我这辈子都成不了像你这样举止得体的淑女，妮恩克。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2390
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3ef153fc_1:

    # Merel "That’s not really who I am. I’ve never been that sort of girl..."
    Merel "那本来就不像我。我从来不是那种姑娘……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2391
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_55d88ad5_1:

    # Merel "But I can be gentle from time to time, if the situation calls for it. I did always try to be nice to you."
    Merel "不过，该温柔的时候，我也能温柔一下。我以前一直尽量对你好来着。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2392
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b3ebb82c_1:

    # Nienke "When you weren’t telling me what to do, you mean?"
    Nienke "你是说，不指挥我做这做那的时候？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2393
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8372dd6e_1:

    # Merel "I didn’t boss you around that much. Mostly, I just decided on what games we should play, and whether we should go paddlin’ in the stream: that sorta thing."
    Merel "也没那么爱指挥啦。最多决定玩什么游戏，要不要去溪里踩水，就这种事。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2394
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_52f96567_1:

    # Merel "I don’t think I ever did anything to make you uncomfortable..."
    Merel "我应该没做过什么让你不舒服的事……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2395
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3d619040_1:

    # Merel "Or did I?"
    Merel "有吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2396
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1089f241_1:

    # Nienke "Why are you asking me that? You should already know full well that I won’t remember."
    Nienke "问我干吗？你明明知道，我又不记得。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2397
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1020fd28_1:

    # Merel "Good point. I guess I can only rely on my gut for this kinda thing — and all of my old memories, too..."
    Merel "说得对。这种事，只能相信自己的直觉，还有以前的记忆了……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2398
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d20871c1_1:

    # Merel "But this doesn’t feel bad, at least, does it? Aren’t you enjoyin’ all of the attention?"
    Merel "不过，至少现在感觉不坏吧？这样被人照顾，不开心吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2399
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_142f70b3_1:

    # "By ‘the attention’, I presume Merel is talking about the bristles of the brush which are slowly running through my tresses."
    "她说的“照顾”，大概是指那把正慢慢穿过我长发的梳子。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2400
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7e840eff_1:

    # "I wasn’t paying her technique too much heed in the beginning, but now I feel compelled to pay a little more attention to what she’s doing."
    "起初没怎么留心她的手法，现在却忍不住仔细感受起来。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2401
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d6738dfc_1:

    # "I sit there mutely, my hands still resting on my lap, as Merel continues to brush. I feel the bristles through my hair, against the nape of my neck, and I shiver."
    "我默默坐着，双手放在膝上，任她继续梳。梳齿穿过发丝，贴近后颈，让我轻轻一颤。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2402
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_969eec28_1:

    # "I guess she’s right about one thing. She might have been bossy when we were both children (not that I can remember that), but she does know how to be gentle."
    "有一点她说得没错。小时候她也许爱指使人，虽然我不记得，但她的确知道怎么温柔。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2403
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6943ba67_1:

    # "She’s brushing my hair very slowly, each motion considered, almost like a parent might."
    "她梳得很慢，每一下都仔仔细细，几乎像父母照顾孩子。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2404
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f13de2c7_1:

    # "This feels quite comforting, actually. There’s something reassuring about it; something faintly nostalgic."
    "其实很舒服。有种让人安心的感觉，还带着隐约的怀念。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2405
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_33aae8af_1:

    # "Maybe I do remember this, just a little."
    "也许，我真记得那么一点。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2406
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a8a538f0_1:

    # "I can’t recall any specific memories, but..."
    "想不起具体的画面，可是……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2407
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e3f57472_1:

    # "Yeah. I think Merel did used to look after me like this."
    "嗯。我想，梅蕾尔以前的确这样照顾过我。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2408
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_53ee5cba_1:

    # "I think we played a game together sometimes. I was the princess, and Merel was my maid."
    "我们好像有时会一起玩一个游戏。我是公主，她是我的侍女。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2409
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d593d5c3_1:

    # "That sounds familiar..."
    "听着很熟悉……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2410
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_30e81d8d_1:

    # Nienke "It, um... d-doesn’t feel bad, I guess?"
    Nienke "好、好像……是不难受啦？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2411
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_d5dacbd6_1:

    # Merel "Good! I’m glad to hear it {font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"
    Merel "那就好！听你这么说，我就开心了{font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2412
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1fa1b597_1:

    # Merel "You might’ve been a little cold to me in the beginning, but I think you’re finally thawing out."
    Merel "刚开始，你对我是有点冷淡，不过现在总算慢慢化开了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2413
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_639ac8e7_1:

    # Merel "You aren’t exactly like the Nienke that I remember, but you’re close enough."
    Merel "跟我记得的妮恩克不完全一样，但还是差不多。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2414
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_21b4989b_1:

    # Merel "You’re much more haughty, and you’ve become a little more aloof..."
    Merel "比以前高傲了不少，也疏远了一点……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2415
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e9148cd9_1:

    # Merel "But it seems like you still enjoy having your hair brushed, hehe {font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"
    Merel "不过，看来还是喜欢别人帮你梳头呢，嘿嘿{font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2416
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_cd1dbbd7_1:

    # "Merel giggles at this discovery, while I roll my eyes. I look at myself in the mirror, reflected back at me, and say..."
    "发现这一点，梅蕾尔咯咯笑起来。我翻了个白眼，望着镜子里的自己，说……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2417
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9d988166_1:

    # Nienke "I don’t know if that’s something to celebrate. Most people like having their hair brushed, don’t they? It’s relaxing."
    Nienke "不知道这有什么好庆祝的。大多数人都喜欢别人梳头吧？挺放松的。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2418
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0f3b1bdc_1:

    # Merel "I’m not sure about that. I know there’s plenty of people out there who value their personal space. I think you might be one of ’em—"
    Merel "这可不一定。很多人都很重视私人空间。我看你也是其中之一——"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2419
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_717804d4_1:

    # Nienke "Really? I wonder what tipped you off."
    Nienke "是吗？真好奇你是怎么看出来的。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2420
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_061cb6ff_1:

    # Merel "—but at least you’re bein’ nice now. I don’t know if things can go back to the way they were between us, but at least we can get along like this."
    Merel "——不过至少现在肯好好相处啦。不知道能不能像从前一样，但这样也不错。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2421
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5b444b36_1:

    # Merel "Do you remember any of the games we used to play together, even a little bit?"
    Merel "以前一起玩的游戏，你有没有想起一点点？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2422
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_955cbea7_1:

    # Nienke "...I remember some things, I suppose."
    Nienke "……好像记起一点了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2423
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e2019bd5_1:

    # Merel "You do?! Like what?!"
    Merel "真的？！比如什么？！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2424
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_adb867d0_1:

    # Nienke "Not that much. I wouldn’t get too excited: not if I were you. I can only recall some vague bits and pieces..."
    Nienke "没多少。换成我就不会这么兴奋。我只想起一点模模糊糊的片段……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2425
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1d8b5539_1:

    # Nienke "But I think we used to play a game, didn’t we, when we were children?"
    Nienke "不过，我们小时候，好像玩过一种游戏吧？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2426
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_02d843ef_1:

    # Nienke "You would call me a princess, and you would address me as ‘milady’..."
    Nienke "你会说我是公主，还称呼我“殿下”……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2427
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4c9332e8_1:

    # Nienke "And I think you used to brush my hair, just like you’re doing now..."
    Nienke "好像也会给我梳头，就像现在这样……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2428
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a0175104_1:

    # Nienke "I-If I’m not mistaken, that is?"
    Nienke "如、如果我没记错的话？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2429
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_892a3eb6_1:

    # "I wait for a moment, wondering if I’ve confused my own murky past with scenes I’ve read about before in romance novels, when..."
    "我等了一会儿，怀疑自己是不是把模糊的过去，和爱情小说里的场景弄混了。这时……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2430
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_edfe23a1_1:

    # Merel "Yes! That’s right! That’s exactly right!!!"
    Merel "对！就是这样！一点都没错！！！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2431
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_82a8d3de_1:

    # "Merel beams."
    "梅蕾尔笑得灿烂。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2432
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_fb4b090f_1:

    # Merel "I did always call you a princess, Nienke. You were {i}my{/i} princess because you were so refined and elegant..."
    Merel "妮恩克，我以前总叫你公主。你那么文雅，那么端庄，是{i}我的{/i}公主呀……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2433
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_48dffb68_1:

    # Merel "And you haven’t changed. You’re still as regal as I remember you, hehe~"
    Merel "现在也没变。还是跟记忆里一样，有公主的气派，嘿嘿～"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2434
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_00d2d48c_1:

    # Nienke "O-Oh, please..."
    Nienke "好、好了，别说了……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2435
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0c72fb44_1:

    # "I pout, though I can’t quite suppress the blush which has begun to spread across my cheeks."
    "我噘起嘴，却压不住脸上渐渐泛起的红晕。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2436
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5b77bd27_1:

    # Nienke "I really don’t think there’s anything all that special about me. In fact, the kids back in primary school used to treat me like a freak."
    Nienke "我真的不觉得自己有什么特别。以前上小学，那些孩子还把我当怪胎呢。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2437
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f891e17d_1:

    # Merel "Well, they were all fools! You aren’t a freak, Nienke. In fact, you couldn’t be further from being a freak if you tried — which I know you wouldn’t."
    Merel "那是他们傻！你才不是怪胎，妮恩克。就算拼命装，也跟怪胎沾不上边，当然，你也不会去装。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2438
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4203e790_1:

    # Merel "You care a little too much about what people think about you, not that you need to."
    Merel "你太在意别人怎么看你了，其实根本没必要。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2439
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_84433543_1:

    # Merel "You’ve always been a little lady. Even when we were kids, you acted like you were some sort of duchess, hehe."
    Merel "你一直是个小淑女。小时候那副派头，就跟哪家的女公爵似的，嘿嘿。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2440
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_38b68106_2:

    # Nienke "I did...?"
    Nienke "是吗……？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2441
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_64c91881_1:

    # Merel "Yes, you did. I used to joke around with you back then, when we were both little kids."
    Merel "是呀。我们还小的时候，我就这么逗过你。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2442
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c77566a1_1:

    # Merel "I said you acted like a princess, the way you sent Roan and his gang off on crazy quests to prove their allegiance to you, and you laughed."
    Merel "你派罗安那伙人去做各种离谱的任务，证明他们对你忠心，我就说你像个公主。你当时还笑了呢。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2443
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7c087514_1:

    # Nienke "Roan...?"
    Nienke "罗安……？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2444
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_07d771ce_1:

    # "I eye Merel in the mirror confusedly, my brow furrowed."
    "我皱着眉，困惑地看着镜子里的梅蕾尔。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2445
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c990f862_1:

    # "I imagine he’s somebody from my past, but I don’t have any memories of him."
    "应该也是我以前认识的人，可我一点印象都没有。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2446
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c5bc1bb2_1:

    # Nienke "Was he another elf?"
    Nienke "也是精灵？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2447
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0383048c_1:

    # Merel "That’s right. He’s an elf, and he’s a real piece of work."
    Merel "没错，是精灵，而且是个讨厌鬼。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2448
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_96db8b8a_1:

    # Merel "He used to piss me off, the way he acted. He’d swagger around Mors Paravail like he owned the place, but he was just this jumped-up little brat with a huuuuuuge ego."
    Merel "他那副样子，以前总把我气得够呛。在莫尔斯·帕拉维尔大摇大摆，好像整个地方都是他的，其实就是个自大得不得了的小屁孩。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2449
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_64bed65e_1:

    # Merel "He had this massive sense of superiority, and for what? S’not like there was anything special about him."
    Merel "也不知道哪来的优越感。明明根本没什么特别的。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2450
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_70150b8b_1:

    # Merel "He was an ass, plain and simple, and the way he treated you was unforgivable!"
    Merel "说白了，就是个混蛋。他那样对你，简直不能原谅！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2451
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_acdae4ab_1:

    # Nienke "Was he especially horrible to me, then...?"
    Nienke "他对我特别坏吗……？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2452
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_70e32b5c_1:

    # Merel "Well, maybe not especially. It’s not like he tried to drown you over in the lake or anything. He was horrible in the way young boys tend to be, y’know, in this totally boring way."
    Merel "倒也不算特别。毕竟没想把你推到湖里淹死什么的。就是小男孩那种常见的坏，你懂吧，无聊透了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2453
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6705dff4_1:

    # Merel "He used to call you names, and sometimes, he pushed you over. He skinned your knee once, and he made you bleed, though I don’t think it was intentional?"
    Merel "他会骂你，有时还推你。有一次把你膝盖蹭破了，都流血了，不过我想，那次应该不是故意的？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2454
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_77791bc0_1:

    # Merel "He seemed kinda guilty about that, at least..."
    Merel "至少看起来有点内疚……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2455
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_08514b34_1:

    # Merel "But if he was guilty, he shouldn’t’ve pushed you over to begin with!"
    Merel "可既然会内疚，一开始就别推人啊！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2456
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_cd347c06_1:

    # Merel "I was pissed when I saw what had happened, and I gave him a stern talking-to: you mark my words."
    Merel "我一看见就气坏了，狠狠骂了他一顿，这话一点不夸张。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2457
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_67872d1b_1:

    # Merel "Nobody should’ve been laying their hands on you like that: especially not a little worm like Roan."
    Merel "谁都不该那样对你动手，尤其罗安那种小臭虫。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2458
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_54383518_1:

    # Merel "I mean, geez! Even when we were kids, you still acted like a princess — and you looked like one, too."
    Merel "真是的！就算小时候，你也是一举一动都像公主，长得也像！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2459
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_38b68106_3:

    # Nienke "I did...?"
    Nienke "是吗……？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2460
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1c8592a3_1:

    # Merel "Yeah, you did. I’ve always thought that you’re adorable, which is partially why I kept jumpin’ to your defence."
    Merel "是呀。我一直觉得你可爱得不得了，所以才总想站出来护着你。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2461
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4fd6183a_1:

    # Merel "Maybe this sounds a little arrogant, but I did fancy myself as your knight for a while. I wanted to look out for you..."
    Merel "这么说可能有点自以为是，不过有阵子，我确实把自己当成你的骑士，想保护你……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2467
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_2e01baaa_1:

    # "Here, Merel’s voice trails off. She looks at the crown of my head, her fingers curled around her hairbrush, and frowns."
    "说到这里，梅蕾尔的声音渐渐低了。她握着梳子，望向我的头顶，眉头蹙了起来。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2468
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9ab68541_1:

    # "There’s a pause, and then..."
    "沉默片刻后，她说……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2469
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ba03e31b_1:

    # Merel "But I couldn’t look out for you forever, I guess."
    Merel "不过，我到底没法一直保护你。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2470
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_54ea2e2a_1:

    # Merel "You still wound up gettin’ sick, and there wasn’t a thing I could do to help you."
    Merel "你还是病倒了，我却什么忙也帮不上。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2474
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e00e4ef7_1:

    # Merel "You were in such a bad way, Nienke, I really was scared. You just lay in your bed all day, for hours an’ hours, and you couldn’t move at all. You could hardly even turn your head."
    Merel "妮恩克，你那时病得特别重，我真的很害怕。你整天躺在床上，一连好几个小时都动不了，连转一下头都很难。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2475
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_73fa7c67_1:

    # Merel "I was so scared you were going to die...!"
    Merel "我真的好怕你会死……！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2483
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_dfbb362c_1:

    # "Merel sniffs, her eyes looking suspiciously glassy."
    "梅蕾尔吸了吸鼻子，眼里泛起了可疑的水光。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2484
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b48a2b75_1:

    # "I’m facing away from her, looking at my own reflection in the mirror, but I can see Merel examining me, and I can see her brow furrow."
    "我背对着她，看着镜中的自己，却也看得见她望着我，紧紧皱起眉。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2485
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9f007860_1:

    # "She looks like she’s about to start sobbing; so much so, it makes me wonder. Just how close were we in the past?"
    "她看起来随时会哭出来，让我忍不住想，我们以前到底有多亲近？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2486
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8eeeafca_1:

    # "We must have been good friends, if Merel was this worried about my welfare..."
    "她那么担心我，我们一定是很好的朋友吧……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2487
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8d914e43_1:

    # "But, no matter how intense her response is, it does me little good."
    "可不管她的反应多么强烈，我还是想不起来。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2488
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3b3847b8_1:

    # "I can’t recall Merel sitting by my sickbed, wishing for my recovery."
    "我不记得梅蕾尔坐在病床旁，盼着我康复。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2489
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f08a5462_1:

    # "I can’t remember her hand in my own, or the way her voice wavered as she begged that I would get better."
    "不记得她握着我的手，也不记得她求我快点好起来时，声音怎样颤抖。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2490
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_67df7db3_1:

    # "I don’t remember her shedding tears over me, but..."
    "不记得她为我掉过眼泪，可是……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2491
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_dde6fd17_1:

    # Nienke "...I don’t think you need to feel guilty about any of that, Merel."
    Nienke "……梅蕾尔，你不用为这些事内疚。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2492
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_47319f35_1:

    # Merel "Y-You don’t?"
    Merel "真、真的吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2493
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_169358d1_1:

    # Nienke "No. You were just a child when I fell ill. You might have called yourself my knight, but there’s only so much you could realistically have done for me."
    Nienke "嗯。我生病时，你也只是个孩子。就算把自己叫作骑士，能为我做的事，终究有限。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2494
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3df9bcbe_1:

    # Nienke "Fighting my bullies is very different to trying to scare away an illness."
    Nienke "赶跑欺负我的人，和赶跑疾病，完全是两回事。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2495
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5032cb30_1:

    # Nienke "I don’t think it was possible for a young child to help me, like you would have been. I needed medical intervention."
    Nienke "那么小的孩子，怎么可能治好我呢。我需要的是治疗。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2496
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6f65125b_1:

    # Nienke "The adult healers in Mors Paravail couldn’t even help me. That’s why I had to move to Alpenrose."
    Nienke "连莫尔斯·帕拉维尔那些成年的医师都帮不了我，所以我才得搬到阿尔彭罗瑟。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2497
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f6fabc49_1:

    # Nienke "I don’t blame you for anything that happened to me."
    Nienke "发生在我身上的事，我从来没怪过你。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2498
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b625e195_1:

    # "Why would I, when I can hardly even remember my sickness? It’s all vague and blurry to me: indistinct..."
    "何况，生病的事我自己都记不清，又怎么会怪她？对我来说，一切都模模糊糊，没有实感……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2505
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7eefc2bc_1:

    # "But Merel seems to appreciate my reassurances, because she smiles. Her expression softens, and she says..."
    "不过，这番安慰似乎让梅蕾尔好受了一些。她笑了，神情也柔和下来，说……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2506
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a3e72a82_1:

    # Merel "...Yeah, I guess so."
    Merel "……嗯，也是。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2507
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_58ec698e_1:

    # Merel "I did feel guilty when you fell ill, and I couldn’t help you. I wished there was more I could do for you than sittin’ by your bedside, wishin’ you’d get better..."
    Merel "你病倒时，我帮不上忙，真的很内疚。除了坐在床边盼你好起来，我多希望还能做点别的……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2508
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_fa9647f4_1:

    # Merel "But you’re right. You often tend to be, Nienke. You’ve always been such a smartie cookie, wahaha."
    Merel "不过你说得对。妮恩克，你说的话总是很有道理。你从来就是个小聪明，哇哈哈。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2509
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_acc20710_1:

    # Merel "I wanted to be your prince, but I couldn’t protect you from all of life’s ills."
    Merel "我想当你的王子，却没法替你挡住世上所有的苦难。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2510
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0f70d597_1:

    # Merel "I couldn’t save you..."
    Merel "我没能救你……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2511
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_42bfedcd_1:

    # Merel "But you’re still alright, despite all of that. You must be a lot stronger’n you look, because you hung in there. I was able to find you again..."
    Merel "可就算这样，你还是好起来了。你一定比看着坚强得多，真的撑了过来。所以，我才能再次找到你……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2512
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_91a2feca_1:

    # Merel "An’ now, I’m gonna take good care of you! I promise you that!"
    Merel "这一次，我会好好照顾你！我保证！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2513
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_0b9dca33_1:

    # "Merel sounds so stubbornly enthused that any questions I might have cared to ask about our shared past die in my throat."
    "她说得那么热切，那么执拗，让我原本想追问往事的话，全都咽了回去。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2514
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_1ce2db15_1:

    # "It would seem almost callous, at this point, to ask Merel how close we were really: especially when she was obviously so worried about me."
    "到了这份上，再问我们以前究竟有多亲近，未免太冷酷。她显然那么担心过我。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2515
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_46c22b8d_1:

    # "Merel, at the very least, must have cared about me."
    "至少，她一定是很在乎我的。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2516
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5963be9f_1:

    # "I think she still cares about me. Otherwise, she wouldn’t have travelled this far to meet me."
    "我想，现在也是。不然，也不会跑这么远来见我。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2517
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_484a83c2_1:

    # "It’s been fifteen years since we last saw one another, but she never did forget me."
    "整整十五年没见，她却一直没忘记。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2518
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_bbc67410_1:

    # "I suppose I should feel flattered about that, but..."
    "我大概应该觉得荣幸。可是……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2530
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_68db4891_1:

    # Nienke "Hmph."
    Nienke "哼。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2531
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8d5b622d_1:

    # "I find myself pouting."
    "我又噘起了嘴。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2532
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c2c0e050_1:

    # "Sullenly, I look at my reflection and mumble..."
    "闷闷地望着镜子，低声说……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2534
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c55249a6_1:

    # Nienke "Well, it’s not like I asked you to take care of me or anything. You’re the one who insisted. You’re such a busybody."
    Nienke "反正，我又没求你照顾。是你自己非要这么做的。真爱多管闲事。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2538
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_472d48f9_1:

    # "My words might be pointed, but they lack any real sting, which might be why Merel starts giggling."
    "话虽然尖刻，却没带多少真正的刺。大概正因如此，梅蕾尔咯咯笑了起来。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2540
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6e28bc3e_1:

    # Merel "Well, you’re not wrong about that. I have always been pretty pushy, wahaha~"
    Merel "这个你倒没说错。我一直挺爱自作主张的，哇哈哈～"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2542
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_af263182_1:

    # Merel "I know it ain’t all that ladylike, but I think it’s fine. It’s just the way I am..."
    Merel "我知道不怎么淑女，不过没关系。我本来就是这样……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2544
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5fdece46_1:

    # Merel "An’ anyway, I’m not all that interested in bein’ some well-bred, well-mannered elfin lady."
    Merel "再说，我也没多想当什么出身高贵、举止端庄的精灵小姐。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2545
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a33ae0c2_1:

    # Merel "I’d far rather look out for you. I {i}am{/i} your knight, remember?"
    Merel "我更想保护你。别忘了，我{i}可是{/i}你的骑士。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2549
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b76ab866_1:

    # Nienke "So you keep saying. It seems like you rather went out of your way to aid me when I was being bullied back in Mors Paravail, too."
    Nienke "你一直这么说。在莫尔斯·帕拉维尔被欺负的时候，看来你也确实为了帮我，费了不少心。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2551
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9d3c3e49_1:

    # Nienke "For that, I ought to thank you..."
    Nienke "这一点，我应该谢谢你……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2553
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_4444181b_1:

    # Nienke "But you do know that I can’t remember any of that, don’t you?"
    Nienke "可你也知道，那些事我都不记得了，对吧？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2554
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6afa8d41_1:

    # Nienke "You don’t need to feel guilty about not helping me when I was sick, because I have no hard feelings over it..."
    Nienke "生病时没能帮上忙，你不用自责，因为我根本没有怨过你……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2556
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_de7591e7_1:

    # Nienke "But, by the same token, I can’t remember you fending off Roan and the rest."
    Nienke "但同样的，你赶走罗安他们的事，我也记不起来。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2558
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5a26a83a_1:

    # Nienke "I don’t even remember what Roan looks like. I wouldn’t recognise him even if he entered Fleur de Lys. That part of my life has all gone."
    Nienke "我连罗安长什么样都忘了。就算他走进百合花，我也认不出来。那段人生，已经全都不在了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2560
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8b66b276_1:

    # Merel "All of it...?"
    Merel "全都……？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2561
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_23a08a88_1:

    # "Merel asks, her eyes narrowed: her expression unusually serious."
    "梅蕾尔眯起眼，神情少见地认真起来。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2563
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_03da8aef_1:

    # Merel "Every single bit?"
    Merel "一点都不剩？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2565
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_63df343c_1:

    # Nienke "I think so, yes. I still have some vague memories, but other than that..."
    Nienke "我想是吧。还剩些模模糊糊的记忆，可除此之外……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2567
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b4958e24_1:

    # Nienke "There’s nothing."
    Nienke "什么也没有。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2569
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f015045a_1:

    # Merel "...I see."
    Merel "……这样啊。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2571
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_628ac023_1:

    # "Merel looks at me with a curious expression on her face, and then..."
    "梅蕾尔神情古怪地望着我，然后……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2573
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a6cd845a_1:

    # Merel "Well, never mind! I’m sure you’ll remember in due course..."
    Merel "好啦，没关系！总有一天会想起来的……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2575
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_06854f23_1:

    # Merel "And even if you don’t, that’s also fine. It’s not gonna change the way I feel about you."
    Merel "就算想不起来，也没事。反正不会改变我对你的心意。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2577
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_8e851951_1:

    # Merel "You’re still my princess, Nienke. I’m always gonna look out for you, no matter what!"
    Merel "妮恩克，你还是我的公主。不管发生什么，我都会保护你！"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2586
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b0ef69b8_1:

    # "So saying, Merel turns her attention to my hair. She runs the brush through it slowly, carefully, smiling all the while."
    "说完，她又专心梳起我的头发，慢慢地，仔细地，脸上一直带着笑。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2587
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a76717ed_1:

    # "I feel the bristles of the brush against my scalp and I shiver from it."
    "梳齿贴着头皮划过，我轻轻一颤。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2588
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_9970370d_1:

    # "There’s nothing especially intimate about letting Merel brush my hair, I guess, despite my initial hesitance. I let Cornelia play around with my hair a lot: something she seems to enjoy."
    "虽然一开始犹豫过，但让她梳头，好像也没什么特别亲密的。我也经常让科妮莉娅摆弄头发，她似乎很喜欢。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2589
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_c5ff8954_1:

    # "Cornelia used to fiddle with my hair all of the time back when we were still attending the lyceum. We’d sit together in the classroom, me picking at my lunch, while Cornelia would brush my hair out."
    "还在中学时，科妮莉娅总爱折腾我的头发。我们一起坐在教室里，我有一口没一口地吃午饭，她就替我梳头。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2590
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3e2217a2_1:

    # "Then, she would fashion it into all sorts of styles: pigtails and plaits and buns at the top of my head."
    "然后弄出各种发型：双马尾、辫子，还有盘在头顶的发髻。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2591
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_961e5f1f_1:

    # "Cornelia would bring her own brush into school for our little games of hairdresser’s, and a small tin box full of bobby pins which rattled."
    "为了这点美发游戏，她会自己带梳子来学校，还有一只装满发夹的小铁盒，晃起来哗啦啦响。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2592
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e9dda41b_1:

    # "Sometimes, when she wanted to do really complex styles, she’d even spray my hair to set it."
    "有时想做特别复杂的造型，她甚至会给我喷点定型水。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2593
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b4ceefcb_1:

    # "She took a lot of joy from it, for some reason, and I never much minded it."
    "不知道为什么，她总玩得很开心，我也不怎么介意。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2594
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_50e2a00b_1:

    # "In fact, I enjoyed the attention."
    "其实，我喜欢这样被她照顾。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2595
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_5d890172_1:

    # "I liked the sensation of the bristles on my neck; of Cornelia’s laser attention focused on me..."
    "喜欢梳齿拂过后颈的感觉，也喜欢她把全部心思都放在我身上……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2603
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ef3fd63d_1:

    # "But it feels a little different with Merel."
    "可换成梅蕾尔，感觉有点不一样。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2604
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_7175a92e_1:

    # "I don’t know if this should be the case, but my heart..."
    "不知道这样应不应该，可我的心……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2605
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e3fa6016_1:

    # Merel "Hmm, hmm, hmm {font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♪{/font}"
    Merel "哼，哼，哼{font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♪{/font}"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2606
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_703a2907_1:

    # "It won’t stop fluttering."
    "就是跳个不停。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2620
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_ab079190_1:

    # "Later that night..."
    "当天深夜……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2634
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_29d52a34_1:

    # Merel "Nn, mm... Zzz..."
    Merel "嗯，唔……呼噜噜……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2635
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a93c5f1e_1:

    # Nienke "...Geez."
    Nienke "……真是的。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2636
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_33213717_1:

    # "I sigh, turned away from Merel, as she snoozes away."
    "我背对梅蕾尔，听着她熟睡的动静，叹了口气。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2637
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b78ea6af_1:

    # "She seems content enough, dead to the world as she is, but I can’t say the same for myself."
    "她睡得不省人事，显然很满足。我却做不到。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2638
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_09d684a5_1:

    # "I can still recall the sensation of the brush’s bristles against my neck and the intensity of Merel’s gaze as she looked at me."
    "梳齿擦过后颈的感觉，还有她望着我时那专注的眼神，仍然清清楚楚。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2639
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_10cebafa_1:

    # "I know she didn’t mean anything serious when she offered to brush my hair. To her, it was probably nothing more than an amusing way to spend a few minutes. To me, however..."
    "我知道，她提议梳头时没什么特别的意思。对她来说，大概只是打发几分钟的有趣小事。可对我……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2640
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a8dbecbf_1:

    # Merel "Mm, mrph... Zzz..."
    Merel "唔，唔嗯……呼噜噜……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2641
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_15705911_1:

    # "What was it to me?"
    "对我来说，又算什么？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2642
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_46a1f3c7_1:

    # "I’m not sure."
    "我不知道。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2643
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_34aa7792_1:

    # "I don’t know how I feel about the breaking of the barriers between myself and Merel. I feel like I should be more opposed to it than I am, and yet..."
    "我和梅蕾尔之间的界限，一点点被打破。我说不清是什么心情，总觉得自己该更抗拒一点。可是……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2644
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_a26cd065_1:

    # Merel "Nn, mm... Haa..."
    Merel "嗯，唔……哈啊……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2645
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_6140293b_1:

    # "I don’t mind it as much as I feel I should — and that, perhaps paradoxically, {i}really{/i} makes it rankle."
    "我偏偏没有想象中那么介意。而这份不介意，反倒{i}真的{/i}让我不痛快。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2646
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b6933c5d_1:

    # "I’m worried I’m getting a little too familiar with Merel’s presence."
    "我怕自己已经太习惯她在身边了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2647
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_68c6baaa_1:

    # "There’s nothing wrong with making a new friend — or, in this case, reviving a relationship with an old friend I can no longer remember..."
    "交个新朋友没什么不好。或者说，跟已经忘记的老朋友重新亲近，也没什么不好……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2648
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3e15b377_1:

    # "But Merel doesn’t just feel like a friend. There’s an intensity in the way she talks to me that I can’t reciprocate."
    "可梅蕾尔给我的感觉，又不只是朋友。她说话时的那份热切，我没法同样回应。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2649
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_88c9bee0_1:

    # "How can I, when I don’t remember her?"
    "我都不记得她，要怎么回应呢？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2650
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b0556402_1:

    # "To me, she’s a stranger."
    "对我而言，她是陌生人。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2651
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_36ad6b4c_1:

    # "She should be a stranger, at least..."
    "至少，本该是陌生人……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2652
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_bbf752f8_1:

    # "But, as I watch her sleep, a curious sensation begins to take root inside my heart."
    "可望着她的睡脸，一种奇妙的感觉，开始在心里慢慢生根。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2653
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_f14fcff6_1:

    # "I never imagined that I’d feel this way for Merel, but..."
    "从没想过，我会对梅蕾尔生出这种心情。可是……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2654
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_bb01b866_1:

    # Nienke "...You don’t play fair, you know?"
    Nienke "……你这样很犯规，知道吗？"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2655
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_25422d86_1:

    # "I murmur, my voice little more than a whisper."
    "我轻声呢喃，声音低得几乎只是气息。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2656
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_e8fe3c72_1:

    # Nienke "I didn’t want to like you, and I still don’t see any reason why I should. You invaded my life, and you’ve invaded my privacy."
    Nienke "我本来不想喜欢你，现在也找不出什么非喜欢你不可的理由。你闯进我的生活，连私人空间都占了。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2657
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_411d10aa_1:

    # Nienke "You’re so energetic, simply talking to you is a pain. I don’t know how to deal with you, and I’m not sure if I want to."
    Nienke "你精力那么旺盛，光是跟你说话都很累。我不知道怎么应付你，也不知道自己想不想应付。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2658
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_42c08935_1:

    # Nienke "You’re really annoying, actually..."
    Nienke "说真的，你很烦……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2659
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_3069cbb9_1:

    # Nienke "But, even so, you still have me wondering. Maybe you really aren’t that bad after all."
    Nienke "可即便这样，你还是让我忍不住想。也许，你没那么糟。"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2660
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_b8b44615_1:

    # "Merel, of course, doesn’t respond to my night time musing: my vulnerable display of insecurity. She’s fast asleep, her eyelids matted. She exhales softly, lowly, her head nestled against my pillow..."
    "当然，对于我深夜的自言自语，对于这点脆弱又不安的坦白，梅蕾尔没有回应。她紧闭着眼，早已熟睡，脑袋窝在我的枕头上，缓缓吐出轻轻的呼吸……"

# game/chapter2.rpyc:2661
translate zh_CN_portable_compat chapter2_11014b64_1:

    # "As, outside my bedroom window, a cool breeze softly blows."
    "卧室窗外，一阵凉风轻轻吹过。"

